(1086, 1, '2025-11-17 11:36:45', '2025-11-17 11:36:45', '<p>Massage Training Is Coming to Lemon Grove &#038; Chula Vista! Alva Beauty Collective Institute is taking a major step into the spa and wellness industry with the launch of our new Massage Therapy Program. Alongside our existing Esthetician program, we will now offer hands-on, spa-centered massage training at both campuses. A deeper, more complete entry into the luxury spa world is coming to Lemon Grove and Chula Vista. Enrollment opens soon!</p>\n', 'Massage is coming soon!', '<p>Massage Training Is Coming to Lemon Grove &#038; Chula Vista! Alva Beauty Collective Institute is taking a major step into the spa and wellness industry with the launch of our new Massage Therapy Program. Alongside our existing Esthetician program, we will now offer hands-on, spa-centered massage training at both campuses. A deeper, more complete entry into the luxury spa world is coming to Lemon Grove and Chula Vista. Enrollment opens soon!</p>\n', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'massage-is-coming-soon', '', '', '2025-11-17 11:36:45', '2025-11-17 11:36:45', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8888/rnd/2025/11/17/massage-is-coming-soon/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1087, 1, '2026-04-21 11:39:15', '2026-04-21 11:39:15', '<p>Have a job opening or volunteer opportunity to share? We invite organizations to submit their opportunities to us. Postings are displayed on campus and shared electronically with students and alumni who have opted in to receive these updates.</p>\n', 'Employment and Volunteer Opportunities', '<p>Have a job opening or volunteer opportunity to share? We invite organizations to submit their opportunities to us. Postings are displayed on campus and shared electronically with students and alumni who have opted in to receive these updates.</p>\n', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'employment-and-volunteer-opportunities', '', '', '2026-04-21 11:39:15', '2026-04-21 11:39:15', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8888/rnd/2026/04/21/employment-and-volunteer-opportunities/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1088, 1, '2025-10-06 11:40:14', '2025-10-06 11:40:14', '<p>We welcome licensed professionals and industry brands to join us as guest speakers and educators. Sharing your expertise with our students provides you with valuable exposure while offering our learners firsthand insight into advanced skills, techniques, and career pathways. These sessions not only enrich our students’ education but also create opportunities for alumni to connect with you for continued learning and advanced classes outside of campus.</p>\n', 'Special Guests', '<p>We welcome licensed professionals and industry brands to join us as guest speakers and educators. Sharing your expertise with our students provides you with valuable exposure while offering our learners firsthand insight into advanced skills, techniques, and career pathways. These sessions not only enrich our students’ education but also create opportunities for alumni to connect with you for continued learning and advanced classes outside of campus.</p>\n', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'special-guests', '', '', '2025-10-06 11:40:14', '2025-10-06 11:40:14', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8888/rnd/2025/10/06/special-guests/', 0, 'post', '', 0);
