(322, 3, 'post', '554', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/makeup-kit/', 'Makeup Kits', 50, 'done', 1, 995, '', '{\"id\":554,\"date\":\"2015-01-12T22:31:44\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-01-12T22:31:44\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=554\"},\"modified\":\"2015-01-12T22:31:44\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-01-12T22:31:44\",\"slug\":\"makeup-kit\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/makeup-kit\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Makeup Kits\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>Learn how to build an awesome makeup kit!<\\/h2>\\n<p>A good makeup kit is the key to a makeup artist&#8217;s success! Building a good makeup kit can seem nearly impossible but it doesn&#8217;t have to be!\\u00a0These helpful tips from\\u00a0Muse\\u00a0platform artist Ivan Betancourt will get you started on the right foot! We were surprised to learn that a common rookie mistake is buying a lot of bright crazy colors. Veteran makeup artists\\u00a0avoid doing this because good makeup is not cheap and bright colors are a waste of money! Not very many clients are going to want\\u00a0neon makeup and if they do, they will probably let you know when they are booking their appointment. Instead of bright trendy colors (which will go out of style quickly), Bentacourt suggests stocking your makeup kit with soft neutral\\u00a0colors that are more flattering to more skin tones. You\\u00a0will\\u00a0be able to use those shades on a lot more clients and therefore you will get more bang for your buck!<\\/p>\\n<p>Aspiring makeup artists need to see this article!!<\\/p>\\n<p>Have we told you how much we love our makeup partner\\u00a0<a title=\\\"Muse\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.musebeauty.pro\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Muse Beauty Pro<\\/a>? They\\u00a0carry the best makeup, and\\u00a0they also share our passion for education. Whether\\u00a0its\\u00a0a class for our students and staff, or an airbrush class taught to\\u00a0beauty industry professionals,\\u00a0we always learn so much when Alphonse or Malenda come to visit us for a class.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Makeup artists: please\\u00a0tell us in the comments what you consider your makeup kit must have items!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-556 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Brushes are the backbone to a good makeup kit\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><\\/a> Brushes are the backbone to a good makeup kit<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Learn how to build an awesome makeup kit! A good makeup kit is the key to a makeup artist&#8217;s success! Building a good makeup kit can seem nearly impossible but it doesn&#8217;t have to be!\\u00a0These helpful tips from\\u00a0Muse\\u00a0platform artist Ivan Betancourt will get you started on the right foot! We were surprised to learn that&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15],\"tags\":[24,25,26,12,27,28,29],\"class_list\":[\"post-554\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"tag-beauty-school\",\"tag-cosmetology\",\"tag-esthetics\",\"tag-makeup\",\"tag-makeup-kit\",\"tag-summit-salon-academy\",\"tag-tacoma\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/makeup-kit\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/makeup-kit\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Makeup Kits | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Makeup Kits\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2015\\\\\\/01\\\\\\/DSC_0085-199x300.jpg\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/makeup-kit\\\\\\/#articleImage\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2015-01-12T22:31:44-08:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2015-01-12T22:31:44-08:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/makeup-kit\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/makeup-kit\\\\\\/#webpag