(323, 3, 'post', '574', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/kett-airbrush-workshop/', 'KETT Airbrush Workshop', 50, 'done', 1, 996, '', '{\"id\":574,\"date\":\"2015-01-26T15:09:18\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-01-26T23:09:18\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=574\"},\"modified\":\"2015-01-26T15:09:18\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-01-26T23:09:18\",\"slug\":\"kett-airbrush-workshop\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/kett-airbrush-workshop\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"KETT Airbrush Workshop\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<div id=\\\"attachment_575\\\" style=\\\"width: 1010px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett.jpeg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-575\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-575 size-full\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Workshop Details\\\" width=\\\"1000\\\" height=\\\"1000\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett.jpeg 1000w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-400x400.jpeg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-600x600.jpeg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/kett-550x550.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-575\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Workshop Details<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<h2>KETT Airbrush Workshop by Muse Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>We are so excited\\u00a0to be hosting a\\u00a0<strong>Kett\\u00a0Airbrush Workshop<\\/strong> from our makeup partner,\\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.musebeauty.pro\\/\\\">Muse Beauty Pro<\\/a>! This one day workshop, taught by the <strong>AMAZING<\\/strong> Alphonse Wiebelt will teach the fundamentals of airbrush\\u00a0makeup. Muse Beauty are\\u00a0the exclusive educators for <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/kettcosmetics.com\\/\\\">KETT Cosmetics<\\/a>\\u00a0in the USA.<\\/p>\\n<p>The Muse Beauty KETT Airbrush Workshop will use a unique\\u00a0approach to education that is both informational and hands on. Attendees will learn how to color match, correct skin imperfections, how to highlight and contour, and also how to maintain airbrush equipment.\\u00a0A certificate is awarded upon completion of the class. All of the equipment you need will be provided for your use during the class.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>Discover the art of airbrush. KETT Airbrush Makeup\\u00a0Workshops\\u00a0are distinguished as the most comprehensive in the industry. You will work first-hand with professional airbrush equipment and experience a new level of creativity with an emphasis on makeup for photography, film, stage and HD. A fusion of traditional makeup and modern airbrush techniques that will deliver a precise, durable and diverse application.<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<h2>Why Airbrush?<\\/h2>\\n<p>As a professional, you will be able to enhance and upgrade\\u00a0what you already offer to your clients. Airbrush offers an even, sheer, and natural look without the visibility in fine-lines and pores that can happen with liquid or powder foundation.\\u00a0It is more sanitary because the makeup artist does not have as much physical contact with the skin. It is cost effective because less makeup is used for the same amount of coverage.\\u00a0This is a technique\\u00a0that is only going to grow in popularity as HD cameras become more\\u00a0common.<\\/p>\\n<h2>How do I sign up?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy is the only place in the Pacific Northwest that you can attend\\u00a0a KETT Airbrush Workshop. The workshop will take place on April 27, 2015 from 9:oo AM- 5:00 PM. Tuition is $395. Class space is extremely limited.\\u00a0Registration now closed.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>KETT Airbrush Workshop by Muse Beauty We are so excited\\u00a0to be hosting a\\u00a0Kett\\u00a0Airbrush Workshop from our makeup partner,\\u00a0Muse Beauty Pro! This one day workshop, taught by the AMAZING Alphonse Wiebelt will teach the fundamentals of airbrush\\u00a0makeup. Muse Beauty are\\u00a0the exclusive educators for KETT Cosmetics\\u00a0in the USA. The Muse Beauty KETT Airbrush Workshop will use a&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":575,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,19],\"tags\":[32,33,12,34,35,28],\"class_list\":[\"post-574\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-news-events\",\"tag-airbrush\",\"tag-kett-cosmetics\",\"tag-makeup\",\"tag-mua\",\"tag-muse-beauty-pro\",\"tag-summit-salon-academy\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/kett-airbrush-workshop\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/kett-airbrush-workshop\\\\\\/#article\