(328, 3, 'post', '808', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/beat-the-heat/', 'Beat the Heat', 50, 'done', 1, 1001, '', '{\"id\":808,\"date\":\"2015-05-29T14:34:22\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-05-29T22:34:22\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=808\"},\"modified\":\"2015-05-29T14:34:22\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-05-29T22:34:22\",\"slug\":\"beat-the-heat\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beat-the-heat\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Beat the Heat\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h1>Beat the Heat<\\/h1>\\n<p>Summer has arrived in the PNW! This weekend\\u00a0will be the hottest of the year! We have collected our favorite ways to cool down in the summer heat!<\\/p>\\n<p>Yes to Tinted Moisturizer! Who wants a cakey feeling full face of foundation on a hot day? Not us!\\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.dermalogica.com\\/\\\">Dermalogica<\\/a> makes a great line called <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.dermalogica.com\\/sheer-tint-spf20\\/145,default,pd.html?cgid=moisturizers&amp;start=8&amp;cgid=moisturizers\\\">Sheer Tint<\\/a>. It is available in three shades and is wonderful in the place of heavy foundation on a hot day! Plus it is 20 SPF so it will protect your skin as it perfects your skin! Which brings us to our next point.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>YES<\\/b> to sun protection! We cannot stress enough how important it is to wear sun protection on your skin. Even on a cloudy day it is so important to protect your skin from the sun&#8217;s harmful rays! Over exposure to sun can cause wrinkles and pre-mature aging in a best case scenario, and skin cancer in the worst case. \\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.skincancer.org\\/prevention\\/sun-protection\\/sunscreen\\/the-skin-cancer-foundations-guide-to-sunscreens\\\">Don&#8217;t believe us?\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/a>\\u00a0Make sure to reapply after swimming and any activity that causes sweating!<\\/p>\\n<p>Yes to extra fluids. When the temperature rises, it is so much easier to get dehydrated. Something as simple as an extra couple glasses of water a day can help boost your <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.webmd.com\\/diet\\/20040105\\/drinking-water-may-speed-weight-loss\\\">metabolism<\\/a>, fend off <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\\/pubmed\\/14979888\\\">headaches<\\/a>, and keep your skin from being <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.everydayhealth.com\\/news\\/unusual-signs-of-dehydration\\/\\\">dry!<\\/a>\\u00a0Plus it&#8217;s a great way to stay cool on a hot day.<\\/p>\\n<p>Yes to easy <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/vlGEnFVO1Sk?t=8s\\\">no fuss waves<\\/a>\\u00a0and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/FNlEHAIh6LQ\\\">messy\\u00a0braids<\\/a> to keep your hair looking hot in the heat! Even just pulling the sides back can help keep you cool!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>We hope that these tips will help keep you cool in the summer heat! Tell us below, what are your favorite summer beauty tips?<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Beat the Heat Summer has arrived in the PNW! This weekend\\u00a0will be the hottest of the year! We have collected our favorite ways to cool down in the summer heat! Yes to Tinted Moisturizer! Who wants a cakey feeling full face of foundation on a hot day? Not us!\\u00a0Dermalogica makes a great line called Sheer&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,23],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-808\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-tips-and-tricks\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beat-the-heat\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/beat-the-heat\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Beat the Heat | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Beat the Heat\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2015-05-29T14:34:22-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2015-05-29T14:34:22-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/beat-the-heat\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/beat-the-heat\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"articleSection\\\":\\\"Blog, Tips and Tricks\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/beat-the-heat\\\\\\/#breadcrumblist\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu#listItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\",\\\"nextItem\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/category\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/#listItem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/category\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/#listItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\