(331, 3, 'post', '881', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/4th-of-july-makeup/', '4th of July Makeup!', 50, 'done', 1, 1004, '', '{\"id\":881,\"date\":\"2015-07-02T15:47:52\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-07-02T23:47:52\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=881\"},\"modified\":\"2015-07-02T15:47:52\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-07-02T23:47:52\",\"slug\":\"4th-of-july-makeup\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/4th-of-july-makeup\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"4th of July Makeup!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h1>Makeup Looks for the 4th of July!<\\/h1>\\n<p>We asked our Day <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\">Esthetics<\\/a>\\u00a0students to come\\u00a0up with some patriotic makeup\\u00a0to celebrate the 4th of July beauty industry style. Little did we know that our socks were about to be rocked right off! We don&#8217;t want to brag, but we have some pretty darn awesome budding makeup artists around here! Thank you ladies for these\\u00a0fantastic looks in observance of Independence day!<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_882\\\" style=\\\"width: 212px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-882\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-882\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4-202x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"4th of July Makeup\\\" width=\\\"202\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4-202x300.jpg 202w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4-768x1141.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4-689x1024.jpg 689w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework-4-269x400.jpg 269w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonaca