>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_887\\\" style=\\\"width: 220px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-887\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-887\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-210x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"4th of July Makeup\\\" width=\\\"210\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-210x300.jpg 210w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-768x1096.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-717x1024.jpg 717w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-280x400.jpg 280w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-420x600.jpg 420w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6-550x785.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/07\\/firework6.jpg 971w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-887\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Artist: Saoirse L<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h2>Call today!<\\/h2>\\n<p>You can make an appointment with any of these talented ladies for makeup, facials, peels, waxing and more by calling 253-617-7000. We take clients in the Esthetics treatment room Tuesday- Saturday! They book up quickly, so make sure to call to reserve your appointment today!<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Get started on your way to a beautiful career!<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"p3\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">If you want to do fun stuff like this, and be just like these talented ladies, The Summit Salon Academy, formerly The Salon Professional Academy, will equip\\u00a0you with the technical and business skills to thrive in this amazing industry.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p3\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">For more information contact Karen in Admissions by phone or text at\\u00a0253-617-7010 or email <a href=\\\"mailto:Karen@summitsalonacademy.edu\\\"><span class=\\\"s2\\\">Karen<\\/span><\\/a>.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Makeup Looks for the 4th of July! We asked our Day Esthetics\\u00a0students to come\\u00a0up with some patriotic makeup\\u00a0to celebrate the 4th of July beauty industry style. Little did we know that our socks were about to be rocked right off! We don&#8217;t want to brag, but we have some pretty darn awesome budding makeup artists&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[19,53],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-881\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-news-events\",\"category-trends\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/4th-of-july-makeup\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@