(335, 3, 'post', '958', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/kits/', 'Kits', 50, 'done', 1, 1008, '', '{\"id\":958,\"date\":\"2015-09-24T11:05:35\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-09-24T19:05:35\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=958\"},\"modified\":\"2018-05-31T02:39:31\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-05-31T02:39:31\",\"slug\":\"kits\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/kits\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Kits\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>It&#8217;s time for student kits!<\\/h2>\\n<p>There are many awesome days at school, but we are pretty sure, if most of our students had to choose their favorite day, it would be kit day. Kit day is the day that they get a whole bunch of\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/test-your-beauty-tools-knowledge\\/\\\">awesome tools and goodies<\\/a> that will aid in becoming stylists and skin therapists. In all honesty, it&#8217;s one of our favorite days too, the excitement is pretty infectious!\\u00a0If you&#8217;ve been in lately, you may have noticed some big grins on the students walking around. That is because, in the\\u00a0last couple of weeks, we have had TWO kit days, one for our September Cosmetology Class and one for our August Esthetics Class.<\\/p>\\n<p>Now, we don&#8217;t like to brag, but we think that our student kits are pretty darn sweet. We understand how vital\\u00a0good tools are to a good end result.\\u00a0We want you to graduate feeling confident and inspired. To do this we have aligned The Academy with some of the industry\\u2019s best brands. We\\u2019re excited to be a <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.redken.com\\/\\\">Redken <\\/a>Premier School, <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.dermalogica.com\\/\\\">Dermalogica <\\/a>Partnership School, <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.pcaskin.com\\/\\\">PCA<\\/a> Associate School and have a partnership with <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.samvilla.com\\/\\\">Sam Villa<\\/a>, and <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.musebeauty.pro\\/\\\">Muse Beauty. Pro<\\/a> \\u2013 industry leaders in professional makeup artistry.\\u00a0We\\u2019re always looking for ways to stay current. We believe that the use of digital technology is important to the\\u00a0beauty\\u00a0industry. All our student kits include an\\u00a0iPad so you can create your own digital\\u00a0portfolio and begin marketing your talents using social media!<\\/p>\\n<p>If you are interested in following your passion in <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> or <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\">esthetics<\\/a>, contact <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/courses\\/\\\">Karen<\\/a> in admissions. Call or text: 253-617-7010 email: <a href=\\\"mailto:karen@summitsalonacademy.edu\\\">karen@summitsalonacademy.edu<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_556\\\" style=\\\"width: 209px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-556\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-556 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Esthetician courses &amp; Make-up aplication classes\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/01\\/DSC_0085-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-556\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Makeup Brushes!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1321\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1321\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1321 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-300x269.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Academy-Kit-RH-WEB\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"269\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-300x269.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-768x687.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-447x400.jpg 447w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-670x600.jpg 670w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB-550x492.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Academy-Kit-RH-WEB.jpg 800w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1321\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Sam Villa Cosmetology Kit!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_959\\\" style=\\\"width: 209px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-959\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-959\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/09\\/DSC_0122-e1443119619367-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Dermalogica Kits are very nice!\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/09\\/DSC_0122-e1443119619367-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/09\\/DSC_0122-e1443119619367-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/09\\/DSC_0122-e1443119619367-678x1024.jpg 67