(336, 3, 'post', '971', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/scholarship-winners/', 'Scholarship Winners', 50, 'done', 1, 1009, '', '{\"id\":971,\"date\":\"2015-10-23T13:14:15\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-10-23T21:14:15\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=971\"},\"modified\":\"2015-10-23T13:14:15\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-10-23T21:14:15\",\"slug\":\"scholarship-winners\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/scholarship-winners\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Scholarship Winners\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Great News from Summit!! We have two recent scholarship winners!<\\/p>\\n<p>Big Congratulations to Taylor Anne Riekena and Joanna Hill!<\\/p>\\n<h2><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.joefrancis.com\\/\\\">Joe Francis<\\/a> Scholarship<\\/h2>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_973\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignright\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-973\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-973\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-300x214.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Scholarship Winner Taylor Anne\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-768x548.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-1024x731.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-561x400.jpg 561w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-841x600.jpg 841w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/taylor-550x392.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-973\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Taylor Anne Pictured with owners Karen and Michael<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>Joe Francis (1933-1994), founder of The Barbers Corporation was the quintessential self-made man who never forgot his early struggles and continuously looked for ways to help others find opportunities in the salon business. To memorialize his life and achievements, The Joe Francis Haircare Cosmetology Scholarship Foundation was established in 1994 by his wife of 39 years, Flo Francis, and the many people whom he advised and mentored to their own success in the industry.<\\/p>\\n<p>The foundation&#8217;s mission is to &#8220;To help deserving students receive financial assistance for the professional training necessary to build a successful careers in Cosmetology Industry.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p>24 students across the United States each received a $1,200 Joe Francis Haircare Scholarship toward tuition costs for cosmetology education. Since its inception 18 years ago, the Joe Francis Haircare Scholarship Foundation has awarded over a quarter million dollars in scholarships.<\\/p>\\n<p>Taylor Anne Riekena was chosen as a recipient of this scholarship for 2015!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h2><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/beautychangeslives.org\\/\\\">Beauty Changes Lives<\\/a> Scholarship<\\/h2>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_974\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignright\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-974\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-974\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-300x244.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Scholarship winner Beauty school Tacoma\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"244\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-300x244.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-768x625.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-1024x834.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-491x400.jpg 491w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-737x600.jpg 737w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/10\\/DSC_0116-550x448.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-974\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Joanna pictured with owners Karen and Michael<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>The Beauty Changes Lives Foundation, established by AACS, celebrates the rich and rewarding careers in beauty and wellness and\\u00a0helps to make dreams come true with scholarship opportunities for those looking to pursue and further develop a career in beauty &amp; wellness.<\\/p>\\n<p>To date, BCL has raised over $3 million in cash and in-kind donations and\\u00a0has awarded over<em>$756,000<\\/em> in<strong> <a title=\\\"Scholarships\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/beautychangeslives.org\\/scholarships\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">scholarships<\\/a>\\u00a0<\\/strong>for basic and advanced cosmetology, nail, and massage therapy education programs.<\\/p>\\n<p>The Vidal Sassoon Professional Beauty Education Scholarship Program \\u2013 Basic competition is designed for prospective and newer students.<\\/p>\\n<p>Competition rounds are each Spring and Fall. \\u00a0Each competition awards ten winners with\\u00a050% of their program tuition costs\\u00a0covered at a\\u00a0<a title=\\\"Find a Qualifying School\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/beautycareerlink.beautyschools.org\\/\\\">qualifying cosmetology school<\\/a> (up to $10,000).<\\/p>\\n<p>Joanna Hill was one of the 10 winners of this scholarship!<\\/p>\\n<p>Great work ladies!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>If you are interested in attending Summit Salon Academy, please call Karen at 253-617-7010!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Great News from Summit!! We have two recent scholarship winners! Big Congratulations to Taylor Anne Riekena and Joanna Hill! Joe Francis Scholarship Joe Francis (1933-1994), founder of The Barbers Corporation was the quintessential self-made man who never forgot his early struggles and continuously looked for ways to help others find opportunities in the salon business&#8230;.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":972,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[19],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-971\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-news-events\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/scholarship-winners\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/scholarship-winners\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Scholarship Winners | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Scholarship Winners\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacade