(338, 3, 'post', '983', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/innovations-makeover-photos-for-2015/', 'Innovations Makeover Photos for 2015', 50, 'done', 1, 1011, '', '{\"id\":983,\"date\":\"2015-11-16T10:33:56\",\"date_gmt\":\"2015-11-16T18:33:56\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=983\"},\"modified\":\"2015-11-16T10:33:56\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2015-11-16T18:33:56\",\"slug\":\"innovations-makeover-photos-for-2015\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/innovations-makeover-photos-for-2015\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Innovations Makeover Photos for 2015\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Innovations is one of our more fun modules. It happens towards the end of the Cosmetology Program. This module allows students to creatively use all that they have learned about styling and makeup. They are given the opportunity to conceive of and then\\u00a0to create two drastically different looks on (usually) the same model. Check out their FANTASTIC work! We can&#8217;t wait to see what this year brings!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Innovations- January 2014<\\/h2>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_995\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-995\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-995\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-300x217.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Innovations\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"217\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-300x217.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-768x556.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-1024x741.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-553x400.jpg 553w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-829x600.jpg 829w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara-550x398.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/sara.jpg 1635w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-995\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Model: Sara J<br \\/>Stylist: Adriann A<br \\/>Inspiration: Flapper \\/ Cleopatra<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_990\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-990\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-990\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-300x221.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Innovations\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"221\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-300x221.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-768x565.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-1024x753.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-544x400.jpg 544w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-816x600.jpg 816w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey-550x404.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/kelsey.jpg 1632w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-990\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Model: Kelsey Z<br \\/>Stylist: Jeanette H<br \\/>Inspiration: Butterfly \\/ Pappillon<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_984\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/adriann.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\