(340, 3, 'post', '1154', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/sugaring/', 'Sweet as sugaring', 50, 'skipped', 1, 994, 'Already imported as post 994. Turn on \"Update posts that were imported before\" to refresh it.', '{\"id\":1154,\"date\":\"2016-06-03T11:41:39\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-06-03T19:41:39\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1154\"},\"modified\":\"2016-06-03T11:41:39\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-06-03T19:41:39\",\"slug\":\"sugaring\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/sugaring\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Sweet as sugaring\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>Sugaring Hair Removal!<\\/h2>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1355\\\" style=\\\"width: 235px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1355\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1355 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-225x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Before and After Sugaring\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/01\\/reniel-e1464971028499-550x733.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1355\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Before and After!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy is\\u00a0super excited to share that we are now offering <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.sugarofthenile.com\\/\\\">Sugar of the Nile<\\/a> Sugaring Hair Removal Services in our Esthetics Department! What is sugaring? And more importantly, why should you have this service? Keep reading to learn more!<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">All Natural<br \\/>\\n<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Sugaring is an all natural alternative to waxing. The sugar mixture used is comprised of sugar, water and lemon juice. These ingredients are tolerated by almost everyone, and allergic reaction is very uncommon. This method of hair removal has been around\\u00a0along time.\\u00a0It was common in the Persian Empire around the turn of 19th Century.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\">Safe<\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Sugar melts at body temperature, which means that we can sugar\\u00a0clients with skin that is sensitive to heat. Sugaring is also totally safe for clients with diabetes! The mixture doesn&#8217;t stick to the skin. It only sticks to the hair that we are removing. Sugaring is safe for the whole body: arms, legs, face, you can sugar it!\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\">\\u00a0Before you get Sugared<\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Make sure to exfoliate before you come in. The hair to be removed should be at least 1\\/8 inch long. \\u00a0That is shorter than the minimum for waxing! Which means that you have less of that awkward grow out stage! Heck yeah!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\">Results<\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Hair that has been sugared tends\\u00a0to last longer than hair that has been waxed. Your hair free glory can last anywhere from 3-6 weeks. Plus when your hair grows back, it is less dense and more fine!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\">Want to be sugared?<\\/h3>\\n<p>You can have anything sugared! Lips, Brows, Full Legs, Back, Bikini even\\u00a0Brazilians &#8211; prices vary per service.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\">Call our front desk at <a href=\\\"tel:2536177000\\\">253-617-7000<\\/a> to schedule today! Starting prices range from $11 for a lip wax to $40 for a Brazilian.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"s1\\\">How it works<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Your student skin therapist will cleanse the body part that is going to be eppilated. Then apply powder to help the mixture glide over the skin. Finally, s\\/he will mold the sugar mixture in the opposite direction of your hair growth which allows mixture\\u00a0to reach\\u00a0the follicle much more efficiently than wax. When the mixture is flicked up in the direction of the hair growth, it takes a lot more hair with it. Because it won&#8217;t stick to your skin, the hair is\\u00a0<\\/span><span class=\\\"s1\\\">less prone to breakage! This means that more hair is pulled out at the root for a \\u00a0<\\/span>more efficient ellpilation of hair.<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1356\\\" style=\\\"width: 212px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1356\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1356 \\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-229x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0003\\\" width=\\\"202\\\" height=\\\"265\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-229x300.jpg 229w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-768x1005.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-782x1024.jpg 782w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-306x400.jpg 306w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-458x600.jpg 458w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0003-550x720.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 202px) 100vw, 202px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1356\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">What we will use!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1357\\\" style=\\\"width: 187px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1357\\\" class=\\\" wp-image-1357\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Step 1. Cleanse and Powder\\\" width=\\\"177\\\" height=\\\"267\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0004-e1464971398159-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 177px) 100vw, 177px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1357\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Step 1- Cleanse and Powder<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1358\\\" style=\\\"width: 186px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1358\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1358 \\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0005\\\" width=\\\"176\\\" height=\\\"265\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0005-e1464971421238-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1358\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Step 2- Apply sugar mixture in the opposite direction of hair growth<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1359\\\" style=\\\"width: 186px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1359\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1359 \\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0006\\\" width=\\\"176\\\" height=\\\"265\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0006-e1464971521649-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1359\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Step 3- Flick Sugar mixture up in the direction of hair growth<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1362\\\" style=\\\"width: 186px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1362\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1362 \\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0010\\\" width=\\\"176\\\" height=\\\"265\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0010-e1464971593318-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 176px) 100vw, 176px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1362\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">End result- Smooth and hair-free skin with minimal irritation!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\"><\\/h3>\\n<h3 class=\\\"p1\\\">Want to learn a little more? Check out this article &#8211;\\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.huffingtonpost.com\\/2015\\/07\\/01\\/sugaring-hair-removal-treatment-pain-what-is-it_n_7697128.html\\\">read more.<\\/a><\\/h3>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Sugaring Hair Removal! Summit Salon Academy is\\u00a0super excited to share that we are now offering Sugar of the Nile Sugaring Hair Removal Services in our Esthetics Department! What is sugaring? And more importantly, why should you have this service? Keep reading to learn more! All Natural Sugaring is an all natural alternative to waxing. The&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featur