n\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/1166\\/revisions\"}],\"predecessor-version\":[{\"id\":2958,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/1166\\/revisions\\/2958\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/1167\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=1166\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=1166\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=1166\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"1166\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar\\/\",\"dest_id\":1012,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2016\\/02\\/11\\/hair-bra-zaar\\/\",\"title\":\"Hair BRA-Zaar\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":4,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 10:50:22'),
(342, 3, 'post', '1179', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/new/', 'New at Summit!', 50, 'done', 1, 1013, '', '{\"id\":1179,\"date\":\"2016-03-14T14:59:56\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-03-14T22:59:56\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1179\"},\"modified\":\"2016-03-14T14:59:56\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-03-14T22:59:56\",\"slug\":\"new\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/new\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"New at Summit!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>New!<\\/h2>\\n<p>We have some very exciting new and exciting things around here! We always strive to offer the services that our guests and students are clamoring for! Read all about\\u00a0three new services that we think you are going to love!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h3><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.sunlightsbalayage.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Balayage<\\/a>!! Um, wait&#8230; what exactly IS Balayage anyway?<\\/h3>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM.png\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1193 alignright\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM-300x271.png\\\" alt=\\\"Screen Shot 2016-03-14 at 3.23.18 PM\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"271\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM-300x271.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM-443x400.png 443w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM-550x496.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.23.18-PM.png 595w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1192\\\" style=\\\"width: 234px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignright\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1192\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1192\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-224x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"New Balayage\\\" width=\\\"224\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-224x300.jpg 224w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-768x1028.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-765x1024.jpg 765w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-299x400.jpg 299w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-448x600.jpg 448w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754-550x736.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/logan-e1457994495754.jpg 1936w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 224px) 100vw, 224px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1192\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Student Logan doing his Balayage Model<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>Balayage is a French world that translates literally to &#8220;sweep&#8221;. It is a free form creative lightening or\\u00a0hair\\u00a0painting. \\u00a0This is not a new technique, its been around for years but has seen a surge in popularity in the past few years. Balayage was created to mimic the natural sun kissed look that we all love in the Summer! How does it differ from\\u00a0a highlight? The stylist has more control and is able to create a look that suits your hair and style. \\u00a0Our favorite thing is that there is no hard line as your hair grows out. What that means for you is that you can go A LOT longer in-between appointments! Instead of the 4-8 weeks that is recommended for a highlight, you can go up to 4 months in between balayage appointments! Balayage starts at $50!<\\/p>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/pravana.com\\/hair-color\\/chromasilk-vivids\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Pravana<\\/a>!!<\\/h3>\\n<p>One of the most common requests we get is for BRIGHT COLORS! This is where Pravana comes in. With this color line, we can give you those new, bright vivid colors that you crave! Just a few things to keep in mind with Pravana: it is a<span class=\\\"s2\\\">\\u00a0high maintenance hair color-think of it more as a hair stain. It can be difficult (or impossible) to remove from the hair depending on the condition of your hair and the color used. It can also (and\\u00a0frequently does) fade with every shampoo, and the fading is even more pronounced if you aren&#8217;t using a good professional shampoo and conditioner. It may be a little bit temperamental, but the color pay off is really something to see! With this color, we can create the pastel, bright, or neon hair color of your dreams! If you are feeling adventuresome, give Pravana a try! Call 253-617-7000 to schedule a consultation to see if Pravana is right for you!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1194\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1194\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1194\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-300x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Color by Student Ondriea P! \\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea-550x550.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/ondriea.jpg 960w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1194\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Color by Student Ondriea P!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1197\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1197\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1197 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-300x199.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0015\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"199\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-768x509.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-604x400.jpg 604w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-906x600.jpg 906w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/DSC_0015-550x364.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1197\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Just look at all the color options available!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><\\/h3>\\n<h3><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.olaplex.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Olaplex<\\/a>!!<\\/h3>\\n<p>Last but not least in the list of new services at Summit is Olaplex!\\u00a0Olaplex is an additive that eliminates the bad reaction oxygen has with broken sulfite bonds in chemically treated hair that leads to breakage. Olaplex is going to make your hair stronger, healthier, and your color will last longer.\\u00a0Will the bonds that were created eventually break and cause your\\u00a0hair to then break? Nope!\\u00a0Even if you completely stop using Olaplex, the disulfide link that Olaplex offered is permanent. The condition of the hair there after, depends on how you treat your\\u00a0hair.\\u00a0Olaplex starts at $15.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM.png\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1196\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-300x165.png\\\" alt=\\\"Screen Shot 2016-03-14 at 3.46.55 PM\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"165\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-300x165.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-768x422.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-1024x562.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-728x400.png 728w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-1092x600.png 1092w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM-550x302.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-14-at-3.46.55-PM.png 1138w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Call our front desk at 253-617-7000 to schedule one of these appointments today!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>New! We have some very exciting new and exciting things around here! We always strive to offer the services that our guests and students are clamoring for! Read all about\\u00a0three new services that we think you are going to love! &nbsp; Balayage!! Um, wait&#8230; what exactly IS Balayage anyway? Balayage is a French world that&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1193,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1179\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/new\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/new\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"New at Summit! | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"New at