(343, 3, 'post', '1202', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/silent-auction-preview/', 'Silent Auction Preview', 50, 'done', 1, 1014, '', '{\"id\":1202,\"date\":\"2016-03-29T09:05:45\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-03-29T17:05:45\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1202\"},\"modified\":\"2016-03-29T09:05:45\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-03-29T17:05:45\",\"slug\":\"silent-auction-preview\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/silent-auction-preview\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Silent Auction Preview\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h1>Auction Preview!<\\/h1>\\n<p>Our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar\\/\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar<\\/a> is fast approaching and we have been busily collecting all kinds of goodies for our silent auction! Check out the preview! We think these items are AMAZING! And we bet that you will too! If you are interested in bidding on these items, get your <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/hairbrazaarsummit.bpt.me\\\">tickets <\\/a>today! Check back, we will be adding new items as they come in!<\\/p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Two <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.wsucougars.com\\/\\\">Washington State University<\\/a> End-zone Football Tickets<\\/li>\\n<li>One Night Stay in a Jacuzzi or Fireplace Suite at the <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.innatgigharbor.com\\/\\\">Inn at Gig Harbor<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li>Handcrafted Necklace by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/pamelaphelpsjewelry\\/\\\">Pamela Phelps Designs<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li>Admission for Four to <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.zoo.org\\/\\\">Woodland Park Zoo<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.samvilla.com\\/products\\/hair-irons\\/sleekr-straightening-iron\\\">Sam Villa<\\/a> Straightening Iron<\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.keurig.com\\/Brewers\\/Home\\/Keurig%C2%AE-2-0-K200-Brewing-System\\/p\\/keurig-2-0-k250-brewing-system\\\">Keurig K200<\\/a> Brewing Machine<\\/li>\\n<li>Tickets for two to <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.seattleshakespeare.org\\/\\\">Seattle Shakespeare<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li>Admission for four to <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.empmuseum.org\\/\\\">Experience Music Project<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li>Admission for two to <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.silverwoodthemepark.com\\/\\\">Silverwood Theme Park<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h3>Don&#8217;t miss the chance at all of these fantastic items and more!<\\/h3>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/Screen-Shot-2016-03-29-at-9.24.18-AM.png\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1204 alignleft\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"wsu\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-150x150.png 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-768x768.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-400x400.png 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-600x600.png 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu-550x550.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/wsu.png 800w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1205 alignleft\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/innatgig-300x166.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"innatgig\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"166\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/innatgig-300x166.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/innatgig-768x424.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/03\\/innatgig-724x400.jpg 724w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu