(345, 3, 'post', '1222', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/bye-breast-cancer/', 'Summit BYE BYE to Breast Cancer!', 50, 'done', 1, 1016, '', '{\"id\":1222,\"date\":\"2016-04-14T13:58:05\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-04-14T21:58:05\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1222\"},\"modified\":\"2016-04-14T13:58:05\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-04-14T21:58:05\",\"slug\":\"bye-breast-cancer\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/bye-breast-cancer\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Summit BYE BYE to Breast Cancer!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1180 alignleft\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-300x109.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"SSA Tacoma - April Fashion Show Web Slider2 1100x400\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"109\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-300x109.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-768x279.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-1024x372.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-800x291.jpg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400-550x200.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2014\\/05\\/SSA-Tacoma-April-Fashion-Show-Web-Slider2-1100x400.jpg 1100w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Breast Cancer affects so many people. We would like nothing more than to eradicate it. This is why, on April 6th, things were BRAzarre around Summit. After months of preparation, we presented\\u00a0the First Annual Hair BRA-Zaar! It was a fun evening benefitting <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.wingsofkaren.org\\/\\\">Wings of Karen\\u00a0<\\/a>\\u00a0Breast Cancer research. \\u00a0Our talented students and Alumni did AMAZING hair and makeup looks on models wearing decorated bras. \\u00a0Models were Academy Students and Breast Cancer Survivors that\\u00a0WORKED the runway! Lisa Petite spoke to the crowd about Wings of Karen&#8217;s mission. It was an awesome and emotional night. One of the most powerful moments of the evening was when each of the survivors shared their story. Instead of being sad, it was inspirational, hopeful, and joyous. We are so grateful that we were able to\\u00a0share in their journey!<\\/p>\\n<p>This was the kick off to the Wings of Karen 5k Bra Dash. What is that you ask? It\\u00a0is more than a 5k &#8230; it&#8217;s a race to save lives. 100% of proceeds will directly fund promising local\\u00a0breast cancer research. Participants are encouraged to wear a bra over their race day shirt and toss it triumphantly at the finish line, symbolizing the spirit needed to find a cure. A fun, family event where all are welcome.\\u00a0If you would like to get involved, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/5k-bra-dash\\/\\\">please join our team<\\/a> for the bra dash! Our team name is Summit Salon Academy! <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/secure.qgiv.com\\/event\\/576578\\/\\\">Register here.\\u00a0<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Another highlight was the Silent Auction! Thank you to:\\u00a0Blazing Onion,\\u00a0Bling Jewels For You by Traci Lynn,\\u00a0Children\\u2019s Museum of Tacoma,\\u00a0Emerald Downs,\\u00a0Daniel Keane,\\u00a0Deana Faust,\\u00a0EMP,\\u00a0Family Fun Center,\\u00a0Hands on Children\\u2019s Museum Olympia,\\u00a0Katlin Coyne,\\u00a0Keurig,\\u00a0Madison Phelps,\\u00a0Maryhill Winery,\\u00a0Muse Beauty Pro,\\u00a0Museum of Glass,\\u00a0Northwest Railway,\\u00a0NYP Bar and Grill,\\u00a0Pamela Phelps Designs,\\u00a0Salon Centric,\\u00a0Salon Services,\\u00a0Seafair,\\u00a0Seattle Shakespeare,\\u00a0Silverwood Theme Park,\\u00a0Stampin\\u2019 Up,\\u00a0Stevens Pass,\\u00a0Sticks and Stone,\\u00a0Sunset World,\\u00a0Tacoma Comedy Club,\\u00a0Tacoma Rainiers,\\u00a0The Inn at Gig Harbor,\\u00a0Tim\\u2019s Cascade Chips,\\u00a0Urban Float,\\u00a0Washington Floral Service,\\u00a0Washington State University,\\u00a0Wild Waves,\\u00a0Woodland Park Zoo, and Zoobooks for your generous donations!<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\">Delicious treats were provided by: Melon Seed,\\u00a0Rachel Mae, Starbuck\\u2019s Lincoln Plaza and Picasso Catering!<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\">Guests took home AWESOME swag bags that we filled with goodies donated by Salon Services and Salon Centric! We love you guys!!<\\/p>\\n<p>All proceeds from the show and auction go\\u00a0directly to\\u00a0The Wings of Karen Foundation to further their mission to support breast cancer research in our area. And we are ECSTATIC to say that we raised $6242 dollars for Wings of Karen!<\\/p>\\n<p>Thank you to our students, survivor models, and staff for putting on one heck of a show! Thank you to the donors and sponsors for your generous support! And a HUGE thank you for everyone that came out and opened up your hearts (and wallets) to support the Wings of Karen Foundation!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1223\\\" style=\\\"width: 209px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1223\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1223 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Breast Cancer Survivor Victoria Doyle\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0527-e1460656080595-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1223\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Photo: Jana Hawkins<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1255\\\" style=\\\"width: 209px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1255\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1255 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Breast Cancer Survivor Sydney Berry\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1255\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Photo: Jana Hawkins<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1257\\\" style=\\\"width: 209px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0869-e1460656009307.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1257\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1257 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-199x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Breast Cancer Survivor Allison Day\\\" width=\\\"199\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-199x300.jpg 199w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-768x1160.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-678x1024.jpg 678w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/DSC_0903-e1460656026718-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1257\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Photo: Jana Hawkins<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1261\\\" style=\\\"width: 210px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/160406_0045_Hair-Brazaar_Summit-Salon-Academy-Tacoma.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1261\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1261 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/160406_0045_Hair-Brazaar_Summit-Salon-Academy-Tacoma-200x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Breast Cancer Survivor Gailene Magnuson\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" he