(347, 3, 'post', '1308', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/beauty-operative/', 'Beauty Operative', 50, 'done', 1, 1018, '', '{\"id\":1308,\"date\":\"2016-04-28T16:08:06\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-04-29T00:08:06\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1308\"},\"modified\":\"2016-04-28T16:08:06\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-04-29T00:08:06\",\"slug\":\"beauty-operative\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beauty-operative\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Beauty Operative\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<div id=\\\"attachment_1309\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1309\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1309\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-300x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Patti, Milady Beauty Operative\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/04\\/patti-550x550.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/a><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1309\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Patti D, Milady Beauty Operative<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<h2>Beauty Operative!<\\/h2>\\n<p>We are very\\u00a0excited for\\u00a0Cosmetology Student, Patti D! She was one of a select few chosen as a Milady Beauty Operative.<\\/p>\\n<p>Milady is the number one provider of beauty and wellness learning solutions for schools all over the world. We are proud to include their products in our student kit!<\\/p>\\n<p>From Milady: \\u201cThe Beauty Operative Research Program was established to help us at Milady understand your life and the challenges and successes you encounter as you attend beauty and wellness classes. Our hope is that this research will help us to design products and services that are engaging and delightful to students.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>During the rest of her education, Patti will\\u00a0work with Milady. She will give valuable feedback about her experience\\u00a0in beauty school, and how her textbook works for her and her classmates. The information she gives to Milady will help them determine\\u00a0the future of their\\u00a0products.<\\/p>\\n<p>It is exciting that one of our students can proudly say she was\\u00a0instrumental in making the Cosmetology Education great for future generations!<\\/p>\\n<p>They made a great choice with Patti! She is a hardworking, diligent and\\u00a0conscientious student! Patti&#8217;s hard work shows in the fact that she is a level 3 student!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.milady.cengage.com\\/beautyoperative\\/index.html\\\">Click<\\/a> for more information about the program.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Beauty Operative! We are very\\u00a0excited for\\u00a0Cosmetology Student, Patti D! She was one of a select few chosen as a Milady Beauty Operative. Milady is the number one provider of beauty and wellness learning solutions for schools all over the world. We are proud to include their products in our student kit! From Milady: \\u201cThe Beauty&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1309,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_chang