(351, 3, 'post', '1338', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/sam-villa/', 'Sam Villa', 50, 'done', 1, 1022, '', '{\"id\":1338,\"date\":\"2016-05-26T07:32:15\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-05-26T15:32:15\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1338\"},\"modified\":\"2016-05-26T07:32:15\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-05-26T15:32:15\",\"slug\":\"sam-villa\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/sam-villa\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Sam Villa\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1343 alignleft\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-238x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB\\\" width=\\\"238\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-238x300.jpg 238w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-768x967.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-318x400.jpg 318w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-477x600.jpg 477w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB-550x692.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Sam-Villa-B-W-Shear-WEB.jpg 800w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 238px) 100vw, 238px\\\" \\/>It was pretty amazing to host a\\u00a0<strong>SOLD OUT <\\/strong>Sam Villa<strong>\\u00a0<\\/strong>Design Trend Class on Monday May 16th. Several alum were here for the class, including one special grad, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.samvilla.com\\/pro\\/blog\\/sam-villa-introduces-the-show-ambassador-team\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Joseph<\\/a>\\u00a0Longmore\\u00a0who works for Sam Villa as a Show Ambassador now! We always love to get caught up with our grads!<\\/p>\\n<p>The most exciting part of having Sam in the house is that he stayed\\u00a0here after the\\u00a0class for a private meet and greet\\/ seminar with Summit Students and recent grads! He showed the students a variety of tips and tricks for styling, up-styling, and cutting.\\u00a0He also gave them the benefit of his experience\\u00a0with a long career in the industry! After the seminar, he stayed to shake hands and pose for selfies with the students!<\\/p>\\n<p>We really love Sam around here, especially his tools. In fact, we love them\\u00a0so much that\\u00a0every <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> student\\u00a0kit\\u00a0contains <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.samvilla.com\\/home\\/\\\">Sam<\\/a> Villa brushes, combs, blow dryer, flat iron, clips, shears,\\u00a0texturizing shears,\\u00a0razor and DVDs! Sam has a special relationship and commitment to what we do at Summit Salon Academy. Our students are given\\u00a0access to Sam Villa on Demand, which contains tons of training videos that inspire!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.redken.com\\/sites\\/brands\\/redken\\/pro-(redkensalon,-d-,com)\\/home\\/redken-education\\/redken-exchange\\/instructors\\/sam-villa\\\">From Redken<\\/a>: Known as the hairdresser\\u2019s hairdresser, Sam was chosen as the industry\\u2019s Favorite Platform Artist and Educator at the prestigious Stylist Choice Awards in 2007 and again in 2011. Sam possesses a unique blend of technical and artistic skills \\u2013 a contagious spirit that draws people in and makes them want to learn.<\\/p>\\n<p>Sam has more than 30 years teaching experience and is currently at the top of his game as Redken\\u2019s Education Artistic Director and Chairman of his own digital education and styling tools company. Part of the Redken family for the past 16 years, Sam is in constant demand at international and domestic trade shows and in-salon programs where his progressive teaching approach enables stylists to absorb new techniques quickly and for practical use in the salon. Sam is a lead Facilitator at the Redken Exchange in New York City where he teaches a variety of design and trend sessions to salon professionals from around the world. Sam is also part of the team that trains the entire Redken artist network worldwide.<\\/p>\\n<p>Sam Villa now has a complete line of digital education and premium styling tools under his own name. His products are designed to complement his teaching techniques and deliver career enhancing and ergonomic benefits for the stylist. \\u00a0Sam graduated from Ponce Beauty School in San Mateo, California. Growing up in his Dad\\u2019s barbershop, Sam never considered the hair industry as a career choice until he saw his first hair show and it changed his mind forever. Sam went on to open Avant Hair Studio, an award-winning salon in the San Francisco Bay area, which he called home for 20 years.<\\/p>\\n<p>Thank you Sam for inspiring our students! This was not an experience that they will soon forget!<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1347\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1347\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1347\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sam Villa updos\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos-150x150.png 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos-400x400.png 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos.png 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/updos-550x550.png 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1347\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">A couple of the styles Sam showed us!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1346\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1346\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1346\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sam Villa haircut before and after\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba-150x150.png 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba-400x400.png 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba.png 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/hcba-550x550.png 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1346\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Before and after of the haircut Sam demonstrated!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1342\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1342\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1342 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-300x199.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Sam got snuggly with student Sara! \\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"199\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-768x509.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-604x400.jpg 604w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-906x600.jpg 906w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0098-550x364.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1342\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Sam got snuggly with student Sara!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1344\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1344\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1344\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-300x199.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Group high-five!\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"199\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-768x509.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-604x400.jpg 604w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-906x600.jpg 906w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0128-550x364.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1344\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Group high-five!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1341\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1341\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1341\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-300x199.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Owners Karen and Michael with Sam\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"199\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-768x509.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-604x400.jpg 604w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-906x600.jpg 906w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/DSC_0039-550x364.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1341\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Owners Karen and Michael with Sam<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1339\\\" style=\\\"width: 250px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1339\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1339\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Screen-Shot-2016-05-24-at-1.56.53-PM-240x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sam Villa (center) Current Student Beth , and grad Joseph! \\\" width=\\\"240\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Screen-Shot-2016-05-24-at-1.56.53-PM-240x300.png 240w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Screen-Shot-2016-05-24-at-1.56.53-PM-320x400.png 320w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/Screen-Shot-2016-05-24-at-1.56.53-PM.png 479w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1339\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Sam Villa (center) Current Student Beth , and grad Joseph!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1340\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1340\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1340 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/05\\/samcollage-300x225.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"samcollage\\\" width=\\