(352, 3, 'post', '1371', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/4th-of-july-makeup-ideas/', 'Red, White and Beautiful', 50, 'done', 1, 1023, '', '{\"id\":1371,\"date\":\"2016-06-28T16:18:24\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-06-29T00:18:24\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1371\"},\"modified\":\"2018-04-30T16:48:42\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-04-30T16:48:42\",\"slug\":\"4th-of-july-makeup-ideas\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/4th-of-july-makeup-ideas\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Red, White and Beautiful\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>July 4th Summer Makeup Ideas<\\/h2>\\n<h4>4th of July is that perfect time to try out that cherry red color you have been daring yourself to use or that sexy blue eyeshadow with the addition of stars or stripes!<\\/h4>\\n<p>It&#8217;s almost 4th of July, and we know what that means: BBQ&#8217;s, fireworks, and an all around good time! Around here, it also means time for makeup!\\u00a0If you have been searching\\u00a0for the perfect\\u00a0makeup look to complement your 4th of July outfit, we say, go big or go home! Independence Day only comes once a year, so why not go all out?<\\/p>\\n<p>Our Cosmetology and Esthetics students have been working hard, and having a blast coming up with some fun makeup looks to inspire you! Have we mentioned how much we love this\\u00a0industry? All of our looks were created using <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/kettcosmetics.com\\/\\\">KETT Hydro Color Theory<\\/a> makeup!<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Have a safe and beautiful fourth of July! Don&#8217;t forget to share your favorite look on our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/SummitSalonAcademyTacoma\\\">Facebook page<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1372\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0072-214x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"DSC_0072\\\" width=\\\"214\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\