1-265x400.jpg 265w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0076-1-397x600.jpg 397w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/06\\/DSC_0076-1-550x830.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<hr \\/>\\n<h2 class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Get started on your way to a beautiful career!<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"p3\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">The Summit Salon Academy, formerly The Salon Professional Academy, equips future cosmetology and esthetics students, like you, with the technical and business skills to thrive in this amazing industry.\\u00a0We want to challenge you to be your best!\\u00a0So \\u2026 we bring you our Passion, Knowledge, Dedicated staff, Top notch Training Systems and Professional Partnerships.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Our\\u00a0Summit Salon Academy is passionate about delivering the kind of education that makes a difference in the lives of our students and the industry at large. Our curriculum is designed to teach not only the technical skills needed to become a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">Cosmetologist<\\/a> or Esthetician but also the essential business and customer service skills vital to growing a clientele in the professional beauty industry. In addition we prepare our students to pass the Washington State Board licensing exam.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p3\\\"><span class=\\\"s1\\\">For more information contact Karen in Admissions by phone or text at\\u00a0<a href=\\\"tel:2536177010\\\">253-617-7010<\\/a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:Karen@summitsalonacademy.edu\\\"><span class=\\\"s2\\\">Karen<\\/span><\\/a>.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>July 4th Summer Makeup Ideas 4th of July is that perfect time to try out that cherry red color you have been daring yourself to use or that sexy blue eyeshadow with the addition of stars or stripes! It&#8217;s almost 4th of July, and we know what that means: BBQ&#8217;s, fireworks, and an all around&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15],\"tags\":[32,114,115,12],\"class_list\":[\"post-1371\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"tag-airbrush\",\"tag-inspiration\",\"tag-kett\",\"tag-makeup\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/4th-of-july-makeup-ideas\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/4th-of-july-makeup-ideas\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Red, White and Beautiful | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Red, White and Beautiful\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2016\\\\\\/06\\\\\