(353, 3, 'post', '1390', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/beautiful-july/', 'Beautiful July: then and now', 50, 'done', 1, 1024, '', '{\"id\":1390,\"date\":\"2016-07-22T14:27:45\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-07-22T22:27:45\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1390\"},\"modified\":\"2016-07-22T14:27:45\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2016-07-22T22:27:45\",\"slug\":\"beautiful-july\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beautiful-july\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Beautiful July: then and now\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>One of the best perks of working in the Beauty Industry is the ability to reinvent your look as often as you want! With the tools and knowledge at their fingertips, cosmetologists change their style up ALL THE TIME. Our students are no different.<\\/p>\\n<p>Today the July 2015 class is graduating, and to celebrate, here are pictures of the day they started next to pictures from the past couple of weeks! Some of them are almost unrecognizable! We think they look great, then and now!<\\/p>\\n<p>Thank you to the July to Class for granting us the privilege of helping you start your career. We are so proud of each of you, and we can&#8217;t wait to see what amazing things you will do!<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1402\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1402\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1402\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-300x214.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Congratulations ladies!\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-768x549.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-1024x731.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-560x400.jpg 560w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-840x600.jpg 840w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/july-grad-550x393.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1402\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Congratulations ladies!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1401\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1401\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1401 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-300x225.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Beth\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"225\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-768x576.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-533x400.jpeg 533w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-800x600.jpeg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-Before-and-After.011-550x413.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1401\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Beth<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1400\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1400\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1400 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/07\\/July-Grad-B