(355, 3, 'post', '1460', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/all-about-our-students/', 'All About Our Students', 50, 'done', 1, 1026, '', '{\"id\":1460,\"date\":\"2016-10-24T09:48:09\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-10-24T17:48:09\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1460\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:54:57\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:54:57\",\"slug\":\"all-about-our-students\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/all-about-our-students\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"All About Our Students\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h1><\\/h1>\\n<p>When making the decision to enroll in <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology school<\\/a>, there are probably qualities that you, as students, and your parents look for in a school. At Summit Salon Academy-Tacoma, our goal is to provide the tools and support that our students will need to build a successful career in the beauty industry.<\\/p>\\n<h3>We Value You<\\/h3>\\n<p>Something that sets Summit Salon Academy apart from the others is the sense of kinship we build with our students. We want to give you more than an education, we want to give you a place where you feel comfortable to express your creativity. Providing a safe space where you feel that you can be yourselves is of the utmost importance to us.<\\/p>\\n<h3>We Celebrate You<\\/h3>\\n<p>It&#8217;s always nice to get recognized for your accomplishments. We take pride in the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/category\\/summit-super-stars\\/\\\">success of our students<\\/a> and we like to celebrate your achievements. We gather daily to announce individual wins and discoveries, to recognize birthdays, and to share any pertinent updates. Our students know that their hard work never goes unnoticed.<\\/p>\\n<h3>We Inspire You<\\/h3>\\n<p>On the 2nd Tuesday of each month, we gather and bring in guest speakers. These speakers are often artists, graduates, salon owners and experts of the industry that share their wisdom with our future professionals. We have seen the inspiration and motivation that transpires in these gatherings. It&#8217;s a fun event for our students that gives them the motivation to fulfill their aspirations.<\\/p>\\n<h3>We Support Your Growth<\\/h3>\\n<p>Each one of our students is assigned to an Educator Team. This gives you a go-to person for individual coaching and mentoring. You will meet monthly to review your progress and to plan strategies for future success. Our staff encourages the students to be open about any difficulties they may be experiencing. Moving beyond technical skills, we also provide business-building skills that are key to a well-rounded education. We want you to have the tools you need to grow your career as a stylist.<\\/p>\\n<p>Ultimately, we are here for you. We wouldn\\u2019t be where we are now if it weren\\u2019t for our students! Cosmetology school is a rewarding endeavor. However, it does come with its challenges; we never want you to feel alone in times of challenge! Does our school sound like the right fit for you? <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> and schedule a tour today!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>When making the decision to enroll in cosmetology school, there are probably qualities that you, as students, and your parents look for in a school. At Summit Salon Academy-Tacoma, our goal is to provide the tools and support that our students will need to build a successful career in the beauty industry. We Value You&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1478,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1460\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/all-about-our-students\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/all-about-our-students\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"All About Our Students | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"All About Our Students\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2016\\\\\\/10\\\\\\/14690826_883742641757361_261715497616582949_n.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":940,\\\"height\\\":788},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2016-10-24T09:48:09-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2019-04-02T06:54:57-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"commentCount\\\":4,\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/all-about-our-students\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/all-about-our-students\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"articleSection\\\":\\\"Blog, Social Promoter\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"@id\\\"