(356, 3, 'post', '1464', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-month-alexandra-brown/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Alexandra Brown', 50, 'done', 1, 1027, '', '{\"id\":1464,\"date\":\"2016-10-24T09:46:37\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-10-24T17:46:37\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1464\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T07:04:10\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T14:04:10\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-month-alexandra-brown\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-month-alexandra-brown\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alexandra Brown\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we believe that highlighting our students in one of the best ways to help them grow in confidence. All of our students shine, but this month we wanted to feature a cosmetology student who really stood out. The social promoter for the month of October is <strong>Alexandra Brown<\\/strong>! Congrats, Alexandra!<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Alexandra<\\/h2>\\n<p>Alexandra loves to share her passion for hair with her clients.<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cI love cutting hair! I know the feeling of removing dead weight off of my shoulders and how refreshing it feels to get a new cut. Nothing I love more than cutting inches off of a client[!]\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>We love to hear what our students enjoy the most about their programs. Alexandra shared her personal fav:<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201c[I] feel my forte is ethnic hair and natural styling but I&#8217;ve been told I can kill a color appointment! Creativity and hair color go hand in hand. You&#8217;re the artist, it&#8217;s up to you!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1465\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-169x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"alex-blonde-hair-dye-job\\\" width=\\\"169\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-768x1365.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-225x400.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-338x600.jpg 338w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1-550x978.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork1.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Cosmetology is the perfect program to express yourself and your artistic dreams. Our excitement for people like Alexandra is uncontainable! In addition to hearing her favorite part of cosmetology in general, we wanted to hear what Alexandra thought about the program, and get her feedback on her favorite part of the instruction.<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cUp do&#8217;s! You have to put your creative cap on and create. Taking technical skills and your mind, you never know what you&#8217;ll end up with.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Alexandra Chose Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>\\u201cI chose this school because I love the owners and [the] culture they have created in the school. It&#8217;s all about the school and the teachers belie[ve] in you to be something great.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>During our student\\u2019s time here, we try to ensure that they are not only getting a thorough education, but that they are making friends, becoming even more passionate, and creating lasting relationships with clients, students, and staff members.<\\/p>\\n<p>Client relationships are some of the most important connections you can make. As a cosmetologist, they can make or break your career. We asked Alexandra why clients should book with her, how she makes clients comfortable, and what sets her apart from other stylists they might book with.<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cMy chair is the place to be because I love to laugh and have fun with my clients! Not only will they get a great service with a more than satisfying outcome, but they will have someone they can call their friend. Who doesn&#8217;t need more of those?\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Alexandra also said,<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cLaughter is the perfect medicine, it also makes for the perfect icebreaker.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Alexandra went on to tell us what made her unique, \\u201cMy style and individuality. I try to keep a sharp and fresh look every week. If I don&#8217;t look new and try new things on my self then how can my clients trust me to take them to new levels[?]\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignright size-medium wp-image-1466\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-169x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"alexs work pink hair dye job\\\" width=\\\"169\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-768x1365.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-225x400.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-338x600.jpg 338w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2-550x978.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexbrownwork2.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>What the Future Holds<\\/h2>\\n<p>We love when our students set goals. Summit Salon Academy Tacoma believes that goals help shape our students into prosperous professionals in the future. Alexandra has big dreams when it comes to her future:<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cOwn my own shop. A lot of people don&#8217;t know but I love barbering and braiding. So a barbershop is definitely in the works. On the other hand I will always be available for all types of services via freelance.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cI graduate next August, so new clients will have plenty of time with me!\\u201d Alexandra joked. We are happy to see her excel in her program, and we wish her the best on all her future endeavors!<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1467\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-225x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"alex work hair pink\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-768x1023.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-769x1024.jpg 769w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3-550x733.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/alexwork3.jpg 961w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>To see more of Alexandra and her work, check her out on Facebook: Alexandra Brown.<\\/p>\\n<p>Keep it up Alexandra!<\\/p>\\n<p>If you\\u2019re interested in starting our cosmetology program, or any of our other programs, feel free to contact us for more information!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we believe that highlighting our students in one of the best ways to help them grow in confidence. All of our students shine, but this month we wanted to feature a cosmetology student who really stood out. The social promoter for the month of October is Alexandra Brown! Congrats, Alexandra!&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1992,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1464\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-month-alexandra-brown\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-month-alexandra-brown\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alexandra Brown | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alexandra Brown\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/up