(357, 3, 'post', '1475', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/rockstar-grad/', 'Congrats Kelsey!', 50, 'done', 1, 1028, '', '{\"id\":1475,\"date\":\"2016-10-21T13:11:57\",\"date_gmt\":\"2016-10-21T21:11:57\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1475\"},\"modified\":\"2018-04-30T17:00:08\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-04-30T17:00:08\",\"slug\":\"rockstar-grad\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/rockstar-grad\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Congrats Kelsey!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h1>Rockstar Grad<\\/h1>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1476\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1476\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-1476 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/kelseyknutson-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Rockstar Grad Kelsey\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/kelseyknutson-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/kelseyknutson.jpg 540w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1476\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Kelsey Knutson, Summit Salon Academy Grad<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>We could not be more\\u00a0proud of grad\\u00a0Kelsey Knutson if we tried! Kelsey graduated from Summit&#8217;s <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> in\\u00a0November 2015. Since graduation\\u00a0she has\\u00a0been taking the industry by storm! Kelsey is currently working as a stylist at Annie Fisher Hair in Seattle, WA. She works\\u00a0hard behind the chair, doing weddings, and fashion and hair shows. She is\\u00a0also a certified Framesi Technician which means she travels to other salons to educate stylists how to use Framesi\\u00a0color and products. In her free time, Kelsey\\u00a0does freelance photoshoots and weddings.\\u00a0Earlier this year Kelsey received a nomination for \\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/villemagazine.com\\/seattle-style-night\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Northwest Hairstyling Awards&#8217; Newcomer of the Year<\\/a>!\\u00a0This is an annual award, and only professionals in the industry can make nominations. Each nominee submits a photo showcasing their best work. A selection of industry professionals across the country judge the photos and chose three finalists.<\\/p>\\n<p>Kelsey said of the nomination, &#8220;It was a great experience coming up with my own concept, team, and of course hair.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p>Kelsey&#8217;s submission was an impressive feat of hairstyling! This is an actual cage made of hair that Kelsey\\u00a0worked on over the course of a few weeks. The day of the photoshoot, she incorporated all of the model&#8217;s\\u00a0natural hair, so the whole thing took a lot of time and collaboration.<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_1477\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignleft\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1477\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-1477\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-300x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\" Hair: Kelsey Knutson Photography: Olivia Lazer Makeup: Aajenee McLeod Model: Amy Glaskova\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n-550x550.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2016\\/10\\/14794241_10208666806722407_195203609_n.jpg 960w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1477\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\"><br \\/>Hair: Kelsey Knutson<br \\/>Photography: Olivia Lazer<br \\/>Makeup: Aajenee McLeod<br \\/>Model: Amy Glaskova<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Keep up the great work Kelsey! We can&#8217;t wait to see what you will do next! The one thing we know is that you will continue to make us proud!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Rockstar Grad We could not be more\\u00a0proud of grad\\u00a0Kelsey Knutson if we tried! Kelsey graduated from Summit&#8217;s cosmetology program in\\u00a0November 2015. Since graduation\\u00a0she has\\u00a0been taking the industry by storm! Kelsey is currently working as a stylist at Annie Fisher Hair in Seattle, WA. She works\\u00a0hard behind the chair, doing weddings, and fashion and hair shows&#8230;.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1477,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[19],\"tags\":[25,120],\"class_list\":[\"post-1475\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-news-events\",\"tag-cosmetology\",\"tag-grads\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.co