INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(360, 3, 'post', '1620', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Catherine Cortez Porter', 50, 'done', 1, 1031, '', '{\"id\":1620,\"date\":\"2017-01-12T10:09:34\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-01-12T18:09:34\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1620\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T07:03:45\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T14:03:45\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Catherine Cortez Porter\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We love to celebrate our students\\u2019 success! This month, we\\u2019re happy to announce that one of our amazing esthetics students has been named the Social Promoter of the Month! Congrats, Catherine Cortez Porter!<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1621\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-169x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"catherine cortez porter\\\" width=\\\"169\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-225x400.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-338x600.jpg 338w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704-550x978.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4704.jpg 720w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>About Catherine<\\/h2>\\n<p>All of our students enjoy school for different reasons. Some really like to learn new skills, some like to help clients gain confidence, and some like it all! Catherine shared with us her favorite part of school, \\u201cMy favorite part of the Esthetics program [is] learning to perform facials and hair removal. I love the specific steps of a facial, the customized products for each individuals skin care needs and amazingly enough it was relaxing for me to perform them. Hair removal with wax and sugar [is] my second favorite. There&#8217;s something satisfying about removing hair and achieving smooth hairless skin!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>We are happy that Catherine finds personal rewards in client services. Client communication and satisfaction are some of what we cover in our esthetics program. We asked Catherine why clients should book with her and how she makes her clients feel comfortable, \\u201cClients should definitely book appointments with me because they will always receive a prompt, professional and relaxing service. If you happen to need someone to just vent to or talk to as well, I&#8217;m an excellent listener.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignright size-medium wp-image-1622\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730-288x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"catherine\'s eyebrow service\\\" width=\\\"288\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730-288x300.jpg 288w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730-385x400.jpg 385w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730-577x600.jpg 577w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730-550x572.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4730.jpg 748w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 288px) 100vw, 288px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cI always approach everyone with a smile and handshake or a hug if I know you. We then do a thorough client consultation so I know exactly what the client is looking for and expects from the service. Confidence and trust always make the client feel at ease and comfortable.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Catherine Chose Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>\\u201cAfter looking at 3 other schools Summit Salon and Academy was the best choice for me because of the location and the curriculum. They&#8217;re one of the only schools to offer a sugaring certification. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/about-us\\/staff\\/\\\">Karen Shea<\\/a> also did a great job answering all my questions and was very informative.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>It is always encouraging to hear our students\\u2019 thoughts about Summit Salon Academy. With feedback from our students, we can continue to grow and improve for future students!<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cMy favorite assignment at school was right in the beginning of [] the course. We had to create models\\/pictorials in any medium of our choice, of the anatomy of the skin and the bones of the skull. I have a BA in Graphic Design so it was nice to apply some of those art skills.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1623\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719-288x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"catherine\'s esthetics service\\\" width=\\\"288\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719-288x300.jpg 288w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719-384x400.jpg 384w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719-575x600.jpg 575w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719-550x574.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/01\\/IMG_4719.jpg 745w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 288px) 100vw, 288px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>What the Future Holds<\\/h2>\\n<p>We wanted to give Catherine a chance to do a little bragging about her skills. She said, \\u201cMy specialties would be facials, peels and hair removal. Again I love facials and peels because they&#8217;re very step specific. In order to have a successful facial or peel it&#8217;s essential to perform every single step of the that service, to achieve the desired end result.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Catherine also commented on what sets her apart from other estheticians.<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cI&#8217;m confident, knowledgeable, professional and have a strong work ethic. My ultimate goal is to provide my client with a relaxing, stress free, results oriented service that they&#8217;re completely satisfied with. Happy clients guarantee a return appointment!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Catherine graduates in February 2017. Make sure to stop into our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">student spa and salon*<\\/a> and book with her before she\\u2019s gone!<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u201cI&#8217;m ready to tackle the Esthetician industry and continue my education. Esthetics has so much to offer and I&#8217;m ready for the journey. You can check me out on Instagram at @ckc46.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*All services are performed by students supervised by licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We love to celebrate our students\\u2019 success! This month, we\\u2019re happy to announce that one of our amazing esthetics students has been named the Social Promoter of the Month! Congrats, Catherine Cortez Porter! About Catherine All of our students enjoy school for different reasons. Some really like to learn new skills, some like to help&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1986,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1620\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Catherine Cortez Porter | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Catherine Cortez Porter\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2017\\\\\\/01\\\\\\/IMG_4704-1.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":711,\\\"height\\\":728,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"Catherine Cortez Porter from Summit Salon Academy Tacoma\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2017-01-12T10:09:34-08:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2019-04-02T07:03:45-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"commentCount\\\":1,\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"htt