mmitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/1620\\/revisions\\/1987\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/1986\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=1620\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=1620\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=1620\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"1620\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\/\",\"dest_id\":1031,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2017\\/01\\/12\\/social-promoter-month-catherine-cortez-porter\\/\",\"title\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Catherine Cortez Porter\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":16,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":1,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 10:52:09'),
(361, 3, 'post', '1633', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/hair-brazaar-goes-heroic/', 'Hair Brazaar goes HEROIC', 50, 'done', 1, 1032, '', '{\"id\":1633,\"date\":\"2017-02-20T17:16:56\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-02-21T01:16:56\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=1633\"},\"modified\":\"2019-07-22T11:03:38\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-07-22T18:03:38\",\"slug\":\"hair-brazaar-goes-heroic\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-brazaar-goes-heroic\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Hair Brazaar goes HEROIC\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h3><span style=\\\"color: #df2b82\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar Goes Heroic!<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"s1\\\">April 19<sup>th<\\/sup>, 2017-<\\/span><span class=\\\"s1\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar and Auction Benefit<\\/span>.<\\/p>\\n<p>The show is a fun way for us to raise money for\\u00a0Wings of Karen, a local breast cancer research organization.<\\/p>\\n<p>This year the show is going HEROIC! \\u00a0This promises to be an awesome runway show! Our students and alumni are hard at work creating amazing\\u00a0hair and makeup looks!\\u00a0Models will wear decorated bras to tie in with Wings of Karen&#8217;s annual <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.wingsofkaren.org\\/#!4thbradash\\/c1bl5\\\">Bra Dash.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"color: #df2b82\\\">Why Wings of Karen?<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"p2\\\">All proceeds from the event will help support the Wings of Karen Foundation. Wings of Karen is a grassroots organization that strongly believes donors should know how their hard earned dollars are turned into tangible hope. Because they believe it\\u2019s a race to save lives, they have set high standards for themselves to keep fundraising costs low, administration costs to the absolute minimum and delivery of all crucial funds to world class researchers locally who are vigilantly searching for the cure. The mission of this community based organization is to fund promising breast cancer research in the Pacific North West. They are committed to finding a cure, while empowering and educating women with a positive, helping hand.<span class=\\\"s2\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>If you&#8217;re interested in learning more about the Wings of Karen foundation and its founder Kristi Blair, <a href=\\\"\\/how-our-hair-bra-zaar-events-help-fight-breast-cancer\\/\\\">click here<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p2\\\">In 2013, Wings of Karen awarded its first grant of $30,000 to Seattle Cancer Care Alliance to fund a pilot program that studies new methods of detection in younger women. Since then, Wings of Karen has granted over a half million dollars to promising breast cancer research. Without this funding, many of these projects would not happen. <span class=\\\"s1\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>For more information about the Wings of Karen Foundation, <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.wingsofkaren.org.\\\">please visit\\u00a0their website.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p2\\\">We are hoping to raise more than the $6242 we raised at last year&#8217;s <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/bye-breast-cancer\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Hair\\u00a0Brazaar<\\/a> \\u00a0for Wings of Karen! Please come out, enjoy the hero inspired show and help us combat Breast Cancer right here in our own backyard!<\\/p>\\n<p>With each year, our Hair BRA-Zaar event has grown and we couldn&#8217;t be prouder of what we&#8217;ve accomplished during the event each year. Read more about our Hair BRA-Zaar events.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar: Under the Big Top<\\/a><br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"\\/hair-bra-zaar-wigs-out-event\\/\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar: Wigs Out<\\/a><br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"\\/hair-bra-zaar\\/\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p2\\\">Details:<\\/p>\\n<p>April 19th from 6:30 \\u2013 8:00pm, Doors open at 6:00pm<\\/p>\\n<p>Tickets: General seating $20, limited VIP seating $40 (includes gift bag)<\\/p>\\n<p>Purchase your tickets\\u00a0at the academy or <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/hairbrazaargoesheroic.bpt.me\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">online<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Where: Summit Salon Academy<br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps?daddr=3702%20South%20Fife%20Street+Tacoma+WA+98409\\\">3702 S Fife ST Suite B102<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>For more info: <a href=\\\"tel:253.617.7000\\\">253.617.7000<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1634\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/02\\/brazaarFB-Post-300x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"brazaarFB Post\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/02\\/brazaarFB-Post-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/02\\/brazaarFB-Post-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/02\\/brazaarFB-Post-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/02\\/brazaarFB-Post.jpg 403w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Hair BRA-Zaar Goes Heroic! April 19th, 2017-Hair BRA-Zaar and Auction Benefit. The show is a fun way for us to raise money for\\u00a0Wings of Karen, a local breast cancer research organization. This year the show is going HEROIC! \\u00a0This promises to be an awesome runway show! Our students and alumni are hard at work creating&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":1634,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,19],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1633\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"