(368, 3, 'post', '2132', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/spom-jasmine-beltran', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Jasmine Beltran', 50, 'done', 1, 1039, '', '{\"id\":2132,\"date\":\"2017-08-16T17:52:07\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-08-16T17:52:07\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"http:\\/\\/summit.oozlethemes.com\\/?p=2132\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T07:00:39\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T14:00:39\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-jasmine-beltran\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/spom-jasmine-beltran\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Jasmine Beltran\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we know that the careers of our students begin long before graduation. They begin in the classroom with skills and successes that are bolstered and celebrated by both staff and fellow students.<\\/p>\\n<p>We know that a core for a successful future starts with skills but also depends on the work the student does outside of that. Business management, branding, marketing &#8211; they are all skills that we foster and grow in our curriculum.<\\/p>\\n<p>Each month we feature one student who has taken those skills and utilized them to begin building a future beyond their skill. Our Social Promoter of the Month for July is Jasmin Beltran.<\\/p>\\n<h2><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-1725\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/08\\/jb.png\\\" alt=\\\"Meet Jasmine Beltran\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"420\\\" \\/>Meet Jasmine<\\/h2>\\n<p>Jasmine is focused on her clients as an esthetics student here at Summit. The fact that she loves her clients is clear when she said, <b>\\u201cI want them to feel as if we are in a real salon environment with my professionalism.\\u201d<\\/b> That\\u2019s so great to hear, Jasmine! We want each of our visitors to our salon to feel taken care of and pampered, and that spirit is sure to do just that!<\\/p>\\n<p>That dedication to her clients is apparent in everything she does, with an intense love of sugaring, Jasmine has mastered the skill.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>\\u201cI love challenges and it is probably the most challenging thing I&#8217;ve had to do and accomplished it.\\u201d<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>It\\u2019s that tenacious spirit that really sets Jasmine apart. She is always willing to challenge herself, but she still keeps the ultimate goal in mind: the clients.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>\\u201cI love that we have the power to make [people] feel beautiful and confident about themselves. My favorite service is a facial because clients can immediately feel and see the difference in their skin.\\u201d<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<h2><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignright wp-image-1726\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/08\\/jb2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Meet Jasmine Beltran\\\" width=\\\"310\\\" height=\\\"310\\\" \\/>Why Jasmine Chose Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>Jasmine fell in love with Summit Salon Academy from the moment she stepped through our doors. After touring many other facilities she knew Summit would be her home for the next few months, saying, <b>\\u201cI loved the positive energy in the school.\\u201d<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>It wasn&#8217;t long before Summit truly became her home. The staff and students feel like family with all of the amazing support they give to each other; building each other up through lessons, and supporting each other through struggles.<\\/p>\\n<p>It\\u2019s a supportive energy you can\\u2019t find anywhere else.<\\/p>\\n<h2>What Lies Ahead for Jasmine<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-1727\\\" src=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/08\\/jb3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Meet Jasmine Beltran\\\" width=\\\"310\\\" height=\\\"434\\\" \\/>Jasmine has always had a firm plan ahead of her. Driven to always exceed her own skill level, she has done amazing things in her time at Summit Salon Academy. It is a skill that will serve her well in the next stop on her journey.<\\/p>\\n<p>With plans to move to California to work in her sister\\u2019s spa, she already has her future in line. It is one of the many reasons we are proud of Jasmine and all she has accomplished here. Not only has she become successful at her social media management, she has grown into her role as a future business owner.<\\/p>\\n<p>We wish her luck as she sugars all of California<\\/p>\\n<p>If you would like to check out Jasmine\\u2019s work, make sure to follow her on Instagram @jasbeautyskincare<\\/p>\\n<p>If you would like to schedule an appointment with Jasmine, <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">call our student salon* <\\/a>today, you don\\u2019t want to miss her!<\\/p>\\n<p>You can get amazing services from Jasmine, or any of our esthetics students. We are ready to pamper you and give you a true spa experience.<\\/p>\\n<p>Congratulations, Jasmine. We wish you luck in all you do! You will always be a member of the Summit Salon Tacoma family.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*All services performed by students under the direct supervision of licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we know that the careers of our students begin long before graduation. They begin in the classroom with skills and successes that are bolstered and celebrated by both staff and fellow students. We know that a core for a successful future starts with skills but also depends on the work&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2127,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2132\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/spom-jasmine-beltran\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/spom-jasmine-beltran#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Jasmine Beltran | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Jasmine Beltran\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2017\\\\\\/08\\\\\\/jb.png\\\",\\\"width\\\":360,\\\"height\\\":504,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"Student Work at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2017-08-16T17:52:07-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2019-04-02T07:00:39-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/spom-jasmine-beltran#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/spom-jasmine-beltran#webpage\\\"},\\\"articleSection\\\":\\\"Social Promoter\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/spom-jasmine-beltran#breadcrumblist\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@typ