INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(371, 3, 'post', '2188', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/Promoter+of+Month+Amanda+Rupright', 'Student Promoter of the Month: Amanda Rupright', 50, 'done', 1, 1042, '', '{\"id\":2188,\"date\":\"2017-10-23T21:02:08\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-10-23T21:02:08\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2188\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:59:34\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:59:34\",\"slug\":\"student-promoter-of-the-month-amanda-rupright\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Promoter+of+Month+Amanda+Rupright\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Student Promoter of the Month: Amanda Rupright\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we strive to build our students into professionals, prepared to showcase their talent and build their own business. To help them prepare for that, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">our programs<\\/a> include more than your standard education in the cutting, styling and care of a clients hair and skin.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>By devoting time to an education in business skills, we help our students build the knowledge they need to find success.<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>It is because of this focus on business skills, and our desire to see our students succeed, that each month we recognize a student who has gone above and beyond to build their brand and prepare for a beautiful future.<\\/p>\\n<p>This month we are proud to recognize Amanda Rupright in her work, and dedication toward her future.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Meet Amanda<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-2189\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-576x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Amanda Rupright, Social Promoter October 2017\\\" width=\\\"238\\\" height=\\\"424\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-225x400.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-337x600.jpg 337w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005-550x978.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_0005.jpg 750w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 238px) 100vw, 238px\\\" \\/>A passionate student with lots of heart, Amanda loves each and everyone of her clients. In fact, she strives to bring a little sunshine to their day, if not with a new beautiful cut and color, but with her trademark jokes. <b>\\u201cI can crack a joke with my client but also keep it professional and friendly,\\u201d<\\/b> she says.<\\/p>\\n<p>It\\u2019s that professionalism that sets her services apart. That, and the extra care she takes during the shampoo process, giving each of her clients a nice scalp massage, ensuring that they have the best experience, and a little bit of relaxation.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Amanda\\u2019s Specialty<\\/h2>\\n<p>A lover of color, Amanda has found a passion in the coloring process and creating new custom looks for her clients. From a bold blue, to a shimmering undertone of red, Amanda has challenged herself to do it all, in every shade of the rainbow.<\\/p>\\n<p>Her love of creating color is clear. When asked about her favorite assignment at school she replied with, <b>\\u201dWe took a mannequin with four different colors and formulated colors [to] make the whole mannequin one single color. It was fun and challenging and it made formulated color so much easier.\\u201d<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Amanda Chose Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignright wp-image-2192\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-1024x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Red undertoned hair\\\" width=\\\"424\\\" height=\\\"424\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570-550x550.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1570.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 424px) 100vw, 424px\\\" \\/>Tacoma is home to Amanda, and when the time came to pursue her dreams, she knew she wanted to stay close to home.<\\/p>\\n<p>After visiting all of the cosmetology schools in the area, Amanda was drawn to Summit Salon Academy because <b>\\u201cI wanted the best education close to where I live, and [Summit Salon Academy] did just that.\\u201d<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>Thank you so much for the kind words, Amanda! At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we strive to bring the highest quality education to our students, and we are glad Amanda saw that commitment in us.<\\/p>\\n<p>It is a commitment and dedication we work to bring to every class, and to every student.<\\/p>\\n<h2>What\\u2019s Ahead for Amanda<\\/h2>\\n<p>While Amanda\\u2019s graduation is still a few months off, she already has her eye set on a career in a few local salons that she has patronized for years.<\\/p>\\n<p>Dedicated to her community, Amanda will stay close to her Tacoma neighborhood, bringing her services to the friends, family, and new clients that have supported her through the years, and through her education.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>If you would like to see more of Amanda\\u2019s work, follow her on instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/amandarupright94\\/\\\">@amandarupright94<\\/a><\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-2193\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-1024x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Girl with several tight bantu buns on head\\\" width=\\\"324\\\" height=\\\"324\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617-550x550.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/10\\/IMG_1617.jpg 1980w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 324px) 100vw, 324px\\\" \\/>Congratulations Amanda on all you have accomplished in your time at Summit Salon Academy, we look forward to seeing all of the amazing things you build in your remaining time with us.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">Schedule your service<\\/a> with Amanda, or any of our talented students, in our student salon* today.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*All services performed by students under the direct supervision of licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we strive to build our students into professionals, prepared to showcase their talent and build their own business. To help them prepare for that, our programs include more than your standard education in the cutting, styling and care of a clients hair and skin. By devoting time to an education in&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2253,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[140,138,139],\"class_list\":[\"post-2188\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-business-skills\",\"tag-social-promoter-or-the-month\",\"tag-star-student\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Each month Summit Salon Academy Tacoma recognizes a student for their accomplishments in branding and promotion. Meet Amanda Rupright.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Promoter+of+Month+Amanda+Rupright\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/Promoter+of+Month+Amanda+Rupright#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Student of the Month: Amanda Rupright | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Student Promoter of the Month: Amanda Rupright\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#