INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(372, 3, 'post', '2199', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/November+17+Social+Promoter+of+the+month', 'Student Promoter of the Month: Ayriss Tysdal', 50, 'done', 1, 1043, '', '{\"id\":2199,\"date\":\"2017-11-14T21:21:42\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-11-14T21:21:42\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2199\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:58:17\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:58:17\",\"slug\":\"student-promoter-of-the-month-ayriss-tysdal\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/November+17+Social+Promoter+of+the+month\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Student Promoter of the Month: Ayriss Tysdal\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we love our students! We love seeing them grow and develop from the beauty-passionate individuals they are, into career-ready professionals ready to take on the world!<\\/p>\\n<p>The steps of that journey can be quite an adventure, which is why at Summit Salon Academy we strive to create a curriculum that will prepare them both in skills and in business.<\\/p>\\n<p>Beyond the technique and ability in hair care and styling that we make our focus, we feature a curriculum in business that works to support our students through their entire career. Part of that learning is focusing on the promotions and marketing skills that can help build client relations and bookings.<\\/p>\\n<p>Each month we feature a student who has gone beyond these lessons to create a presence and brand that will see them through their career. This month we are proud to feature Ayriss Tysdal as our social promoter of the month.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Meet Ayriss<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-2200\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/1E5C9C2B-C6E1-49F3-9B7B-5DC817B11A66.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Promoter of the month, Ayriss Tysdal\\\" width=\\\"302\\\" height=\\\"378\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/1E5C9C2B-C6E1-49F3-9B7B-5DC817B11A66.jpeg 512w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/1E5C9C2B-C6E1-49F3-9B7B-5DC817B11A66-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/1E5C9C2B-C6E1-49F3-9B7B-5DC817B11A66-320x400.jpeg 320w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/1E5C9C2B-C6E1-49F3-9B7B-5DC817B11A66-480x600.jpeg 480w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 302px) 100vw, 302px\\\" \\/>Ayriss has always had a passion for hair, although she hasn\\u2019t always had the courage to pursue her dream. That courage was wrought behind the counter, making frothy coffee drinks for the masses. It was there that she learned the basics of customer service, and built the strength to pursue what she really wanted.<\\/p>\\n<p>Passionate for her craft, and for the clients that she gets to work with on a daily basis, Ayriss prides herself on her ability to listen to her clients and work with them to deliver the look that they want. More than that, she takes the time to listen to everyone who sits in her chair saying, \\u201cWe might not all have the same story but we all can relate on some level. Because you see [your stylist] on a regular basis you can become their right hand man with what\\u2019s going in their life. You can just be there for them for that amount of time they are in your chair\\u2026 Sometimes this is just a time for them to relax &amp; just get their hair done so I don\\u2019t want them to feel bad if they don\\u2019t want to talk.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>Ayriss\\u2019 Styling Skills<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignright wp-image-2201\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-818x1024.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Ayriss Tysdal color wrok\\\" width=\\\"308\\\" height=\\\"386\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-818x1024.jpeg 818w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-768x961.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-320x400.jpeg 320w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-479x600.jpeg 479w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D-550x689.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/258A1F16-EC8E-4287-8A9E-02DF5BD4B89D.jpeg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 308px) 100vw, 308px\\\" \\/>With a passion for color, Ayriss loves creating balayage masterpieces. Because the hair color is painted on, it opens up so much opportunity to create a unique look that really speaks to the client\\u2019s personality. That creativity started early in school, with one of her favorite assignments being the color correction mannequin assignment. \\u201cYou have to figure out what to do with these four different colors and in the end make it all match to one color. It was a lot of trial and error, [as well as] things to think about when you do a real color correction on a client.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>More than color, Ayriss loves shampoo blow dry\\u2019s! Helping clients to look their best on a daily basis is really fun and exciting for her.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Ayriss Chose Summit Salon<\\/h2>\\n<p>Ayriss had actually been a client of the student salon at Summit Salon Academy for a while. So, when it came time to decide on a school to attend she knew right where to go. The students had always given her a quality cut, so she knew she would be learning skills that would help her develop a lifelong career.<\\/p>\\n<p>The skills she has learned, and the relationships she has built during her time at Summit Salon Academy may not only help her to build the career she wants, but to support her through the years to come.<\\/p>\\n<h2>What Lies Ahead for Ayriss<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-2202\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/93FCD2CD-2C15-4B5D-9CE0-12B56E85A1D5.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Ayriss Tysdal color work 2\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/93FCD2CD-2C15-4B5D-9CE0-12B56E85A1D5.jpeg 540w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/93FCD2CD-2C15-4B5D-9CE0-12B56E85A1D5-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/93FCD2CD-2C15-4B5D-9CE0-12B56E85A1D5-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/11\\/93FCD2CD-2C15-4B5D-9CE0-12B56E85A1D5-450x600.jpeg 450w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/>Graduating in January, Ayriss is excited to continue building her client base, as well as her skill. In fact, Ayriss has plans to continue her education in an apprenticeship, mastering intricate techniques and striving toward becoming a brand representative and ambassador.<\\/p>\\n<p>More than mastering her passions, Ayriss has a strong focus on family and devoting her life toward her husband and growing her family.<\\/p>\\n<p>To see more of what Ayriss is up to, and fall in love with her work, follow her on Instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hairbyayriss\\/\\\">@hairbyayriss<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><b>From everyone here at Summit Salon Academy, Tacoma we would like to congratulate Ayriss on her accomplishments in her education, and all the work she has done to build her career. We are so proud of all of her work, and the inspiration she has been to those around her.<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>If you would like to schedule a service with Ayriss, or any other of our amazing students <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">contact our student salon today<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you want to follow your dreams and pursue a career in beauty, just like Ayriss has, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\">contact our admissions department<\\/a> and discover how our program can help you turn those dreams into reality.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*All services performed by students in training under the direct supervision of licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we love our students! We love seeing them grow and develop from the beauty-passionate individuals they are, into career-ready professionals ready to take on the world! The steps of that journey can be quite an adventure, which is why at Summit Salon Academy we strive to create a curriculum that&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2203,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[124,121],\"class_list\":[\"post-2199\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-social-promoter-of-the-month\",\"tag-student-of-the-month\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Each month we like to recognize one of our amazing students as they go above and beyond in building their future. This month we feature Ayriss Tysdal.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-pr