(373, 3, 'post', '2212', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/12-beautiful-days-of-christmas/', '12 Beautiful Days of Christmas', 50, 'done', 1, 1044, '', '{\"id\":2212,\"date\":\"2017-12-13T22:47:12\",\"date_gmt\":\"2017-12-13T22:47:12\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2212\"},\"modified\":\"2017-12-19T18:37:14\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2017-12-19T18:37:14\",\"slug\":\"12-beautiful-days-of-christmas\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/12-beautiful-days-of-christmas\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"12 Beautiful Days of Christmas\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Summit Salon Academy is bringing our guests <strong>12 beautiful days of Christmas!<\\/strong> Come celebrate with us!<\\/p>\\n<p>As the song goes&#8230;<\\/p>\\n<h2>On the first day of Christmas Summit gave to me&#8230;<\\/h2>\\n<h3>1. 10% off your salon service if you check in at our school on Facebook.<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2213\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"1st day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-1.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>2. On the second day of Christmas we are giving you 10% off any product in the Extreme product line.<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2215\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"2nd day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-2.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>3. It&#8217;s the third day of Christmas and it is Treatment Tuesday! If you&#8217;re looking for healthier hair, you can buy a chemistry system treatment and get a CAT treatment for <strong>free<\\/strong>! If your locks are healthy and it&#8217;s your dry skin that needs some love, we&#8217;ve still got you covered! When you purchase a hand treatment, you get half off of a lip treatment as well!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2232\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"3rd Day of Christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-3.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>4. Guys like to look good too! Therefore, on the fourth day of Christmas we are giving you 20% off all men&#8217;s products.<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2218\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"4th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/4th-day-of-christmas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>5. Show us some social love on the fifth day of Christmas! When you check in at our school on Facebook we will give you 15% off your salon service.<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2219\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"5th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Summit-12-Days-Specials-Dec2017-5.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>6. Trust us, you don&#8217;t want your brows to haunt every picture you&#8217;re in this holiday season! That is why for the sixth day of Christmas we are giving you an eyebrow wax <strong>and<\\/strong> tint for only $12!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2220\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"6th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/6th-day-of-christmas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>7. On the seventh day of Christmas, we are giving you 10% off holiday packs or PCA products. Keep this in mind when you&#8217;re out shopping for that last-minute Christmas gift!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2221\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"7th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/7th-day-of-christmas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>8. The winter weather can cause some dry hands. We want to help you battle winter&#8217;s chill on the eighth day of Christmas. That&#8217;s why we are giving you a complimentary paraffin wax dip with the purchase of a manicure!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2222\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"8th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/8th-day-of-christas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>9. On the ninth day of Christmas we are giving you 20% off a chemical service or micro zone!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2223\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"9th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/9th-day-of-christmas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>10. Your hair needs to look good for all the upcoming holiday parties and portraits. It&#8217;s a good thing that for the tenth day of Christmas we are giving you a <strong>free<\\/strong> chemistry conditioning system with your purchase of a chemical service!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2224\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"10th day of christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/10th-day-of-christmas.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>11. On the eleventh day of Christmas we are giving you 10% off of any of our All Soft products, because everyone deserves soft hair!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2229\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"12th Day of Christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-11.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h3>12. Check in at our school on Facebook on the twelfth day of Christmas and we&#8217;ll give you 20% off of your waxing\\/sugaring services <strong>or<\\/strong> a complimentary thermal with the purchase of a chemical service.<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-2231\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-1024x536.png\\\" alt=\\\"12th Day of Christmas\\\" width=\\\"1024\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12-550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/12\\/Day-12.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Join us for 12 beautiful days of Christmas by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">calling our Guest Services!<\\/a><\\/h2>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Summit Salon Academy is bringing our guests 12 beautiful days of Christmas! Come celebrate with us! As the song goes&#8230; On the first day of Christmas Summit gave to me&#8230; 1. 10% off your salon service if you check in at our school on Facebook. 2. On the second day of Christmas we are giving&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2228,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[8,19],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2212\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-from-the-salon\",\"category-news-events\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[