6\\/revisions\\/2251\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/2237\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=2236\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=2236\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=2236\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"2236\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-tori-baines\\/\",\"dest_id\":1045,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2017\\/12\\/20\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-tori-baines\\/\",\"title\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Tori Baines\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":10,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":8,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:01:07'),
(375, 3, 'post', '2270', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-torri-feulner/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Torri Feulner', 50, 'done', 1, 1046, '', '{\"id\":2270,\"date\":\"2018-02-08T23:43:21\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-02-08T23:43:21\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2270\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:57:23\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:57:23\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-torri-feulner\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-torri-feulner\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Torri Feulner\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we believe each student is unique and capable of pursuing their passions. We love seeing our students turn into professionals who are ready to explore different career options, whether that be running their own business or working for a local salon.<\\/p>\\n<p>We know that to have a successful career our students need to have great skills. Mastering the basics such as cutting and coloring is important for cosmetology students at Summit Salon Academy. The business based education system is built to help our students become reliable professionals.<\\/p>\\n<p>Because we have a passion to help our students to succeed, we choose to highlight a student each month who has shown hard work and dedication to their education.<\\/p>\\n<p>This month we are proud to highlight Torri Feulner and all of the hard work and passion she has put into her future.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-full wp-image-2272\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/F40A9EF1-7A08-4CCE-B8FF-2671D5DBB468-e1518132373569.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"265\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>Meet Torri<\\/h2>\\n<p>Torri excels in putting the client first. She makes sure that each client walks away happy with their new style. Her easy going attitude and love for cutting and coloring hair puts clients at ease. When working with clients, the key to success for Torri is to \\u201cAsk them questions about what they want and make sure I do exactly what they are looking for.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>It\\u2019s her care for client needs that sets her services apart. Instead of trying to change her clients minds, she listens with understanding. This extra care makes the time spent with her enjoyable.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-2274 alignright\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/DADBC8EC-9457-4A76-BC89-A606F3047076-e1518132794714.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Back of mans head with black hair\\\" width=\\\"290\\\" height=\\\"290\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/DADBC8EC-9457-4A76-BC89-A606F3047076-e1518132794714.jpeg 290w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/DADBC8EC-9457-4A76-BC89-A606F3047076-e1518132794714-150x150.jpeg 150w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 290px) 100vw, 290px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Torri Chose Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>When she was younger, Torri would get her hair done at Summit Salon Academy. She also had a friend who went to and graduated from Summit Salon Academy. When it came time to choose a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology school<\\/a>, it was a no brainer.<\\/p>\\n<p>Torri enjoys spending time at school, and it started the first day she set foot on our campus. &#8220;It has just always caught my attention!&#8221; says Torri. Going from a client to a student was a step in the right direction for a better future.<\\/p>\\n<p>Thank you for everything you have brought to our cosmetology school, Torri! At Summit Salon Academy we strive to bring the highest quality education to our students, and we are so happy Torri saw that quality in us.<\\/p>\\n<h2><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-full wp-image-2275\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/3D7CFA2D-7715-4E4E-A145-53EC32770B14-e1518132922899.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Side view of woman with medium short silver hair\\\" width=\\\"297\\\" height=\\\"320\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/3D7CFA2D-7715-4E4E-A145-53EC32770B14-e1518132922899.jpeg 297w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/02\\/3D7CFA2D-7715-4E4E-A145-53EC32770B14-e1518132922899-278x300.jpeg 278w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 297px) 100vw, 297px\\\" \\/>What\\u2019s Next for Torri<\\/h2>\\n<p>Torri graduates in May 2018! It\\u2019s still several months away but she is already planning a bright and beautiful future for herself.<\\/p>\\n<p>She plans on working for a salon several days a week. Using her dazzling skills when cutting and coloring, she is sure to give clients a great hair experience. Torri would also like to give back to the community by working at a senior living salon.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>If you would like to see more of Torri\\u2019s work, check out her <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/torris.transformations\\/\\\">Facebook<\\/a> and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/torris.transformations\\/\\\">Instagram<\\/a> pages @Torris.Transformations.<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>Congratulations Torri, on everything you have learned in your time at Summit Salon Academy, we look forward to seeing all of the amazing things you accomplish in your remaining time with us.<\\/p>\\n<p>Schedule your service with Torri, or any of our talented students, in our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">student salon<\\/a>* today.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*All services performed by students under the direct supervision of licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we believe each student is unique and capable of pursuing their passions. We love seeing our students turn into professionals who are ready to explore different career options, whether that be running their own business or working for a local salon. We know that to have a successful career our students&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2289,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2270\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-torri-feulner\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-torri-feulner\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Torri Feulner | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Torri Feulner\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#org