(377, 3, 'post', '2323', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/Redken+Summer+Colors', 'Make Summer Sizzle With These Cool Trends', 50, 'done', 1, 1048, '', '{\"id\":2323,\"date\":\"2018-04-11T21:26:28\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-04-11T21:26:28\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2323\"},\"modified\":\"2018-04-17T20:48:57\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-04-17T20:48:57\",\"slug\":\"make-summer-sizzle-with-these-cool-trends\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Redken+Summer+Colors\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Cool Trends\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The weather is starting to get warmer, the birds are singing, and even though we are only a bit into spring, everyone&#8217;s minds have begun to move toward summer.<\\/p>\\n<p>The lazy days, the summer sun, the heat that seeps into your skin and makes everything sunny inside and out. <b>Summer is almost here.<\\/b> As it grows closer, you have probably started to think of all the amazing looks and outfits that are going to grace your day to day.<\\/p>\\n<p>But as the seasons change, isn\\u2019t it time for you to change as well?<\\/p>\\n<p>Here are some of our favorite styles, cuts, and colors for summer, all inspired by the power of Redken.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Sombre Hair Color<\\/h2>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-7f1cc8cdaf8f7d87dc558bbc1628a87a ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BedXETGHsGu\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>This steel tinted ombre has us going va-va-wow! With a fresh light blue that reminds us of a fresh summer sky and the beautiful steely grey that has been so popular lately, this looks has us excited.<\\/p>\\n<h2>A Perfect Blowout<\\/h2>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-90ef301085597507c8321730ab2861d6 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BgFNv1Kn4RH\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>This iconic Brazilian Blowout is the epitome of summer looks and add it to the this lucious sunkissed look and you will be ready for anything that summer brings.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>Are you looking for the perfect Brazilian Blowout?<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\">Schedule an appointment<\\/a> in our student salon today and let our students treat you to the amazing service. We train our students in the popular service using the prefered method and system, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.brazilianblowout.com\\/default.aspx\\\">The One&amp;Only Original Brazilian Blowout<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<p>Contact us for more information and schedule your service today.<\\/p>\\n<h2>High Voltage Blonde<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2324\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"High Voltage Hair\\\" width=\\\"323\\\" height=\\\"420\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A.jpg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-231x300.jpg 231w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-768x998.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-788x1024.jpg 788w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-308x400.jpg 308w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-462x600.jpg 462w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/RK_2018_HighVoltage_Silverlights_A-550x715.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 323px) 100vw, 323px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>This color line by Redken has inspired us, and many others, to create beautiful looks and styles that continue to turn heads.<\\/p>\\n<p>Take a look at this <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.redken.com\\/lookbook\\/haircolor\\\">inspiration board<\\/a> and find your perfect look today.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Pastel Ombre<\\/h2>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-ac318901a830a58bc5f9b46556c50a9d ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BhW_CVPn_ty\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>Bright, fresh, and full of life, these ribbons of color are created with the beautiful City Beats hues. We love the candy pops and faded look that brings the unicorn hair everyone loves into the bright sun.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Hidden Vibrant Hues<\\/h2>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-6dc1a7e97dd1a2a4cad36a7d0c83f3ef ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BfbRM0XnW_L\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>If you are wanting a little more color than the subtle pastel tones, we love these bright pops of reds and purples. Add the hidden tones underneath a bright brown and you have a look that is versatile and fun!<\\/p>\\n<h2>An Icy Chill<\\/h2>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-90d365ed791477f91778e400a4e65913 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/Bc0pslXntJ-\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>If the summer sun is calling to you, why not bring the bright heat to you, but with an icy hue? The bright blonde look created by a Redken Artist is sure to reflect the heat, and light the world on fire.<\\/p>\\n<p><b>Which look gets you excited for summer?<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<p>Let us help you get your look ready for summer. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\">Come in to our student salon today<\\/a> and let our students pamper you and create the looks that you are dreaming of.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>All services performed by students under the supervision of licensed professionals.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The weather is starting to get warmer, the birds are singing, and even though we are only a bit into spring, everyone&#8217;s minds have begun to move toward summer. The lazy days, the summer sun, the heat that seeps into your skin and makes everything sunny inside and out. Summer is almost here. As it&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[8,3],\"tags\":[147,146,148],\"class_list\":[\"post-2323\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-from-the-salon\",\"category-hair-design\",\"tag-redken-brand-color\",\"tag-redken-color-trends\",\"tag-summer-color-trends\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Are you looking for a new style or color to help you look your summer best? These amazing looks, inspired by the products and colors of Redken, will get your creative juices flowing. As a Redken Premier School we are proud to train and create these looks.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Redken+Summer+Colors\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/Redken+Summer+Colors#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Trends | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Cool Trends\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization