Redken Premier School we are proud to train and create these looks.\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#website\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/Redken+Summer+Colors#breadcrumblist\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"creator\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2018-04-11T21:26:28-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2018-04-17T20:48:57-07:00\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#website\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Beauty school in Tacoma\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Trends | Summit Salon Academy\",\"description\":\"Are you looking for a new style or color to help you look your summer best? These amazing looks, inspired by the products and colors of Redken, will get your creative juices flowing. As a Redken Premier School we are proud to train and create these looks.\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Redken+Summer+Colors\",\"robots\":\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Redken+Summer+Colors#article\",\"name\":\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Trends | Summit Salon Academy\",\"headline\":\"Mak