summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/2323\\/revisions\"}],\"predecessor-version\":[{\"id\":2326,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/2323\\/revisions\\/2326\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=2323\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=2323\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=2323\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"2323\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/Redken+Summer+Colors\",\"dest_id\":1048,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2018\\/04\\/11\\/make-summer-sizzle-with-these-cool-trends\\/\",\"title\":\"Make Summer Sizzle With These Cool Trends\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":7,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":5,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:01:11');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(378, 3, 'post', '2329', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/what-does-a-cosmetologist-do/', 'What Does a Cosmetologist Do?', 50, 'done', 1, 1049, '', '{\"id\":2329,\"date\":\"2018-04-23T19:42:04\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-04-23T19:42:04\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2329\"},\"modified\":\"2023-07-19T08:20:26\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-07-19T15:20:26\",\"slug\":\"what-does-a-cosmetologist-do\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/what-does-a-cosmetologist-do\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"What Does a Cosmetologist Do?\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">From hair styling to skincare and everything in between, cosmetologists are skilled artists who blend creativity with technical expertise. In this blog post, we will embark on a journey into the world of cosmetology, exploring the wide range of services and transformative experiences that cosmetologists offer to their clients.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Understanding the Role of a Cosmetologist\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At its core, <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/ca.indeed.com\\/career-advice\\/finding-a-job\\/what-does-cosmetologist-do\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> is the art and science of enhancing the physical appearance of individuals through various beauty treatments. Cosmetologists possess a diverse skill set that encompasses hair care, skin care, nail care, and makeup application.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">What Does a Cosmetologist Learn?<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Now, let\\u2019s talk about what they learn. Becoming a cosmetologist means learning many skills. Some of them you might be surprised by! To become a successful cosmetologist, you must be able to have certain skills. Some of those include:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beauty Treatments<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Hair care:<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> One of the primary responsibilities of a cosmetologist lies in hair care. Whether it&#8217;s cutting, coloring, or styling, they possess the knowledge and skills to create stunning hair transformations.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Skincare:<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> Cosmetologists are also trained in the field of skincare and beauty treatments. They understand the nuances of different skin types and can make skincare recommendations to their clients as well as perform various waxing services.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Nail care:<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> Another vital aspect of a cosmetologist&#8217;s job is nail care. They are skilled in manicures and pedicures, ensuring that clients&#8217; nails are well-groomed and visually appealing.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Anatomy<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Learning anatomy is not just for those going into the medical field. When working with skin day in and day out you will need to know what can damage and what can enhance the skin. A cosmetologist needs to know what parts of the body are sensitive to products in order to avoid any damage to the scalp or skin.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Chemistry<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">You thought you were done with chemistry now that you\\u2019re done with high school, didn\\u2019t you? Well, you may want to sit down for this, but you\\u2019ll be using chemistry as a cosmetologist. Hair toners, perm technology, hair color, hair relaxers, shampoos, conditioners, and other products all have chemicals in them. In order to safely use these products, you must know how these chemicals react to one another to ensure the best possible outcome for your future clients.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Business Skills<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Yes, it is true. Business skills are something you should learn while becoming a cosmetologist. Most cosmetologists are responsible for building their own clientele. Marketing skills, communication skills, and sales skills are all skills you can master.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Successful cosmetologists become savvy both on social media and financially as independent workers in order to keep their businesses running!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A World of Beauty<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A cosmetologist is someone that works by helping people feel beautiful and comfortable in their own skin. Working from head to toe, a cosmetologist specializes in the beautification of the face, skin, hair, and nails! Becoming a cosmetologist means you will be constantly working on perfecting your skills and mastering the art of beauty. In our <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology program<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, you can learn:\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Shampooing &amp; Blowdrying<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hairstyling including Natural Hairstyling<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hair Color including Permanent, Semi-Permanent, Fashion Colors-Pulp Riot, and Blonding<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Haircutting \\u2013 design principles and varied techniques<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Perms, Chemical Relaxers, Brazilian Blowout<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Introduction to Wigs and Hair Additions<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hair removal and lash\\/brow tinting<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Skin Theory and Basic Facials<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Manicures<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">And more!\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">What Careers Can I Have?<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">As a professional cosmetologist, you can take control of your own future! Some careers you may pursue include:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Salon stylist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Salon owner or manager<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Color specialist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Brand Representative<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Distributor sales consultant<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Distributor store manager<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Platform artist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Cosmetology instructor<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">School owner<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Become A Cosmetologist!<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If you&#8217;ve been captivated by the world of beauty and have a passion for helping others look and feel their best, consider becoming a cosmetologist! By enrolling in our program at <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/about-us\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, you can gain the comprehensive knowledge and hands-on experience needed to thrive in this dynamic field.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to get started and receive more information. We look forward to hearing from you!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Have you ever wondered what it takes to create those stunning hairstyles, flawless makeup looks, and radiant skincare treatments? In this blog, we dive into the world of cosmetology and explain what they do and how their expertise can transform lives.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4951,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,149],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2329\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-