(379, 3, 'post', '2338', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/test-your-beauty-tools-knowledge/', 'Test Your Beauty Tools Knowledge!', 50, 'done', 1, 1050, '', '{\"id\":2338,\"date\":\"2018-04-24T17:11:19\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-04-24T17:11:19\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2338\"},\"modified\":\"2018-04-24T17:11:19\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-04-24T17:11:19\",\"slug\":\"test-your-beauty-tools-knowledge\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/test-your-beauty-tools-knowledge\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Test Your Beauty Tools Knowledge!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>If you\\u2019re into beauty, you probably know a thing or two about beauty tools. From heat styling tools and hairbrushes to makeup brushes, sponges, and puffs, there are a lot of tools to remember. Ready to find out where your knowledge stands? Take our quiz to see just how much you know!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.qzzr.com\\/c\\/quiz\\/460500\\/how-well-do-you-know-beauty-tools-0825e13d-9bdd-4a1a-b91f-633ecaeb84f1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2339\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/Screen-Shot-2018-04-23-at-2.59.18-PM-300x240.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"421\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/Screen-Shot-2018-04-23-at-2.59.18-PM-300x240.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/Screen-Shot-2018-04-23-at-2.59.18-PM-500x400.png 500w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/Screen-Shot-2018-04-23-at-2.59.18-PM-550x440.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/04\\/Screen-Shot-2018-04-23-at-2.59.18-PM.png 678w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Do you want to learn more about beauty tools, styling techniques, and the latest trends? Consider our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> or <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">esthetics program<\\/a> at Summit Salon Academy. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/learn-more\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to learn more before enrolling. We\\u2019re here to help you get started.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>If you\\u2019re into beauty, you probably know a thing or two about beauty tools. From heat styling tools and hairbrushes to makeup brushes, sponges, and puffs, there are a lot of tools to remember. Ready to find out where your knowledge stands? Take our quiz to see just how much you know! Do you want&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2344,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[150],\"tags\":[153,151,152],\"class_list\":[\"post-2338\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-quiz\",\"tag-beauty-tool-knowledge\",\"tag-beauty-tools\",\"tag-quiz\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"At Summit Salon Academy, we know our beauty tools. Do you consider yourself a beauty tools expert? Test your knowledge with our quiz! If you want to learn about beauty tools, techniques, and more, consider our cosmetology or esthetics program.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/test-your-beauty-tools-knowledge\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<me