(382, 3, 'post', '2370', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/student-of-the-month-ashley-getz/', 'Student of the Month: Ashley Getz', 50, 'done', 1, 1053, '', '{\"id\":2370,\"date\":\"2018-05-17T16:16:20\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-05-17T16:16:20\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2370\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:56:14\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:56:14\",\"slug\":\"student-of-the-month-ashley-getz\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/student-of-the-month-ashley-getz\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Student of the Month: Ashley Getz\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we work hard to make sure our students succeed and move forward with passion to create a career for themselves. Some of the best days in our student salon are when we can see success happening right in front of our eyes. Each month we pick a student that has shown initiative in their work and passion and creativity behind the chair. This month\\u2019s feature is Ashley Getz!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Meet Ashley<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2372\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"800\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/dc14ed4f-c5fd-4d81-8e58-35fe366be866-550x733.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><br \\/>\\nAshley is in the cosmetology program and will be graduating in spring of 2019. Ashley\\u2019s first and most important priority is the client. As soon as a client sits in Ashley&#8217;s chair a friendship is formed. Ashley knows what it\\u2019s like to be the client and how important it is to feel comfortable. \\u201cWhen I go to the salon I want to have an experience with my stylist that says they&#8217;re there for me and only me. The focus they put on our time together is what makes me happy!\\u201d If you are looking for a friendly personable stylist who is committed to getting the result you are looking for, then Ashley is your girl!<\\/p>\\n<h2>The Best Parts About Being a Cosmetologist<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-2375\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-169x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"blue hair\\\" width=\\\"169\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-768x1365.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-225x400.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-338x600.jpg 338w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1-550x978.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/05\\/Snapchat-1598357878-1.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\\\" \\/><br \\/>\\nAshley chose cosmetology because it\\u2019s the perfect career to express her creative side through color, cutting, and anything else that walks through the door. Ashley specializes in hair color. She\\u2019s the go-to for any color, big or small. You could say she\\u2019s a natural. She has loved working with color since day one. Since the day she worked with foils on her model, she has been hooked. She loves seeing the transformation.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Did Ashley Choose Summit Salon Academy?<\\/h2>\\n<p>We are so lucky to have Ashley on the team. We were so happy to hear she picked us because of the immediate sense of comfort when she walked through our doors. \\u201cWhen I came in for my tour with Karen she was super friendly and she made me feel at home and super welcomed. I know this was the place for me!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>What\\u2019s Next For Ashley<\\/h2>\\n<p>Ashley is already finding so much success as a student that we can not wait to see what she does after she graduates. Ashley knows how beneficial it is to be dual certified. That means to have a license in multiple programs. \\u201cI&#8217;m hoping to find a job in a salon where I can work and also come back to school for nighttime esthetician training. I&#8217;d love to have a dual license. I feel like that would make me a very valuable asset to any salon!\\u201d She\\u2019s right about that. We think any salon would be lucky to have Ashley!<\\/p>\\n<p>Check out Ashley\\u2019s Instagram at @ash_scissor_hands to follow her journey through hair, makeup, and nails! To follow in Ashley\\u2019s footsteps in success, <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">contact us<\\/a> to begin your journey as a <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">cosmetologist<\\/a>! Check out <a href=\\\"\\/student-of-the-month-jojo-bertucci\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">last month\\u2019s student on the month<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy we work hard to make sure our students succeed and move forward with passion to create a career for themselves. Some of the best days in our student salon are when we can see success happening right in front of our eyes. Each month we pick a student that has shown&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2370\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"We love our students and even more, we love seeing our students succeed. Read our blog to see this month&#039;s student of the month!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/student-of-the-month-ashley-getz\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/student-of-the-month-ashley-getz\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Student of the Month: Ashley Getz | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Student of the Month: Ashley Getz\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\