(383, 3, 'post', '2416', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/pulp-riot-now-at-summit-salon-academy/', 'Pulp Riot: Now at Summit Salon Academy!', 50, 'done', 1, 1054, '', '{\"id\":2416,\"date\":\"2018-06-20T07:21:14\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-06-20T14:21:14\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2416\"},\"modified\":\"2018-06-20T07:26:55\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-06-20T14:26:55\",\"slug\":\"pulp-riot-now-at-summit-salon-academy\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/pulp-riot-now-at-summit-salon-academy\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Pulp Riot: Now at Summit Salon Academy!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We\\u2019ve got exciting news here at Summit Salon Academy. We now offer the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.pulpriothair.com\\/\\\">Pulp Riot line of products!<\\/a> This bold and bright line of hair dyes, toners, lighteners, and shampoos will allow us to create looks that are modern, colorful, and super unique. This innovative brand started in <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.americansalon.com\\/news\\/pulp-riot-new-color-company-announces-product-launch\\\">Los Angeles in 2016<\\/a>, with a focus on empowering stylists and supporting their creative visions. Pulp Riot is an ideal brand for stylists and clients who are interested in bold hair colors and deep, beautiful tones.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BkDM2XNnEo8\\/\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:658px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:#F8F8F8; line-height:0; margin-top:40px; padding:62.5% 0; text-align:center; width:100%;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:url(data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACwAAAAsCAMAAAApWqozAAAABGdBTUEAALGPC\\/xhBQAAAAFzUkdCAK7OHOkAAAAMUExURczMzPf399fX1+bm5mzY9AMAAADiSURBVDjLvZXbEsMgCES5\\/P8\\/t9FuRVCRmU73JWlzosgSIIZURCjo\\/ad+EQJJB4Hv8BFt+IDpQoCx1wjOSBFhh2XssxEIYn3ulI\\/6MNReE07UIWJEv8UEOWDS88LY97kqyTliJKKtuYBbruAyVh5wOHiXmpi5we58Ek028czwyuQdLKPG1Bkb4NnM+VeAnfHqn1k4+GPT6uGQcvu2h2OVuIf\\/gWUFyy8OWEpdyZSa3aVCqpVoVvzZZ2VTnn2wU8qzVjDDetO90GSy9mVLqtgYSy231MxrY6I2gGqjrTY0L8fxCxfCBbhWrsYYAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC); display:block; height:44px; margin:0 auto -44px; position:relative; top:-22px; width:44px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BkDM2XNnEo8\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@hair_princess_steph and @maggiesabinehair are the artists&#8230; Pulp Riot is the paint.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/pulpriothair\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> Pulp Riot Hair Color<\\/a> (@pulpriothair) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2018-06-15T15:16:26+00:00\\\">Jun 15, 2018 at 8:16am PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async defer src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Pulp Riot Products<\\/h2>\\n<p>Pulp Riot\\u2019s line of innovative products includes:<\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>Purple Toning Shampoo<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Prevents blonde from going yellow and maintains the shade.<\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>Blank Canvas<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Removes direct dye and semi-permanent color.<\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>High Speed Toners<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Creates beautiful tones in under 5 minutes or even deeper tones in 20 minutes. <\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>Semi-Permanent Colors<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Vibrant and pastel colors that last longer and fade better.<\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>Blonding Developers<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Top-of-the-line lightener for foil, scalp, and hair painting techniques.<\\/p>\\n<h3><strong>Neon Electric Semi-Permanent Colors<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Bold, bright, UV reactive colors that last and fade beautifully.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/Bjh8nwOn_5r\\/\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:658px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:#F8F8F8; line-height:0; margin-top:40px; padding:62.5% 0; text-align:center; width:100%;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:url(data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACwAAAAsCAMAAAApWqozAAAABGdBTUEAALGPC\\/xhBQAAAAFzUkdCAK7OHOkAAAAMUExURczMzPf399fX1+bm5mzY9AMAAADiSURBVDjLvZXbEsMgCES5\\/P8\\/t9FuRVCRmU73JWlzosgSIIZURCjo\\/ad+EQJJB4Hv8BFt+IDpQoCx1wjOSBFhh2XssxEIYn3ulI\\/6MNReE07UIWJEv8UEOWDS88LY97kqyTliJKKtuYBbruAyVh5wOHiXmpi5we58Ek028czwyuQdLKPG1Bkb4NnM+VeAnfHqn1k4+GPT6uGQcvu2h2OVuIf\\/gWUFyy8OWEpdyZSa3aVCqpVoVvzZZ2VTnn2wU8qzVjDDetO90GSy9mVLqtgYSy231MxrY6I2gGqjrTY0L8fxCxfCBbhWrsYYAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC); display:block; height:44px; margin:0 auto -44px; position:relative; top:-22px; width:44px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/Bjh8nwOn_5r\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Pulp Riot Lightener and Toner&#8230; @jaywesleyolson and @allisonkorin are the artists&#8230; Pulp Riot is the paint.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/pulpriothair\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> Pulp Riot Hair Color<\\/a> (@pulpriothair) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2018-06-02T17:19:42+00:00\\\">Jun 2, 2018 at 10:19am PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async defer src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why We\\u2019re So Excited About Pulp Riot!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Pulp Riot is a unique and creative brand that focuses on empowering the stylists that use it. This brand is all about the individual stylist. Every photo on their Instagram is attributed to the individual who used their products. We are excited to give our students the chance to work with a brand that values creative, individual work.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BiyDulJnAZY\\/\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:658px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:#F8F8F8; line-height:0; margin-top:40px; padding:50.0% 0; text-align:center; width:100%;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background:url(data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACwAAAAsCAMAAAApWqozAAAABGdBTUEAALGPC\\/xhBQAAAAFzUkdCAK7OHOkAAAAMUExURczMzPf399fX1+bm5mzY9AMAAADiSURBVDjLvZXbEsMgCES5\\/P8\\/t9FuRVCRmU73JWlzosgSIIZURCjo\\/ad+EQJJB4Hv8BFt+IDpQoCx1wjOSBFhh2XssxEIYn3ulI\\/6MNReE07UIWJEv8UEOWDS88LY97kqyTliJKKtuYBbruAyVh5wOHiXmpi5we58Ek028czwyuQdLKPG1Bkb4NnM+VeAnfHqn1k4+GPT6uGQcvu2h2OVuIf\\/gWUFyy8OWEpdyZSa3aVCqpVoVvzZZ2VTnn2wU8qzVjDDetO90GSy9mVLqtgYSy231MxrY6I2gGqjrTY0L8fxCxfCBbhWrsYYAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC); display:block; height:44px; margin:0 auto -44px; position:relative; top:-22px; width:44px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BiyDulJnAZY\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@santirhair is the artist&#8230; Pulp Riot is the paint.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/pulpriothair\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> Pulp Riot Hair Color<\\/a> (@pulpriothair) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2018-05-15T02:58:15+00:00\\\">May 14, 2018 at 7:58pm PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async defer src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Work With Pulp Riot Products at Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>For the chance to work with these creative, modern products, learn more about our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> at Summit Salon Academy. You\\u2019ll be able to learn with educators who are just as passionate about beauty as you are. From hair coloring and styling, to makeup application and manicures, Summit offers a fully rounded beauty curriculum. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Contact us<\\/a> today to learn more! You can also <a href=\\\"\\/guest-services\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">call us to schedule an appointment<\\/a> if you want to see for yourself just how awesome Pulp Riot is!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We\\u2019ve got exciting news here at Summit Salon Academy. We now offer the Pulp Riot line of products! This bold and bright line of hair dyes, toners, lighteners, and shampoos will allow us to create looks that are modern, colorful, and super unique. This innovative brand started in Los Angeles in 2016, with a focus&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2418,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[3,19],\"tags\":[158,156,74,157,155],\"class_list\":[\"post-2416\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-hair-design\",\"category-news-events\",\"tag-brand\",\"tag-color\",\"tag-hair\",\"tag-new\",\"tag-pulp-riot\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Summit Salon Academy now carries Pulp Riot, a vibrant, modern line of hair dyes, lighteners, and shampoos! Check out our blog post to learn more about why we