INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(386, 3, 'post', '2555', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-megan-tate/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Megan Tate', 50, 'done', 1, 1057, '', '{\"id\":2555,\"date\":\"2018-09-10T07:24:37\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-09-10T14:24:37\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2555\"},\"modified\":\"2019-04-02T06:55:50\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-04-02T13:55:50\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-megan-tate\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-megan-tate\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Megan Tate\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-megan-tate\\/social-promoter-megan-tate-share-1\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2556\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2556\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Social Promoter Megan Tate \\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"800\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1.png 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-400x400.png 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-600x600.png 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/Social-Promoter-Megan-Tate-Share-1-550x550.png 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Here at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we are lucky enough to work with what we believe to be some of the most talented, brightest, and creative minds in the area. Our students work hard to make this world more beautiful by enhancing their skills and techniques. Each month, we like to shine a spotlight on a student that has worked hard on not only on their craft but as on their business and social media skills, too. These students are the ones who are building something for their future in the beauty industry. This month we are thrilled to recognize Megan Tate as our Social Promoter!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Meet Megan<\\/h2>\\n<p>Megan is a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> student at Summit Salon Academy. Megan understands first hand what it\\u2019s like to start over and follow your heart. \\u201cI was trying to become a nurse [before working toward a license in cosmetology.] But after becoming a CNA I realized that\\u2019s not where my heart was. Deep down I\\u2019ve always wanted to make hair my career and now I\\u2019m making that happen by becoming a cosmetologist!\\u201d With such a massive change in careers, we are so honored that Megan chose Summit to begin her journey as a cosmetologist. \\u201cI loved the environment [at Summit]. It\\u2019s so upbeat and up to date with every style. I love the fact that we do hands-on training because for me that\\u2019s the easiest way to learn.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>It\\u2019s not easy to leave something that you worked so hard on for something that you hope will be better. Megan\\u2019s love for beauty and helping others feel confident is what lead her to what she truly loves.. It\\u2019s no surprise that Megan is so talented because she has so much passion and dedication for cosmetology.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Megan &amp; Cosmetology<\\/h2>\\n<p>Megan has thrived in learning the craft of cosmetology. While working on her skills in all areas, she definitely feels like there is one skill she absolutely loves to work on. \\u201cMy absolute favorite [service to give] is haircuts. I feel like I perform men cuts very well.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Megan loves seeing the transformation process right in front of her eyes. Working with her hands is where Megan shines. Megan has not only an ability to create incredible haircuts but also the ability to make people feel great around her.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Megan &amp; Her Clients<\\/h2>\\n<p>When asked why clients should work with her Megan\\u2019s response was, \\u201cI\\u2019m very calm and easy going. I love getting really detailed with my work. I\\u2019ll definitely make conversation with you or just let you relax. I can do both. I promise to never let you go home unhappy!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>We couldn\\u2019t agree more with Megan. Her clients love her just as much as she loves her work! Some may think that every cosmetologist is the same. Megan begs to differ. She brings something different and good to the table every time she comes into work. \\u201cI feel that I can be your girl to get you all glammed but I definitely know how to keep it subtle and calm too. Being 50% girly-girl and 50% tomboy helps you meet in the middle with your clients.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>Megan &amp; Her Future<\\/h2>\\n<p>We are so excited to see where Megan\\u2019s passion leads her. We think that her love for cosmetology and her clients could create amazing opportunities in the future. When asked what her career plans are after graduating this February she said, \\u201cI could see myself in a nice salon somewhere doing a little bit of everything. But I could also see myself becoming a barber!\\u201d It\\u2019s easy to see Megan succeeding in anything she puts her mind to.<\\/p>\\n<p>Megan\\u2019s advice for those that want to follow their dreams and pursue an education in beauty is, \\u201dGive it your all! Stay motivated! Don\\u2019t give up. It will be worth in the end.\\u201d To follow along Megan and her work, make sure to check her out on Instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/cosmochic2019\\/?hl=en\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@Cosmochic2019<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you are like Megan and want to make your dreams into a reality, we want to help you reach your goals! <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to receive more information on our programs. Don\\u2019t forget to<a href=\\\"\\/student-of-the-month-jojo-bertucci\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> check out last month\\u2019s Social Promoter<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Here at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma we are lucky enough to work with what we believe to be some of the most talented, brightest, and creative minds in the area. Our students work hard to make this world more beautiful by enhancing their skills and techniques. Each month, we like to shine a spotlight on&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2555\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-megan-tate\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<sc