INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(387, 3, 'post', '2563', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/october-social-promoter-of-the-month-amy-grover/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Amy Grover', 50, 'done', 1, 1058, '', '{\"id\":2563,\"date\":\"2018-09-25T14:49:26\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-09-25T21:49:26\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2563\"},\"modified\":\"2019-02-13T08:08:39\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-02-13T16:08:39\",\"slug\":\"october-social-promoter-of-the-month-amy-grover\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/october-social-promoter-of-the-month-amy-grover\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Amy Grover\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We think our students at Summit Salon Academy are pretty fantastic. To show the world how much we appreciate our students, we choose a different individual to spotlight each month. These aren\\u2019t just students who excel in beauty techniques and skills. They\\u2019re students who have demonstrated their skills in social media and business knowledge. We\\u2019d like to introduce you to one of our top social promoters, Amy Grover!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/october-social-promoter-of-the-month-amy-grover\\/7dc4cec4-50c3-4fb6-a07f-e8b2a917b3d7-amy-grover\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2564\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2564\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Student Amy Grover.\\\" width=\\\"750\\\" height=\\\"731\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover.jpeg 750w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover-300x292.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover-410x400.jpeg 410w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover-616x600.jpeg 616w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/09\\/7DC4CEC4-50C3-4FB6-A07F-E8B2A917B3D7-Amy-Grover-550x536.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>About Amy<\\/h2>\\n<p>Before she started at Summit Salon Academy, Amy was a Spanish major at Washington State University. While in college, Amy enjoyed doing hair and makeup for her sorority sisters. This hobby and passion piqued her interest in studying beauty and lead her to enroll at Summit. Amy has learned many new skills and techniques since starting school, but she says that learning color correction and balayage are two of her favorite things so far.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Social Media and Developing a Client Base<\\/h2>\\n<p>At Summit, we recognize Amy as a social promoter of the month because she knows how to use social media to market herself as a stylist and connect with local salons. As a stylist in today\\u2019s competitive beauty world, being on top of your social media game is crucial. This is the best way to find new clients, get inspiration, and create a portfolio of your work. In addition to being a master of social media, Amy works hard to add her own individual flair to each client\\u2019s look. \\u201cI try not to fall into a pattern of always doing the same thing every time a client visits,\\u201d Amy says. \\u201cI always try to see if they want to switch it up and do something different.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" style=\\\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\\\" data-instgrm-captioned=\\\"\\\" data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BldjRsmlNA3\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"12\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 16px;\\\">\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 19% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\\\">View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding: 0 4px;\\\"><a style=\\\"color: #000; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BldjRsmlNA3\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">I \\ud83d\\udc9c blowouts. It\\u2019s so crazy to me to think about how 10 months ago when i started school I couldn\\u2019t even manage to make one curl with a round brush and a blow dryer. I love seeing improvement in my work\\u263a\\ufe0f \\u2022 \\u2022 \\u2022 \\u2022 \\u2022 @ssatacoma @redken #ssatacoma #summitsalonacademy #summitsalonacademytacoma #blowout #curlyblowdry #blowoutstyles #blowouts #redken #redkenobessed #hairwithamy #hairstyle #hairstlyist #tacomahairstylist #hair #redken5thave #curlyblowout<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair_with_amy_\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"> Amy Grover<\\/a> (@hair_with_amy_) on <time style=\\\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2018-07-20T17:24:03+00:00\\\">Jul 20, 2018 at 10:24am PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p><script async defer src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Advice and Plans for the Future<\\/h2>\\n<p>After Amy graduates from our cosmetology program at Summit Salon Academy, she wants to complete an associate program so she can continue her training and learn advanced techniques. When we asked Amy what sets her apart from other stylists, she gave us these wise words: \\u201cI don\\u2019t try to force anything on my clients. I tell them honestly what I think they need and let them decide from there.\\u201d To see Amy\\u2019s work, follow her on Instagram <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair_with_amy\\/\\\">@hair_with_amy!<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Share the same interests as Amy? Check out our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a>! We\\u2019d love to tell you more about enrolling and help you find a future in beauty. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Get in touch now!<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Check out this blog post to learn about one of our superstar students, Amy Grover! <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[143,142,164,141],\"class_list\":[\"post-2563\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"