(389, 3, 'post', '2579', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Kiara-Yael Garrison', 50, 'done', 1, 1060, '', '{\"id\":2579,\"date\":\"2018-10-18T11:57:26\",\"date_gmt\":\"2018-10-18T18:57:26\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2579\"},\"modified\":\"2018-11-12T13:23:55\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2018-11-12T21:23:55\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Kiara-Yael Garrison\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>It\\u2019s our favorite time of the month&#8211; social promoter time! That means we get to spotlight one of our amazing students. The individuals we choose to spotlight are great students who work hard and demonstrate proficiency in beauty techniques, social media, and business knowledge. This month, we are proud to introduce Kiara-Yael Garrison as our social promoter of the month!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\\/350847cb-018c-44ea-b9e7-5f467a9ac8a2\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2580\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2580\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Student of the month Kiara-Yael Garrison.\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"657\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2.jpeg 750w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2-241x300.jpeg 241w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2-321x400.jpeg 321w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2-481x600.jpeg 481w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/350847CB-018C-44EA-B9E7-5F467A9AC8A2-550x686.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>About Kiara-Yael<\\/h2>\\n<p>Kiara-Yael chose to attend Summit after a recommendation from a close friend. Since starting her education, she has grown to love the science behind hair. Learning about hair coloring and mixing chemicals fascinates Kiara-Yael, as does learning about bacteria and viruses that occur in the beauty world. During her education, Kiara-Yael has developed a real love for color and considers hair coloring to be her specialty.<\\/p>\\n<h2>What Makes Kiara-Yael Unique<\\/h2>\\n<p>For success as a stylist in the modern beauty industry, it\\u2019s vital to be social media savvy. Kiara-Yael does an excellent job of using her Instagram account to build a portfolio of work, connect with potential clients, and network with local salons. Forming relationships with her clients is one of Kiara-Yael\\u2019s favorite parts of being a cosmetology student. Her positive energy and outgoing personality make it easy for her to help her clients feel comfortable and welcome on their first visit. \\u201cI believe clients should book with me because I will teach you and take you step-by-step on what I\\u2019m doing,\\u201d Kiara-Yael says. \\u201cI will also sing and make you smile with my awesome dance moves!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\\/e9cabb6e-7269-42c4-9dfa-923579f78145\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2581\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2581\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"A picture of Kiara-Yael\'s work.\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"937\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145.jpeg 750w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145-169x300.jpeg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145-576x1024.jpeg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145-225x400.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145-337x600.jpeg 337w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/10\\/E9CABB6E-7269-42C4-9DFA-923579F78145-550x978.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>What\\u2019s Next for Kiara-Yael?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Kiara-Yael-Yael is on track to graduate from Summit in August 2019. After graduation, she plans to work has an apprentice at a salon in the Lacey\\/Olympia area so she can stay close to her family. We think that Kiara-Yael\\u2019s beauty technique, social media prowess, and overall great attitude will lead her to a bright, fulfilling future in the beauty industry! To follow Kiara-Yael and see her work, connect with her on Instagram <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair.by.kiara_yael\\/\\\">@hair.by.kiara_yael<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n<p>Do you love hair as much as Kiara-Yael? Enroll in our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program <\\/a>at Summit Salon Academy! We\\u2019re here to answer your questions, so contact us now for more information!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Check out this blog about our social promoter of the month, Kiara-Yael Garrison!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2592,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[143,142,164,141],\"class_list\":[\"post-2579\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-promoter\",\"tag-social\",\"tag-spotlight\",\"tag-student\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"This month we\\u2019re spotlighting Kiara-Yael Garrison for our social promoter of the month blog! Check it out now.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kiara-yael-garrison\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Kiara-Yael Garrison | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Kiara-Yael Garrison\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2018\\\\\\/10\\\\\\/Social-Promoter-K-Garrison-Share-Oct2018-Header.png\\