(393, 3, 'post', '2725', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-olena-tomyeva/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Olena Tomyeva', 50, 'done', 1, 1064, '', '{\"id\":2725,\"date\":\"2019-01-15T07:00:05\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-01-15T15:00:05\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2725\"},\"modified\":\"2019-02-14T06:46:10\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-02-14T14:46:10\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-olena-tomyeva\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-olena-tomyeva\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Olena Tomyeva\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>It\\u2019s time to celebrate another one of our incredible students here at Summit Salon Academy! We have such a hardworking, talented student body. Spotlighting specific individuals on our blog is a great way to show our appreciation for their hard work. This month\\u2019s Social Promoter of the Month is Olena Tomyeva!<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Olena<\\/h2>\\n<p>Olena Tomyeva has been a student at Summit Salon Academy for four months. She plans to graduate from the <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> in October 2019. Before she even considered attending beauty school, Olena was a dental assistant, so she already has a professional background. She chose to make the switch to cosmetology because she\\u2019s always been passionate about beauty and doing hair.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-olena-tomyeva\\/162df76c-9aeb-4ccf-a07d-d788f10d4fa1\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2728\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2728\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"682\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1.jpeg 737w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1-232x300.jpeg 232w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1-309x400.jpeg 309w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1-464x600.jpeg 464w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/01\\/162DF76C-9AEB-4CCF-A07D-D788F10D4FA1-550x712.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Summit was Olena\\u2019s school of choice not only because of its convenient location but because of its professionalism. Our cosmetology curriculum is ideal for career-focused individuals, as it focuses on heavily on the business side of the beauty industry. These skills are crucial for any student who wants to prepare for the future! Currently, Olena considers haircuts to be her strongest skill at school. She says that practicing on real guests\\/mannequin heads has been the most helpful in improving those skills.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Moving Forward<\\/h2>\\n<p>As she progresses toward graduation, Olena wants to do the best work possible. \\u201cI have integrity and will do my best to make my client happy,\\u201d she says. \\u201cMy passion for this [sets me apart], I really love what I do.\\u201d Olena is looking forward to working in a salon after graduation from Summit. She advises any incoming students to be determined and committed to their education if they want to find success.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>You can follow Olena on Instagram at glamhair_by_olena! <\\/em><\\/p>\\n<h2>Learn More About Our Program at Summit<\\/h2>\\n<p>Want to join exceptional students like Olena on your own cosmetology journey? We are always excited when driven, passionate people want to join the Summit family! <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Contact Summit Salon Academy <\\/a>today to learn about <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">applying to our cosmetology program<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our students make us so proud here at Summit. Click here to read about our incredible student Olena Tomyeva!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2771,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[25,136,164,139],\"class_list\":[\"post-2725\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-cosmetology\",\"tag-social-promoter\",\"tag-spotlight\",\"tag-star-student\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"We spotlight a student most months at Summit Salon Academy to show our appreciation. This month\\u2019s student is Olena Tomyeva! Check out the blog.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-olena-tomyeva\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-olena-tomyeva\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Olena