\/\",\"dest_id\":1064,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2019\\/01\\/15\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-olena-tomyeva\\/\",\"title\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Olena Tomyeva\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":5,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":5,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:01:34'),
(394, 3, 'post', '2740', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Kaiti Markuson', 50, 'done', 1, 1065, '', '{\"id\":2740,\"date\":\"2019-02-06T06:47:20\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-02-06T14:47:20\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2740\"},\"modified\":\"2019-02-13T07:53:28\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-02-13T15:53:28\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Kaiti Markuson\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>It\\u2019s the month of love and it\\u2019s time to show some appreciation to another fantastic student! We love this opportunity to spotlight exceptional individuals at our school. For February\\u2019s social promoter of the month, meet Kaiti Markuson!<br \\/>\\n<!--more--><\\/p>\\n<h2>Kaiti\\u2019s Experience in School<\\/h2>\\n<p>Kaiti chose to<a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"> study cosmetology<\\/a> at Summit Salon Academy because her trusted friend recommended it to her. Once she said the name Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, Kaiti knew it was the right choice. \\u201cI signed up that day and was touring very soon after,\\u201d she says. \\u201cI liked the vibe of the salon and knew I\\u2019d found my home away from home for the next 12 months.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\/1942cde8-f239-4dee-99b8-ca60d2b9a38b-1\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2742\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2742\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/1942CDE8-F239-4DEE-99B8-CA60D2B9A38B-1.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Kaiti Markuson with braids and an all-black outfit.\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"937\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/1942CDE8-F239-4DEE-99B8-CA60D2B9A38B-1.jpeg 540w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/1942CDE8-F239-4DEE-99B8-CA60D2B9A38B-1-169x300.jpeg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/1942CDE8-F239-4DEE-99B8-CA60D2B9A38B-1-225x400.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/1942CDE8-F239-4DEE-99B8-CA60D2B9A38B-1-338x600.jpeg 338w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Even though she\\u2019s less than six months away from graduating, Kaiti still appreciates the challenges of beauty school. \\u201cColor correction was such a challenge. It was super overwhelming at first and I ran into a lot of speed bumps along the way,\\u201d she says. \\u201cThose bumps turned into lessons and ultimately I feel like I learned the most with that assignment.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Beauty?<\\/h2>\\n<p>The beauty industry is all about making changes. That\\u2019s what Kaiti loves about it. From cutting off entire ponytails and shaving heads to creating beautiful balayage, she\\u2019s all about the transformative power of beauty. \\u201cI feel like I\\u2019m back in art class just freely painting on the hair,\\u201d she says. \\u201cI\\u2019m confident that I\\u2019ll continue to get better at this. The sky is the limit.\\u201d As someone who thrives on connection, she also loves that the beauty industry gives her the chance to really be herself. Kaiti wants her clients to trust her and leave happy, so she does her best to listen to needs and create positive energy while making someone\\u2019s vision come to life.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\/c39fa323-8ab0-4f5a-a533-c2e1c8aef130-1\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2743\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2743\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-300x293.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Photo of one of Kaiti\'s clients with pink colored hair.\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"514\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-300x293.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-768x749.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-410x400.jpeg 410w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-615x600.jpeg 615w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1-550x537.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/C39FA323-8AB0-4F5A-A533-C2E1C8AEF130-1.jpeg 828w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Kaiti as a Stylist<\\/h2>\\n<p>As a level three stylist at school, Kaiti is almost prepared for an externship. She hopes that wherever she externs can turn into a career as an associate stylist. \\u201cI\\u2019m extremely grateful and excited for what\\u2019s to come,\\u201d she says. \\u201cThe energy I bring to a salon is unique. I have a passion for what I do, a genuine interest in people and making them feel good. I bring that to work with me every day.\\u201d Kaiti graduates from Summit in June 2019 and can\\u2019t wait to put her talent, confidence, and bubbly personality to good use!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\/a8b8a661-3503-48cb-b41f-4d1a132ed26b-1\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2744\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2744\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"Shot of Kaiti\'s client with curled balayage hair.\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"463\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1.jpeg 828w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1-300x263.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1-768x674.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1-456x400.jpeg 456w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1-683x600.jpeg 683w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/02\\/A8B8A661-3503-48CB-B41F-4D1A132ED26B-1-550x483.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><em>You can follow Kaiti on Instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/loyal2_thefoil\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">@loyal2_thefoil<\\/a>!<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<h2>Become a Part of Summit!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Kaiti is just one of the many incredible students to talk through our doors at Summit Salon Academy. To become a part of our beautiful family, <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">contact us today to learn about applying to our cosmetology program<\\/a>!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We love getting the recognize students every single month. Click here to meet Kaiti Markuson! <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2741,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[24,25,124,139,126,89],\"class_list\":[\"post-2740\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-beauty-school\",\"tag-cosmetology\",\"tag-social-promoter-of-the-month\",\"tag-star-student\",\"tag-student-life\",\"tag-summit-beauty-school-tacoma\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"It\\u2019s time for another social promoter of the month! February\\u2019s exceptional student is Kaiti Markuson. Read our blog post to learn more.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-kaiti-markuson\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month Kaiti Markuson | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Kaiti Markuson\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2019\\\\\\/02\\\\\\/Summit-SOM-Feb2019-H