INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(397, 3, 'post', '2787', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Nicole Bellinger', 50, 'done', 1, 1068, '', '{\"id\":2787,\"date\":\"2019-03-08T10:35:19\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-03-08T18:35:19\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2787\"},\"modified\":\"2019-03-12T14:19:16\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-03-12T21:19:16\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Nicole Bellinger\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We are so proud of our students and the hard work and dedication they put into what they do. That\\u2019s why we love having the opportunity to recognize our students individually. It\\u2019s that time again and this month we\\u2019re spotlighting Nicole Bellinger!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>Before Nicole started school at Summit Salon Academy, she was going to community college and working part-time. So why did she make the switch and enroll here? Nicole says that hair, lashes, eyebrows and anything else beauty related have always interested her.\\u201cSo I decided, why not make my career about something I love.\\u201d she told us. &#8220;I heard [Summit Salon Academy] was one of the top beauty schools in Washington state, so I decided to check it out for myself and I loved it.&#8221; We are honored that she chose us to fulfill her passion for beauty.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger\\/image003\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2793\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2793\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-225x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Woman with curled hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"703\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image003-550x733.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Her Experience in School<\\/h2>\\n<p>Nicole loves the creative liberty that she\\u2019s allowed whenever she comes to school. At cosmetology school, she can feel proud of the creative work she\\u2019s able to give to people. One of the best parts of this career is seeing people light up when they see their new hairstyle. Nicole also said that she has learned a lot of valuable life lessons since enrolling at our school. \\u201cI learned that it\\u2019s always important to listen to your educators and always be willing to try new things\\u201d, she told us. That\\u2019s the great thing about learning beauty, there\\u2019s always room to grow.<\\/p>\\n<p>Nicole has been a student at Summit Salon Academy for four months and she\\u2019s already learning as much as she can. She wants to study everything about beauty and she encourages others to do the same. Her advice to anyone who is looking to become a new student is to take advantage of your time at beauty school. &#8220;Be open to learning new things and discovering new ways to do things and have fun\\u201d, she says. \\u201cBecause you should also be having fun.\\u201d Nicole\\u2019s enthusiasm to try new things is what makes her a great student!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Beauty Through Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>Social media is a great way to get your reputation as a credible beauty stylist out in the world and Nicole can attest to this. Before getting involved in beauty, Nicole only used her Instagram for personal use. Now she\\u2019s able to have an account that lets her show off what she\\u2019s able to do as a cosmetologist. \\u201cI was surprised that my beauty Instagram already has 150+ followers\\u201d, she says. \\u201cAll my friends as well as others are interested in my work, and are very supportive as well.&#8221;<br \\/>\\nShe loves putting her work out there and tries to post once or twice each week. Her advice to other students is to post everything they can. \\u201cAlways stay active on social media because that\\u2019s the best way to stay in touch and relevant to people who you don\\u2019t see or interact with on a daily basis.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger\\/image002\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2799\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2799\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"523\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002.jpg 1242w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-300x298.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-768x762.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-1024x1016.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-403x400.jpg 403w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-605x600.jpg 605w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/03\\/image002-550x546.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Nicole on Instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/cosmobynicoleb\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@cosmobynicoleb<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Learn More About Us<\\/h2>\\n<p>Were you inspired by Nicole\\u2019s story as much as we were? <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">Look into our cosmetology program<\\/a> where you can start fueling your passion for beauty. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to find out how you can become part of our family!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>This month\\u2019s social promoter of the month is Nicole Bellinger. Read more to hear her story.  <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2789,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[25,124],\"class_list\":[\"post-2787\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\",\"tag-cosmetology\",\"tag-social-promoter-of-the-month\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"It\\u2019s that time again where we spotlight one of our amazing students! This month we\\u2019re recognizing Nicole Bellinger. Check out what she\\u2019s accomplished so far!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nicole-bellinger\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n