INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(401, 3, 'post', '2908', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Daria Anderson', 50, 'done', 1, 1072, '', '{\"id\":2908,\"date\":\"2019-05-29T10:41:06\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-05-29T17:41:06\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2908\"},\"modified\":\"2019-05-29T12:07:46\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-05-29T19:07:46\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Daria Anderson\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we love watching our students progress in their beauty education. Our students are some of the most incredible individuals because of their talents and desire to push their creativity. We are so proud of their dedication and that\\u2019s why we love taking the time to spotlight one each month. This month we\\u2019re highlighting Daria Anderson. Read below to find out more about her!<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Daria<\\/h2>\\n<p>Daria began her beauty education with us in November 2018. Before she started learning beauty techniques, she was working as a shift lead at Mod Pizza. She decided to study beauty because doing something with hair has always been her passion. We asked her what\\u2019s been her favorite part of the beauty industry so far. She told us that she\\u2019s loved learning about fashion colors and seeing dramatic hair transformations coming to life. We\\u2019re so happy that she chose to pursue her passion with us and we can\\u2019t wait to see what else she\\u2019ll learn during her time at beauty school!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/purple-hair\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2918\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2918\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/purple-hair-212x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"purple hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"746\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/purple-hair-212x300.jpg 212w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/purple-hair-283x400.jpg 283w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/purple-hair-424x600.jpg 424w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/purple-hair.jpg 452w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Study Beauty With Us<\\/h2>\\n<p>Daria says that she always wanted to do something beauty related. She decided to pursue her passion with us because she believed that Summit Salon Academy was the \\u201cbest school in the area.\\u201d Daria loves that the beauty industry is a place where she can be creative. We are so excited that we get to watch her grow as stylist and see her gain confidence in her abilities.<\\/p>\\n<p>We\\u2019re so glad that students can feel encouraged to go after their dreams in cosmetology. Daria says that learning to trust herself has been one of the most valuable lessons she\\u2019s learned so far in beauty school. We asked her what advice she\\u2019d give to new students. \\u201cTrust your process,\\u201d she told us. \\u201cGive it your 100%.\\u201d We are so proud of Daria and the hard work she\\u2019s put in her education. Her positive attitude and determined personality are just some of the reasons why she\\u2019s a great student here!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/daria\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2915\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2915\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria-295x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"dark color change\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"536\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria-295x300.jpg 295w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria-393x400.jpg 393w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria-590x600.jpg 590w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria-550x559.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/05\\/daria.jpg 650w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Beauty Through Social<\\/h2>\\n<p>Being a social promoter outside of beauty school, Daria knows just how important social media can be. Even before starting beauty school, she was already using social media a lot and she saw the difference it can make. Since color transformations is a favorite of hers, Daria says that she makes sure to post her work to Instagram whenever she has a chance to make a great change in someone\\u2019s hair color.<\\/p>\\n<p>Daria knows that social media can be a great way to show off your beauty skills. She has great advice for anyone looking to become a beauty student. \\u201cFollow similar hair pages or salon industry pages,\\u201d she told us. \\u201cThink of the time of day you are posting to reach your audience.\\u201d We are so excited that Daria is thinking about these things and is using her social media knowledge to promote her beauty skills!<\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Daria on her Instagram account <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair_by_derz\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@hair_by_derz<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Begin Your Beauty Journey Here<\\/h2>\\n<p>Did you enjoy hearing about Daria and her experience in beauty school so far? If you\\u2019re like Daria and have a passion for beauty, then our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> could be a great fit for you. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to find out how you can start and become part of the Summit Salon family!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our social promoter of the month is Daria Anderson. Click here to read more about her and her experience in beauty school so far.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2909,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[149,163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2908\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-cosmetology\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"It\\u2019s time to spotlight one of our students again. This month we\\u2019re highlighting Daria Anderson. Check out what amazing things she\\u2019s already accomplished!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Daria Anderson | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Daria Anderson\\\",\\\"au