:\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"2908\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/\",\"dest_id\":1072,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2019\\/05\\/29\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-daria-anderson\\/\",\"title\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Daria Anderson\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":9,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":2,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:01:43');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(402, 3, 'post', '2924', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event/', 'Hair BRA-Zaar: Under the Big Top Event', 50, 'done', 1, 1073, '', '{\"id\":2924,\"date\":\"2019-06-27T09:27:48\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-06-27T16:27:48\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2924\"},\"modified\":\"2019-10-14T14:16:25\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-10-14T21:16:25\",\"slug\":\"hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Hair BRA-Zaar: Under the Big Top Event\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we celebrated our fourth annual Hair BRA-Zaar event on June 5th. This event has a special place in our hearts because it allows us to see our students\\u2019 creativity while also raising money for the breast cancer foundation, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.wingsofkaren.org\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Wings of Karen<\\/a>! We are so lucky that we\\u2019ve been able to work with this incredible non-profit for the past four years. We\\u2019re always amazed by what our community is able to accomplish. All the proceeds from this event go directly to the Wings of Karen foundation to help fund important research in the effort to find a cure for breast cancer. This year we sold 152 tickets and raised $11,300 in total donations! We couldn\\u2019t have done this without the help from our students, staff, and the amazing community of Tacoma.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/2019-hair-bra-zaar-sumit-salon-academy-tacoma-program-and-runw-4\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2934\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2934\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-200x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman in circus costume\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"791\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-267x400.jpg 267w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-400x600.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_349_program-and-runway-550x825.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Behind the Event<\\/h2>\\n<p>Summit\\u2019s Hair BRA-Zaar event has raised money for the past four years to help support a community based breast cancer organization, Wings of Karen. This non-profit was started by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.wingsofkaren.org\\/kristifounder\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Kristi Blair<\\/a>, an amazing woman and someone we\\u2019re lucky to have met! <a href=\\\"\\/how-our-hair-bra-zaar-events-help-fight-breast-cancer\\/\\\">Her incredible story<\\/a> of resilience is what led her to start this organization. After both her mother, Karen and Kristi were diagnosed with breast cancer, she knew that she wanted to make a difference for others who are fighting the same battle. She started Wings of Karen to help support breast cancer research in the Pacific Northwest. All the money raised from our Hair BRA-Zaar will be donated to Kristi\\u2019s organization to help support the continuing research of breast cancer.<\\/p>\\n<h2>This Year\\u2019s Theme<\\/h2>\\n<p>Every year, our event has a theme to inspire our students\\u2019 runway looks. This year\\u2019s theme was \\u201cUnder the Big Top\\u201d and we were so impressed by the looks they created! Like our previous Hair-BRA-Zaar events, students were asked to decorate a bra and then design an entire look based on that bra. In addition to being stylists and makeup artists, some of our students even took to the runway as models. With this year\\u2019s theme, we saw a lot of amazing circus-inspired looks. Our students\\u2019 circus looks included their makeup, hair, and even costumes! From a bodybuilder to a tiger, they gave the theme their personal touch.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/2019-hair-bra-zaar-sumit-salon-academy-tacoma-program-and-runw-6\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2941\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2941\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-200x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman in clown costume\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"790\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-267x400.jpg 267w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-400x600.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_369_program-and-runway-550x825.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>We love seeing what our students come up with and their creativity always makes this a night to remember. This event is a great way for students to show off their beauty skills while also highlighting women\\u2019s health. With this event, we hope to bring awareness to breast cancer and the need to raise money for a cure. Some of our models were even breast cancer survivors themselves. These women are incredible images of strength, which is why we like to call them \\u201cthrivors.\\u201d We\\u2019re impressed with them and thrilled that our event shows off how amazing they are!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/2019-hair-bra-zaar-sumit-salon-academy-tacoma-candid-and-rando\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2930\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2930\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"styling a woman\'s hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"351\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Special Guests<\\/h2>\\n<p>At our event, we had some great guests come visit with us. Sydney Berry, the President of Salon Services and a board member for Wings of Karen, shared her story with breast cancer before our show began. It was so humbling to hear her talk and it was a great start to our event. Mary L \\u201cNora\\u201d Disis, MD from the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/depts.washington.edu\\/tumorvac\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">University of Washington Cancer Vaccine Institute<\\/a> also came to talk about her research and update us on the breast cancer vaccine that\\u2019s being developed by her research funded in part by Wings of Karen. We want to thank them for coming to our event! Our students were inspired by their words and we know the difference it makes for them when they can see the people behind the incredible work!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/2019-hair-bra-zaar-sumit-salon-academy-tacoma-program-and-runw-5\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2936\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2936\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Special guests with Summit\'s owners\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"351\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/06\\/190605_423_program-and-runway-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>In addition to guests associated with the Wings of Karen foundation, we also had representative Kelly Chambers from the 25th District in Puyallup attend our event. Having the support from our community means a lot to us, so we\\u2019re glad that she could be there.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Join Our Community<\\/h2>\\n<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we love getting involved and helping out when we can. This Hair BRA-Zaar event has become a special day that we look forward to every year. We know that this wouldn\\u2019t have been possible without our amazing community and students! A main principle at Summit Salon is to \\u201cLead With Our Heart\\u201d and we see that all the time in both our students and staff.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you\\u2019re looking for a beauty school to call home, then Summit Salon Academy could be the right choice for you. Not only do we teach our students the latest in beauty techniques, but we\\u2019re also committed to helping you get involved in the community. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to find out more about our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> and how you can start the application process!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We just had our fourth annual Hair BRA-Zaar event. Click here to read all about it!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2926,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[162,19],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2924\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-hair-bra-zaar\",\"category-news-events\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"This year\\u2019s Hair BRA-Zaar theme was \\u201cUnder the Big Top.\\u201d Our students were able to create circus looks while raising money for breast cancer. Read more about it here!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hair BRA-Zaar: Under the Big Top Event | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Hair BRA-Zaar: Under the Big Top Event\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2019\\\\\\/06\\\\\\/190605_429_program-and-runway.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":8002,\\\"height\\\":5335,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"Summit Salon Academy Tacoma will host \\\\\\\"Under the Big Top\\\\\\\", the 4th Annual Hair BRA-Zaar and Auction Benefit. This year\'s event will feature creative circus inspired hair and makeup looks created by students and alumni of the academy. Join us for a show, silent auction and raffle! All proceeds from the event will help support the Wings of Karen Foundation. Wings of Karen is a grassroots organization that strongly believes donors should know how their hard earned dollars are turned into tangible hope! Before the event, general admission tickets are $20, VIP ticket are $40. All tickets will be $5 more