(403, 3, 'post', '2944', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-madison-messer/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Madison Messer', 50, 'done', 1, 1074, '', '{\"id\":2944,\"date\":\"2019-06-28T01:00:38\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-06-28T08:00:38\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2944\"},\"modified\":\"2019-07-01T07:07:15\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-07-01T14:07:15\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-madison-messer\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-madison-messer\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Madison Messer\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We are excited to congratulate our June Social Promoter of the Month, Madison Messer! She came to us all the way from Kansas and she\\u2019s being recognized for her success in school and on Instagram. Maddi promotes her salon services and posts her work on her Instagram account, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/maddi.m.colorist\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@maddi.m.colorist<\\/a>. <\\/p>\\n<h2>Instagram Promotion<\\/h2>\\n<p>Since she started posting about beauty, Maddi has noticed an increase in likes and comments on her Instagram account! She posts lots of before and afters, and she is sure to take photos of all her work. Posting her work consistently and inviting people to come visit her in the salon has helped her showcase her skills and begin to grow a clientele!<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/ByT9hQsH6OG\\/\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"12\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:16px;\\\"> <a hre