0 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\\\"><\\/path><\\/g><\\/g><\\/g><\\/svg><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\\\"> View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/ByT9hQsH6OG\\/\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">A post shared by Maddi Messer (@maddi.m.colorist)<\\/a> on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2019-06-05T02:49:05+00:00\\\">Jun 4, 2019 at 7:49pm PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Using Hashtags<\\/h2>\\n<p>Maddi\\u2019s advice to a new beauty student or stylist is to use hashtags! Here at Summit Salon Academy, we know how important hashtags are. If you\\u2019re new to hashtags, here are a few pointers!<\\/p>\\n<h3>Types of Hashtags<\\/h3>\\n<p>There are a few different types of hashtags to include on your Instagram posts:<\\/p>\\n<h4>Popular hashtags<\\/h4>\\n<p>Tags with hundreds of thousands or even millions of posts are definitely popular! You can use a few of these on your post, but make sure they are relevant to your post. Using tags like #behindthechair or #balayage are good, but you should avoid very general or spammy tags like #followforfollow or #girl.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Specific hashtags<\\/h4>\\n<p>These tags are more specific to the photo and will have fewer posts. It\\u2019s usually a good idea to use a few of these tags, too. Tagging the color, product, or technique you used are all good ideas. You can also use tags that describe your post, like #purplebalayage.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Local hashtags<\\/h4>\\n<p>You should use the most of these tags, because they help you grow a clientele and interact with your local stylist community. Local hashtags include your location. Some examples would be #tacomahairstylist, #washingtonhairstyles, or #seattlesalon. People looking for inspiration or a new stylist will scroll through these tags, and other stylists will too.<\\/p>\\n<h2>A Place for Every Hairstyle<\\/h2>\\n<p>Maddi says she is passionate about cosmetology, specifically hair color. She is glad to be at Summit. She came to cosmetology with her boyfriends\\u2019 encouragement and chose Summit because it is the best place to be, according to many hair stylists in her life. <\\/p>\\n<p>Whether you love bright fashion colors like Maddi or you have your own unique style, you can pursue your passion for cosmetology here at Summit! If you\\u2019d like to learn more about our <a href=\\\"\\/courses\\/\\\">beauty programs<\\/a> and our social media training, please <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">contact us<\\/a>. We are excited to hear from you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our June student of the month is Madison Messer, and she\\u2019s passionate about color! Learn about her path to cosmetology and the Instagram tips that have helped her.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2945,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2944\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<me