INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(404, 3, 'post', '2991', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-nina-fournier/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Nina Fournier', 50, 'done', 1, 1075, '', '{\"id\":2991,\"date\":\"2019-07-26T08:00:09\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-07-26T15:00:09\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=2991\"},\"modified\":\"2019-07-26T08:00:09\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-07-26T15:00:09\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-nina-fournier\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nina-fournier\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Nina Fournier\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we love getting to know our students and their unique creative style they bring to our school. It\\u2019s amazing to watch them study and become better at something they\\u2019re passionate about. Every month we recognize their talents, and this month we\\u2019re highlighting Nina Fournier. Her love of beauty and making others feel great are just some reasons why she\\u2019s an incredible student! Find out more about her.<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Nina<\\/h2>\\n<p>Before Nina started our cosmetology program in January, she was working at Starbucks and studying to become a nurse. So, why did she make the huge leap to beauty school? Nina says that she decided to study beauty because she loves interacting with new people and helping them discover their inner beauty. \\u201cI\\u2019ve always loved everything beauty,\\u201d she told us. \\u201cBut I also love being able to enhance people\\u2019s natural beauty and making them feel just as good as they look!\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nina-fournier\\/ninas-work\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2994\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2994\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-work-215x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman with curled lightened hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"735\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-work-215x300.jpg 215w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-work-287x400.jpg 287w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-work-430x600.jpg 430w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-work.jpg 454w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>We think that Nina is able to enhance clients\\u2019 natural beauty because of both her technical skills and her ability to genuinely connect with others. Not only do people rely on their hair stylists for beauty needs, but many also use their chair time to talk about their daily goals or worries. It\\u2019s often the conversations that make a client\\u2019s visit one to remember. No one shows this more than Nina! She says that her favorite part of the beauty industry is the relationships she forms with clients. After watching her do everything to make sure people feel important whenever they\\u2019re with her, this comes as no surprise to us!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Nina says that she chose Summit Salon Academy because she wanted to study at a school that would prepare her for a future career in beauty. When she saw our school, she knew it was the right place for her. \\u201cWhen I did my walkthrough I loved how professional the atmosphere felt! It felt more like an actual salon rather than a school!\\u201d We know that Nina loves helping a client become more confident after a new hairstyle and we\\u2019re so glad that our student salon and spa is able to give her that opportunity.<\\/p>\\n<p>For anyone who\\u2019s thinking about applying for beauty school at Summit, Nina has some great advice. She says that it\\u2019s important to have fun while also working hard at your goals. It\\u2019s a learning environment, it makes a difference when you\\u2019re studying something that you really want to know!<\\/p>\\n<h2>A Growing Social Media Presence<\\/h2>\\n<p>As she\\u2019s studying beauty techniques, Nina is also learning how social media can help her become a successful stylist. Before beauty school she just had a private account, but now she has an <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hairbynina_dawn\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Instagram<\\/a> dedicated to showing off her work and letting people know of any available appointments. Her regular posting on social media has allowed her to gain more followers and she\\u2019s even reconnected with people she hadn&#8217;t seen in years.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-nina-fournier\\/ninas-pic\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-2995\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-2995\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-pic-211x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"straightened light brown hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"748\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-pic-211x300.jpg 211w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-pic-282x400.jpg 282w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-pic-423x600.jpg 423w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/ninas-pic.jpg 441w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Social media is a great way to become an established stylist and Nina knows this. \\u201cTry to post something every day or every other day if you can,\\u201d she says. \\u201cSocial media, especially when you\\u2019re out in the industry, is the best way to reach potential new clients!\\u201d Even though Nina has only been with us since January, she\\u2019s already learned a lot about both the technical and social sides of beauty. We\\u2019re so proud of her dedication and desire to always improve her skills!<\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Nina on her instagram account <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hairbynina_dawn\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@hairbynina_dawn<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Start Your Beauty Education With Us<\\/h2>\\n<p>Do you want to learn beauty with incredible students like Nina? In our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a>, students study styling, chemical services, makeup application, and so much more! <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to find out how you can start the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\">application process<\\/a>. We can\\u2019t wait to hear from you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>This month we\\u2019re highlighting Nina Fournier! Click here to read more about her journey through beauty school so far.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":2992,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-2991\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Each month we take the time to highlight one of our amazing students. For July, we chose Nina Fournier. Read more about her and what makes her a great student!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link 