(405, 3, 'post', '3005', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Melissa Rich', 50, 'done', 1, 1076, '', '{\"id\":3005,\"date\":\"2019-09-11T13:15:59\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-09-11T20:15:59\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3005\"},\"modified\":\"2019-09-20T13:37:24\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-09-20T20:37:24\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Melissa Rich\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>It\\u2019s time to once again recognize one of our amazing students! This month, we\\u2019d like to congratulate Melissa Rich for being our August Social Promoter of the Month. We\\u2019ve loved having the opportunity to see Melissa develop her beauty skills and artistic talent. Read more about her and why she\\u2019s an amazing student!<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Melissa<\\/h2>\\n<p>Before enrolling in our cosmetology program, Melissa was planning on a future in early childhood development. She decided to make the switch to beauty because she loves the chance it gives her to express her creativity. Not only does cosmetology allow her to show off her unique style, but she\\u2019s also able to empower the clients in her chair. One of the best parts about working in the beauty industry is seeing the clients smile when they see their new style. It feels amazing to give that confidence boost to someone! We\\u2019re glad to hear that students like Melissa can see the difference they\\u2019re making in their client\\u2019s day.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Melissa\\u2019s Education at Summit<\\/h2>\\n<p>When starting her cosmetology education, Melissa wanted to make sure that the beauty school was the right fit for her. She decided to research schools by looking at their reviews and graduation rates. After finding out more about them, she knew that Summit Salon Academy was the place to start her future in beauty.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-3009\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3009\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair-300x298.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman with short curled hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"524\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair-300x298.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair-403x400.jpg 403w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair-550x546.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-short-curled-hair.jpg 603w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Melissa began her education with us about eight months ago and she\\u2019s learned so many valuable lessons since then. She says that one thing that\\u2019s stuck with her is that she\\u2019s able to create something new since hair is fluid and has unlimited possibilities! It\\u2019s a lot of hard work and dedication to discover your personal beauty style, but Melissa says that\\u2019s all been worth it. When we asked her what advice she would give to future beauty students, her response was to keep working and stay positive. If beauty is your passion, then all your beauty experiences will positively impact you to become a better cosmetologist.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Beauty Through Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>Although Melissa used social media before starting beauty school, she says that she\\u2019s noticed a big change in her number of followers. Melissa tries to post a picture of her cosmetology work at least once a week to engage with her followers and continue to show off how far she\\u2019s come since starting her education. Beauty school is also a great way for students to gain more followers and clients by interacting with their fellow students and stylists.<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair\\/\\\" rel=\\\"attachment wp-att-3008\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3008\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair-230x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman with purple dyed hair\\\" width=\\\"527\\\" height=\\\"686\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair-230x300.jpg 230w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair-307x400.jpg 307w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair-461x600.jpg 461w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/woman-with-purple-dyed-hair.jpg 467w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Melissa\\u2019s work on her instagram page <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/styledxmelissa\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@styledxmelissa<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2>Join Students Like Melissa<\\/h2>\\n<p>Were you inspired by Melissa\\u2019s story? Are you thinking of starting your own cosmetology journey? In our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a>, students learn about both the latest beauty techniques and social media training. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to find out how you can start the application process. We\\u2019re excited to hear from you and help you with a future in beauty!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our Social Promoter for this month is Melissa Rich. She\\u2019s being recognized for her passion to keep developing her beauty skills! Click here to learn more about her.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3024,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3005\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Our Social Promoter for this month is Melissa Rich. She\\u2019s being recognized for her passion to keep developing her beauty skills! Click here to learn more about her.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-melissa-rich\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Melissa Rich | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Melissa Rich\\\",\\\"author\\\":