INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(406, 3, 'post', '3020', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Emma Tillotson', 50, 'done', 1, 1077, '', '{\"id\":3020,\"date\":\"2019-09-20T07:53:51\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-09-20T14:53:51\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3020\"},\"modified\":\"2019-09-20T13:42:30\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-09-20T20:42:30\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Emma Tillotson\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we love getting the chance to watch our students develop skills in something they\\u2019re passionate about. Our students are some of the most hardworking and dedicated individuals. Each month we highlight one of them and the hard work they\\u2019ve done. We\\u2019re excited to announce that Emma Tillotson is our Social Promoter of the Month for September! Read more to learn about her journey in cosmetology school so far! <\\/p>\\n<h2>About Emma<\\/h2>\\n<p>Emma has been a student at Summit Academy for over two months now. She enrolled with us right after graduating high school because she says that a career in beauty has always been something she could see herself pursuing. Even before starting in our cosmetology program, Emma was already trying out new styles on her friends\\u2019 hair. <\\/p>\\n<p>Her desire to learn all she can about beauty is evident and we love watching her develop skills in something she loves so much. \\u201cMy favorite part of the beauty industry is that there is always something new to learn,\\u201d she says. \\u201cEvery day you can learn something new or even a new way to do something.\\u201d With beauty trends constantly changing, we couldn\\u2019t agree more with Emma!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit<\\/h2>\\n<p>Emma chose to study cosmetology with us after taking a tour of our school. She said that after talking with our <a href=\\\"\\/about-us\\/staff\\/\\\">Admissions Representative<\\/a>, she felt like she was welcomed in our community and could call Summit Academy her home. We are so glad that students can visit our school and know that they belong in our family. <\\/p>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-51bca7e4086679bfe3c20d15c1d19b73 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B1XlJmCHEaI\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>If Emma could give advice to other students in our programs, she said that she would tell them to talk to the other students in the classes before you. She has found that the students at Summit have been kind and eager to give her advice that they\\u2019ve learned in their beauty journey. We love hearing about the relationships that are formed in our school and we couldn\\u2019t be happier that Emma is able to learn more about her passion from people who can share their similar experiences. <\\/p>\\n<h2>Beauty Through Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>Emma has had an Instagram account since she was in fifth grade, but since starting beauty school she can see just how much social media can benefit her as a cosmetologist. Once she enrolled in our program, she created a separate account to show off what she can do in the beauty industry. Her old account allowed her to encourage followers to check out her beauty Instagram. She\\u2019s been able to grow her cosmetology account more quickly and show people how much she\\u2019s progressing in beauty. Since she\\u2019s recently graduated, Emma says that this is a great opportunity to show students who are still in high school what the beauty industry is all about. Emma\\u2019s positive attitude is just one reason why she\\u2019s a great person for high school students to connect with and we\\u2019re so happy to have her representing our school!<\\/p>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-b2ba5827791129b86493461a70c3b61c ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B1ZSmOzHYF-\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>She says that she tries to post her work whenever she can. Now that she\\u2019s moved up in our program and working with clients, we can\\u2019t wait to see what she\\u2019ll be able to post! She has a lot of great advice to give students on how to use social media! Including pictures of yourself to connect more with followers, using lots of hashtags, and adding a location to your pictures are some of the things she suggests. In today\\u2019s beauty world, knowing how to use social media to promote your skills is just as important as learning how to perform cosmetology techniques. We\\u2019re proud of students like Emma who are excited to learn more about both the beauty and business side of cosmetology!<\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Emma on her beauty Instagram account <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hairbyemmarose_\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@hairbyemmarose_<\\/a> <\\/p>\\n<h2>Ready to Start Your Cosmetology Education<\\/h2>\\n<p>Do you want to start learning all about the latest beauty techniques with amazing students like Emma? <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a> to learn about our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> and how you can start the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\">application process<\\/a>. We can\\u2019t wait to hear from you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our September Social Promoter of the Month is Emma Tillotson. Click here to learn about her beauty journey so far!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3025,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3020\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Each month, we like to take time and recognize one of our amazing students. September\\u2019s Social Promoter of the Month is Emma Tillotson. Click here to learn more about her!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Emma Tillotson | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Emma Tillotson\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2019\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/SummitSalonAcademy_BlogHeader_SPOM_EmmaTillotson_2019_09Sept.png\\\",\\\"width\\\":1260,\\\"height\\\":789,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"picture of Emma Tillotson\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2019-09-20T07:53:51-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2019-09-20T13:42:30-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emma-tillotson\\\\\\/#webpage\\\"},\\\"articleSection\\\":\\\"Social Promoter\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-emm