(407, 3, 'post', '3086', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/3086-2/', 'Chemo Care Bags', 50, 'done', 1, 1078, '', '{\"id\":3086,\"date\":\"2019-10-25T16:54:23\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-10-25T23:54:23\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3086\"},\"modified\":\"2019-10-25T16:58:51\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-10-25T23:58:51\",\"slug\":\"3086-2\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/3086-2\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Chemo Care Bags\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<h2>Spotlight on an amazing local hair stylist!<\\/h2>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_3087\\\" style=\\\"width: 310px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3087\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3087 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM-150x150.png 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM-401x400.png 401w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM-550x549.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2019-10-25-at-4.48.18-PM.png 597w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3087\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Kimmie and Kendra Moore<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Kimmie Moore is a great friend of the Academy. She has been working in the beauty industry for 34 years! You can find her at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/EntourageSalonSpa\\/\\\">Entourage Salon<\\/a> in Des Moines, WA. She loves Bocce Ball, hiking, scuba diving going to Maui, and her fantastic family\\u2014including her daughter Kendra. Kimmie has a self-proclaimed addiction to volunteering!<\\/p>\\n<p>Six years ago, tragedy struck when Kendra\\u2019s best friend\\u2019s mother lost her battle to Triple-Negative Breast Cancer. The heartbreak of losing someone they loved spurred Kimmie and Kendra to figure out a way to support people going through chemotherapy.<\\/p>\\n<p>In November 2014, after a fundraiser, Kendra\\u2019s Chemo Bags and Kimmie\\u2019s Chemo Bags were born. Their mission is to bring happiness, smiles, and love to those going through chemo.<\\/p>\\n<p>Each bag is a bag of love for people going through chemo. A typical bag contains some of the following:\\u00a0 lip treatments, skincare masks, moisturizer, facial cleanser, non-slip socks, art projects, coloring books, word searches, inspirational rock with a quote, facial tissue, playing cards, Life Savers candies, a journal and pen, a pillbox, hand lotion, tea, notes of encouragement, and a happy face stress ball! Each bag varies based on what they have available and what they think would work for each individual cancer warrior based on gender and age. Each package comes in a custom-made box.<\\/p>\\n<p>Kimmie and Kendra have been sending bags out to women, men, and children for six years! They are still spreading this love and joy even since Kendra went off to college in California. Every person that is nominated receives a box, for FREE, the person nominating is asked to cover the cost of shipping, which is $14.95.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you would like to help this amazing cause, Kimmie says \\u201cwe always need box artists, note writers, rock artists and,\\u00a0we always love donations!\\u201d Check out their <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/pg\\/Kimmies-Chemo-Care-Bags-1610677642526874\\/about\\/?ref=page_internal\\\">facebook page<\\/a> to donate or get involved!<\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_3090\\\" style=\\\"width: 239px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3090\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3090 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6-229x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"229\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6-229x300.jpeg 229w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6-305x400.jpeg 305w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6-458x600.jpeg 458w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6-550x720.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image6.jpeg 750w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 229px) 100vw, 229px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3090\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Sample Bag<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_3091\\\" style=\\\"width: 235px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3091\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3091 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5-225x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5-450x600.jpeg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5-550x734.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image5.jpeg 750w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3091\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">Sample Bag<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_3089\\\" style=\\\"width: 226px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3089\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3089 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-216x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"216\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-216x300.jpeg 216w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-738x1024.jpeg 738w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-288x400.jpeg 288w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-432x600.jpeg 432w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7-550x763.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image7.jpeg 750w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 216px) 100vw, 216px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3089\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">All packed up and ready to spread some love!<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<div id=\\\"attachment_3088\\\" style=\\\"width: 308px\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3088\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3088 size-medium\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-298x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"298\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-298x300.jpeg 298w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-398x400.jpeg 398w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-597x600.jpeg 597w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0-550x553.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/image0.jpeg 750w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 298px) 100vw, 298px\\\" \\/><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3088\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\">A note from a happy recipient<\\/p><\\/div>\\n<p>We love Kimmie and her HUGE heart, so during the month of October, a portion of Redken Pink and Dermalogica Age Smart products will be donated to support this amazing cause!<br \\/>\\n<img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3059\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--300x157.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"157\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--300x157.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--768x402.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--1024x536.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--764x400.png 764w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--1146x600.png 1146w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider--550x288.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Breast-Cancer-Slider-.png 1200w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Spotlight on an amazing local hair stylist! &nbsp; Kimmie Moore is a great friend of the Academy. She has been working in the beauty industry for 34 years! You can find her at Entourage Salon in Des Moines, WA. She loves Bocce Ball, hiking, scuba diving going to Maui, and her fantastic family\\u2014including her daughter&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3089,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3086\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Kimmie Moore, a local stylist is bringing happiness, smiles, and love to those going through chemo.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/3086-2\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/3086-2\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Chemo Care Bags, a local stylist gives back | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Chemo Care Bags\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2019\\\\\\/10\\\\\\/image7.jpeg\\\",\\\"width\\\":750,\\\"height\\\":