tsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/3101\\/revisions\\/4300\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/3104\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=3101\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=3101\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=3101\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"3101\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-pay-for-beauty-school-scholarships\\/\",\"dest_id\":1080,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2019\\/11\\/08\\/how-to-pay-for-beauty-school-scholarships\\/\",\"title\":\"How to Pay for Beauty School: Scholarships!\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":12,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":6,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:01:55');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(410, 3, 'post', '3133', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-alyssa-brown/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Alyssa Brown', 50, 'done', 1, 1081, '', '{\"id\":3133,\"date\":\"2019-11-27T09:45:32\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-11-27T17:45:32\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3133\"},\"modified\":\"2019-11-27T09:45:32\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-11-27T17:45:32\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-alyssa-brown\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-alyssa-brown\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alyssa Brown\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We\\u2019re excited to announce November\\u2019s Student of the Month, Alyssa Brown! We\\u2019re excited to highlight Alyssa and the great work she\\u2019s been doing.  <\\/p>\\n<h2>About Alyssa<\\/h2>\\n<p>Alyssa joined Summit after graduating from High School hoping to continue her education doing something she loved &#8211; making people feel beautiful! For as long as she can remember, Alyssa has enjoyed doing hair and makeup and is excited to turn her passion into a career. She chose Summit Salon Academy because of its convenient location and how well the program fit her goals and lifestyle. We\\u2019re so glad to have her as a student.  <\\/p>\\n<h2>Alyssa\\u2019s Education at Summit<\\/h2>\\n<p>Over the last 11 months at Summit, Alyssa has learned a lot about beauty and herself. She\\u2019s discovered that her favorite techniques to practice are blonding and balayage, and let\\u2019s be honest, who doesn\\u2019t love achieving that perfect color? <\\/p>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-6694dfa8b898699a24c03f4a0ec8d951 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/Bz7DJIhAX4P\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div><\\/p>\\n<p>But Alyssa told us that the most valuable lesson she has learned in school so far is that if you push yourself and work hard for what you want, you can achieve anything. Her advice to other students who are starting out in a beauty program: practice makes perfect! We love Alyssa\\u2019s positive attitude and drive to succeed!  <\\/p>\\n<h2>Beauty Through Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>About once a week, Alyssa utilizes social media to show off her work. A pro tip she recommends is to include a lot of location hashtags, like #tacomahairstylist, so that people in the area will see the posts.<\\/p>\\n<p>Alyssa was excited to see that her beauty account has grown by a lot of followers since joining the program thanks to referrals and her great use of hashtags. If you want to see more of Alyssa\\u2019s work, you can follow her instagram page @hair.by.alyssamarie. <\\/p>\\n<h2>Join Students Like Alyssa<\\/h2>\\n<p>We hope you enjoyed getting to know our November Student of the Month, Alyssa. If you\\u2019re feeling inspired to pursue your own beauty career, our cosmetology program can help you learn about the latest beauty techniques as well as social media practices. Contact us to find out how you can start the application process. We\\u2019re excited to hear from you and want to help you with a future in beauty!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Our Social Promoter for November is Alyssa Brown. She\\u2019s being recognized for her passion for becoming an awesome beauty professional! Click here to learn more about her.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3137,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3133\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Our Social Promoter for November is Alyssa Brown. She\\u2019s being recognized for her passion for becoming an awesome beauty professional! Click here to learn more about her.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-alyssa-brown\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-alyssa-brown\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alyssa Brown | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Alyssa Brown\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonaca