(411, 3, 'post', '3139', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/smallbusiness19', 'Small Business Saturday', 50, 'done', 1, 1082, '', '{\"id\":3139,\"date\":\"2019-11-27T13:09:19\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-11-27T21:09:19\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3139\"},\"modified\":\"2019-11-27T13:09:19\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2019-11-27T21:09:19\",\"slug\":\"small-business-saturday\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/smallbusiness19\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Small Business Saturday\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Source Sans Pro\',sans-serif; color: #1b1e29; letter-spacing: -.3pt;\\\">Your friends and relatives are special. This holiday season, the gifts you give them should be special, too! <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Source Sans Pro\',sans-serif; color: #1b1e29; letter-spacing: -.3pt;\\\">We all know about Black Friday and Cyber Monday. But our personal favorite (we MIGHT be biased) is Small Business Saturday! This shopping day, which will take place on Saturday November 30<sup>th<\\/sup> this year celebrates the local businesses that make OUR community unique.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Source Sans Pro\',sans-serif; color: #1b1e29; letter-spacing: -.3pt;\\\">This Small Business Saturday, we have some AMAZING gift ideas!\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2>Skin Care!<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-3152 alignnone\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-214x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"214\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-214x300.jpg 214w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-732x1024.jpg 732w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-768x1075.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-1098x1536.jpg 1098w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-1464x2048.jpg 1464w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-286x400.jpg 286w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-429x600.jpg 429w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-550x770.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5841-scaled.jpg 1830w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Dermalogica Skin Care Kits. A whole regimen to handle any skin type! Available in Active Clearing, Clear Start, Normal\\/ Dry, Normal\\/ Oily , UltraCalming, ($39.95) and AgeSmart ($54.95)<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3148\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-300x214.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-1024x731.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-768x549.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-1536x1097.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-2048x1463.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-560x400.jpg 560w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-840x600.jpg 840w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5832-550x393.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\