itsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5848-550x770.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5848-scaled.jpg 1828w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Lyocel fiber single-use eye contour mask infused with an active serum of hyaluronate, peptides\\/amino acids, and natural root extracts is the perfect antidote for environmentally or lifestyle stressed eyes.\\u00a0 Depuffs, decongests, and tightens the delicate eye area to restore a brighter, refreshed and more lifted look.\\u00a0($9.95)<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3143\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-225x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-550x733.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5855-scaled.jpg 1920w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Dermalogica Age Bright Clearing Serum. This active two-in-one serum clears and helps prevent breakouts while reducing visible skin aging. Salicylic Acid reduces breakouts to clear skin. This highly-concentrated serum exfoliates to help prevent breakouts and accelerates cell turnover to reduce signs of skin aging. ($64.95)<\\/p>\\n<h2>Hair Care!<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3153\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-214x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"214\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-214x300.jpg 214w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-731x1024.jpg 731w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-768x1075.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-1097x1536.jpg 1097w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-1463x2048.jpg 1463w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-286x400.jpg 286w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-429x600.jpg 429w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-550x770.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5860-scaled.jpg 1829w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\\\" \\/> <img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3151\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5858-300x214.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5858-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5858-1024x732.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5858-768x549.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5858-1536x1097.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/