mitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-731x1024.jpg 731w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-768x1075.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-1097x1536.jpg 1097w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-1463x2048.jpg 1463w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-286x400.jpg 286w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-429x600.jpg 429w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-550x770.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5831-scaled.jpg 1829w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Redken Frizz Dismiss Instant Deflate Oil In Serum is part of Redken&#8217;s reinvented Frizz Dismiss collection. These haircare products provide smoothing benefits and humidity protection for all types of frizzy hair. ($26.95)<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h2>For the gentlemen!<\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3144\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-300x225.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"225\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-533x400.jpg 533w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-800x600.jpg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5857-550x413.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Redken Brews Holiday Kit! Give the gift of great hair to your friends and family this holiday season. Prepackaged and easy to wrap! Each kit comes with a Shampoo, styling product and our FAVORITE body soap! ($32.95)<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3154\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-214x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"214\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-214x300.jpg 214w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-731x1024.jpg 731w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-768x1075.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-1097x1536.jpg 1097w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-1463x2048.jpg 1463w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-286x400.jpg 286w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-429x600.jpg 429w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-550x770.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5822-scaled.jpg 1829w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>This beard oil by Redken Brews moisturizes beard hair and conditions dry skin under beards. ($15.95)<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3150\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-300x214.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"214\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-1024x731.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-768x548.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-1536x1097.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-2048x1462.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-560x400.jpg 560w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-840x600.jpg 840w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/IMG_5866-550x393.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Redken Brews Cleansing Bar-The best soap for men is one that leaves skin feeling clean without tightness or dryness. It is pH-balanced to avoid any discomfort. ($10.95)<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>This is a list of our favorite things this holiday season, but we have SO much more available! Gift cards are available at the Front Desk in any denomination! Come see us on Small Business Saturday!<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Your friends and relatives are special. This holiday season, the gifts you give them should be special, too! We all know about Black Friday and Cyber Monday. But our personal favorite (we MIGHT be biased) is Small Business Saturday! This shopping day, which will take place on Saturday November 30th this year celebrates the local&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_