56.562,79.673 558.743,79.167 560.652,78.425 C562.623,77.658 564.297,76.634 565.965,74.965 C567.633,73.296 568.659,71.625 569.425,69.651 C570.167,67.743 570.674,65.562 570.82,62.369 C570.966,59.17 571,58.147 571,50 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\\\"><\\/path><\\/g><\\/g><\\/g><\\/svg><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\\\"> View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><\\/a> <\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B5PAKqbhLVl\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Had a great opportunity recently to do a bridal shoot in Puyallup! It was absolutely stunning and everyone was so lovely to work with! This makeup look: @beautyby_yoana<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/aboutfacebeautyllc\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> Brittany Baldock<\\/a> (@aboutfacebeautyllc) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2019-11-24T04:15:46+00:00\\\">Nov 23, 2019 at 8:15pm PST<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>Brittany says she chose Summit Salon Academy because of its convenient location and because it seemed like the best program in the area. From her experience in massage, Brittany already had a passion for helping people feel good about themselves and an interest in skincare and skin health. Brittany says she loves the neverending knowledge she gets from the program, both in beauty and from the business side of skincare. <\\/p>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy\\u2019s esthetics partnership with <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.dermalogica.com\\/our-story\\/our-story,default,pg.html\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Dermalogica<\\/a> and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.bio-therapeutic.com\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Bio-Therapeutic<\\/a> tools means students have the chance to learn products and skills to deliver better skincare treatments to clients. Brittany has been able to take advantage and loves learning all she can in her course and is loving the <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">esthetics program<\\/a> overall. Her advice to beginning beauty students is to \\u201c&#8230;go in the direction they\\u2019re most interested in, even if it turns out to be multiple paths.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<h2>Using Social Media for Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>Brittany has already gained quite a few followers through her esthetics and skin health posts on social media. She says she used social media before starting school, but not as frequently as she does now. Using Dermalogica products and others, she educates her followers on best skin health practices and tries to post twice a month.  <\\/p>\\n<p>Brittany knows how powerful a tool social media can be for new beauty students. Her advice to prospective estheticians and stylists using social media is to \\u201cEducate! People really like learning about things they\\u2019re not forced to think about everyday.\\u201d She likes using her product knowledge to educate her followers on skin care practices they may not have known about before, and is great at utilizing beauty hashtags to increase her following. <\\/p>\\n<p>You can follow Brittany on Instagram <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/aboutfacebeautyllc\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@aboutfacebeautyllc<\\/a> or check out her blog <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.aboutfacebeautyllc.com\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">aboutfacebeautyllc.com<\\/a>! <\\/p>\\n<h2>Learn How You Can Start an Education in Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>If you have a passion for beauty, hair, or skincare, and want to join Brittany and our other amazing students like her, look into our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> or <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">esthetics<\\/a> programs! Feel free to <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/learn-more\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">contact us<\\/a> and find out how you can start an education you are truly passionate about. <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>This month\\u2019s social promoter of the month is Brittany Baldock. Read on to learn more about her!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3170,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3169\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"It\\u2019s time to spotlight another of our amazing students! December\\u2019s social promoter of the month is Brittany Baldock. Click here to read more about her and what she\\u2019s doing in the beauty industry!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonac