(413, 3, 'post', '3189', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Meghan Lowe', 50, 'done', 1, 1084, '', '{\"id\":3189,\"date\":\"2020-01-28T08:02:58\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-01-28T16:02:58\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3189\"},\"modified\":\"2020-01-28T08:02:58\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2020-01-28T16:02:58\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Meghan Lowe\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Each month at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we highlight one of our students and their work. These students have been able to use social media to elevate their work in beauty. This January we are proud to introduce Meghan Lowe!<\\/p>\\n<h2>About Meghan<\\/h2>\\n<p>Meghan is a hard-working student and we are lucky to have her here at Summit Salon Academy. She loves fashion, beauty, and interior design. Meghan started out working towards an Early Childhood Education degree, but found her place in beauty after discovering Summit Salon Academy. She is new to Washington and really enjoys the friends and community she has begun to build here in Tacoma. <\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B4yRHBBnE_6\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"12\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:16px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B4yRHBBnE_6\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\