\/g><\\/svg><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\\\"> View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><\\/a> <\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B4yRHBBnE_6\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Level 2 down level 3 here I come\\ud83d\\udc83\\ud83c\\udffc\\ud83d\\ude4b\\ud83c\\udffc\\u200d\\u2640\\ufe0f<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair.bymeggg\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> Meghan Lowe<\\/a> (@hair.bymeggg) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2019-11-13T00:25:51+00:00\\\">Nov 12, 2019 at 4:25pm PST<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<p>Meghan\\u2019s favorite part of the beauty industry has been the ability to connect with people on a more personal level. She loves helping her clients feel amazing each time they leave the chair and says one of the most valuable things she\\u2019s learned at school has been learning to perfect her craft through hard work. Meghan recommends new beauty students stay true to themselves and to try and let clients connect with the real you! <\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit Salon Academy<\\/h2>\\n<p>Meghan started nine months ago at Summit Salon Academy after she took a tour and fell in love with the atmosphere here! She has always loved beauty, but never thought she could make it a career. After touring the school, she decided to start an education in beauty full-time. She has already begun building up her presence on social media with great results!<\\/p>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy\\u2019s <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a> covers everything from hair cuts and coloring to facials, makeup application, manicures, and more! It\\u2019s a well-rounded education with something for everyone. Meghan says if she could give advice to current students, it would be to make the most of their time in school. \\u201cI would say stay true to who you are as a person and let your clients see you. Also, don\\u2019t waste your time in school. Always be doing something, you can never get this time back!\\u201d. <\\/p>\\n<h2>Using Social Media in Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>Since starting beauty school, Meghan has seen growth on her social media channels. She had an Instagram prior to school, but didn\\u2019t post on it very regularly. Since beginning her education, Meghan has begun a beauty-only account where she posts looks she\\u2019s created. She says she posts to Instagram at least once a week and has noticed a significant increase in her followers and engagement on this account. Meghan says she also joins lots of different Facebook groups and spreads the word through this account to gain new followers. <\\/p>\\n<p>We are always excited to see what our students post and how they use <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sproutsocial.com\\/insights\\/social-media-and-beauty-industry\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">social media in the beauty industry<\\/a>. In today\\u2019s world it has become one of the most important marketing tools for new beauty professionals! Meghan\\u2019s advice for anyone starting their own account is to use relevant hashtags whenever possible and to tag locations. We can\\u2019t wait to follow Meghan\\u2019s career as she finishes her education. You can follow her <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair.bymeggg\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">@hair.bymeggg<\\/a>. <\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BxgCqbdnPrv\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"12\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding:16px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BxgCqbdnPrv\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> <\\/p>\\n<div style=\\\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 19% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\\\"><svg width=\\\"50px\\\" height=\\\"50px\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 60 60\\\" version=\\\"1.1\\\" xmlns=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" xmlns:xlink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/1999\\/xlink\\\"><g stroke=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\"><g transform=\\\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\\\" fill=\\\"#000000\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.