v style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><\\/a> <\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/BxgCqbdnPrv\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">We got our kits today! #summitsalonacademy #pivotpoint #redken #hairstylist<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hair.bymeggg\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> Meghan Lowe<\\/a> (@hair.bymeggg) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2019-05-15T22:55:52+00:00\\\">May 15, 2019 at 3:55pm PDT<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2>Learn How You Can Start an Education in Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>Are you obsessed with the latest beauty trends? Interested in a career where you can work with all kinds of people? Do you want to learn the latest hair techniques? At Summit Salon, we strive to support students in programs that teach the latest in professional beauty trends.<\\/p>\\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\\\"\\/courses\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">our programs<\\/a> and how to apply for financial aid* on our site. We have <a href=\\\"\\/about-us\\/brands\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">partnered with brands<\\/a> like Redken, Sam Villa, and Brazilian Blowout to provide experience with salon-quality products. Our business center can help you to learn important consultation skills and business strategies for growing your own brand. <\\/p>\\n<p>We\\u2019d love to hear more about your beauty goals. <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Contact our admissions office<\\/a> for more information.<\\/p>\\n<p>*{Financial aid may be available for those who qualify.}<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>This month\\u2019s social promoter is Meghan Lowe. Read on to learn more about her and her experience at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma! <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3190,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3189\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"It\\u2019s a new year, a new month, and it is time to spotlight a new student at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma! The social promoter for January is Meghan Lowe. Click here to read more about her and what she\\u2019s doin