or: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><\\/a> <\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" margin:8px 0 0 0; padding:0 4px;\\\"> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B8hMPqgBW-o\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#000; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none; word-wrap:break-word;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Social Promoter of February \\u2763\\ufe0f Thank you to all of you who have showed so much love this past month. Less than 800 hours left. Let\\u2019s get you in my chair before I finish and go back home to California \\u2600\\ufe0f . . #shadeseq #redkenobsessed #washingtonhairstylist #tacomahair #seattlehair #summitsalon #summitsalonacademy #ssatacoma #foilayage #saloncentric #cosmoprof #summitsalonacademytacoma #sandiegohair #sandiegostylist<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\\\">A post shared by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hairbyxio_\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" style=\\\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"> \\u2665 Xio Navarrete \\u2665<\\/a> (@hairbyxio_) on <time style=\\\" font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px;\\\" datetime=\\\"2020-02-13T19:21:50+00:00\\\">Feb 13, 2020 at 11:21am PST<\\/time><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p> <script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<p>Xiomara is a great example of how hard work can pay off in beauty. She has been able to put trust in her own education and says the key to success is having patience in yourself and the process. <\\/p>\\n<h2>Using Social Media in Beauty<\\/h2>\\n<p>Today\\u2019s beauty professionals need more than a passion for the work. Knowing the basics of building a client base, running a business, and utilizing marketing opportunities is important as well. That is why Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma is proud to be affiliated with the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.summitsalon.com\\/summit-salon-academy\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Summit Salon Business Center<\\/a> to help our students understand and gain important client-building strategies. <\\/p>\\n<p>Xiomara has been using her social media accounts for years to connect with clients and make them feel heard. Now she is utilizing those skills to improve her marketing strategies as a cosmetology student. She tries to post as frequently as she can and uses hashtags to connect with new clients and to get them in her chair. <\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B7ZjU9SHOuo\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"12\\\" style=\\\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),