/rnd\\/2020\\/03\\/26\\/important-updates-regarding-covid-19\\/\",\"title\":\"Important Updates Regarding COVID-19\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":34,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":2,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:02:04');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(416, 3, 'post', '3222', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-chrissa-wilson/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Chrissa Wilson', 50, 'done', 1, 1087, '', '{\"id\":3222,\"date\":\"2020-03-26T13:40:12\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-03-26T20:40:12\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3222\"},\"modified\":\"2020-03-26T13:40:12\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2020-03-26T20:40:12\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-chrissa-wilson\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-chrissa-wilson\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Chrissa Wilson\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Meet this month\\u2019s social promoter of the month: Chrissa Wilson! Chrissa is an amazing student who came to us with experience in the beauty industry already. She\\u2019s been working as an esthetician for the past 10 years and decided to expand her skillset with an education in cosmetology.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Get To Know Chrissa<\\/h2>\\n<p>Chrissa has been at Summit Salon Academy since January. Before that, she worked as a licensed esthetician and helped manage a salon and spa in the Tacoma area. It\\u2019s amazing to see someone already in the beauty industry to go back to school to expand her skillset and learn cosmetology.<br \\/>\\n<img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3223 size-large\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-815x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Chrissa Wilson\\\" width=\\\"815\\\" height=\\\"1024\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-815x1024.jpg 815w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-239x300.jpg 239w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-768x965.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-318x400.jpg 318w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-478x600.jpg 478w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa-550x691.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa.jpg 1019w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>When she\\u2019s not learning skills in beauty and skincare, she loves photography and her kiddos.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Check Out Her Work<\\/h2>\\n<p>As part of an education at Summit Salon Academy, our students can provide services to clients under the supervision of licensed professionals. When it comes to building her portfolio online, Chrissa is using Instagram to its fullest potential! You can check out all of her work on Instagram at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/chrissasummitsalon\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@chrissasummitsalon<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3224 size-large\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-815x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Woman with a blonde balayage\\\" width=\\\"815\\\" height=\\\"1024\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-815x1024.jpg 815w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-239x300.jpg 239w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-768x965.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-318x400.jpg 318w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-478x600.jpg 478w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234-550x691.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa234.jpg 1019w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Chrissa is using Instagram as her portfolio and for reaching out to her clients and followers. She reaches out not only for appointments, but to ask what people want to learn about her and the beauty services she is learning to provide.<\\/p>\\n<p>As beauty school students should, Chrissa focuses a lot on posting on her Instagram. She told us that she uses IG stories almost daily and tries to post weekly. You don\\u2019t want to miss her stories with some of her favorite looks, so we recommend giving her a follow. She says you would be surprised how much people care about what you post.<\\/p>\\n<p>Some advice from her to other students learning to use Instagram for their beauty business is to not use filters and take a few extra minutes to get a high quality shot.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit Salon Academy?<\\/h2>\\n<p>We know how important it is for our students to pick the right beauty school for them. When we asked her why she chose Summit Salon Academy, her answer was simple.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>&#8220;They are truly the best they stood out far more than any other school I looked into!&#8221;<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<p>We strive to take care of our students, and we are so happy to hear that from Chrissa!<\\/p>\\n<p><div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-8690b7463e235c368066761cb68812e0 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:550px; max-height:550px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"550px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"550\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B9sR9yPhayM\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div> <\\/p>\\n<h2>Advice for Future Students<\\/h2>\\n<p>Chrissa gave us amazing advice for future students. She told us:<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>&#8220;Try hard and do not be afraid to make mistakes\\u2026 It\\u2019s in the mistakes that you will gain the most growth! Have fun and laugh way too often!&#8221;<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<p>We totally agree! Beauty school is a learning opportunity, and we want to provide that safe environment to help you learn skills you can use in the beauty industry, whether it\\u2019s haircutting, hair coloring, waxing, or something else.<\\/p>\\n<p>Chrissa has always loved making people feel beautiful, and her favorite part about being in this industry according to her is the people you meet. She says, \\u201cIt\\u2019s so fun to get together and create art and change lives.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-815x1024.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Mannequin head with a curly hairstyle\\\" width=\\\"815\\\" height=\\\"1024\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-3225\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-815x1024.jpg 815w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-239x300.jpg 239w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-768x965.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-318x400.jpg 318w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-478x600.jpg 478w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23-550x691.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/03\\/chrissa23.jpg 1019w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>If that sounds like something you want to see in your own life, consider joining Chrissa on her journey or starting your own adventure in beauty.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Expand Your Skillset<\\/h2>\\n<p>If you\\u2019re already in the beauty industry, beauty school could be for you! Whether you\\u2019re already a licensed professional or not, consider taking the time to go back to beauty school! Being licensed in <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">esthetics<\\/a> and <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">cosmetology<\\/a> means you can provide more services to your potential clients and opens up a wide variety of career opportunities, whether you want to work at a salon or a spa.<\\/p>\\n<p>Still deciding if beauty school is right for you? Check out some of our past social promoters of the month to learn their stories:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-xiomara-navarrete\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Social Promoter of the Month: Xiomara Navarrete<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Social Promoter of the Month: Meghan Lowe<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>You can also learn how to get started by <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">getting in touch<\\/a> with our admissions office to help answer any questions you have and schedule a tour of our school. We\\u2019d love to hear from you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Check out this month\\u2019s social promoter of the month, Chrissa Wilson! Get to know her story and what she\\u2019s been doing during her time at Summit Salon Academy.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3226,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3222\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Meet the social promoter of this month, Chrissa Wilson! Chrissa has been working as a licensed esthetician for 10 years, and decided to go back to school. Learn about her story.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-chrissa-wilson\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-chrissa-wilson\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Chrissa Wilson | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Chrissa Wilson\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\