INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(417, 3, 'post', '3281', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/begin-your-beautiful-future-at-summit-salon-academy-tacoma/', 'Begin Your Beautiful Future at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma', 50, 'done', 1, 1088, '', '{\"id\":3281,\"date\":\"2020-06-17T08:50:19\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-06-17T15:50:19\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3281\"},\"modified\":\"2021-03-31T08:28:37\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2021-03-31T15:28:37\",\"slug\":\"begin-your-beautiful-future-at-summit-salon-academy-tacoma\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/begin-your-beautiful-future-at-summit-salon-academy-tacoma\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Begin Your Beautiful Future at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We spend so much of our waking hours working. Why not do something you enjoy? If you want to add a little more joy to your life and career, now could be the perfect time to finally take that step toward a future in the beauty industry.<\\/p>\\n<p>Whether you\\u2019re a recent high school graduate, a parent, or someone looking for a career change, Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma could be the perfect place to pursue your goals. Here are just a few of the reasons why:<\\/p>\\n<h2>Passionate Student Culture<\\/h2>\\n<p>The beauty industry attracts passionate people. Our students are eager to learn and ready to perfect their skills. Many are juggling priorities like family and\\/or work while attending school. They know that investing in their education and working hard means creating a brighter future. Their determination inspires us to strive for excellence, growth, and innovation.<\\/p>\\n<p>Though our students are busy, we love that they always find time to appreciate their peers and educators. During our 2020 Teacher Appreciation Week, we were overwhelmed by the kind words our students had to say about our educators.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3283\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"500\\\" height=\\\"500\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n.jpg 620w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/84251757_188940415501587_2533085576988260530_n-550x550.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>\\u201cI appreciate all of my educators for being patient, committed, and passionate! They are all such rays of positivity, their support and encouragement mean everything to me! I am beyond grateful for them. I\\u2019ve never enjoyed something as much as my beauty experience, so shout out to all the educators!\\u201d<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<blockquote><p>\\u201cTo all my educators, because every single one of you brings something different to the creative, fun, and loving atmosphere that makes up our school, I appreciate all of the effort, time, and care that [each of] you strong, individual women give\\u2026.This time has been very hard for all of us, I know especially you ladies, and everything you are doing is<br \\/>\\namazing!\\u201d<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<p>This type of appreciation goes both ways at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma. On our blog, we have a running series called <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/u\\/category\\/social-promoter\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\\u201cSocial Promoter of the Month\\u201d<\\/a>, where we spotlight a student who has done exceptional work. Our students are constantly creating amazing things and going the extra mile to help others, so we love the opportunity to highlight them on our website!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Preparation for the Future<\\/h2>\\n<p>Our <a href=\\\"\\/category\\/social-promoter\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">cosmetology and esthetics curriculum <\\/a>focuses on a combination of theory and practical skills to help students prepare for their future careers. We teach the \\u201cwhy\\u201d behind techniques along with the \\u201chow\\u201d and the \\u201cwhat\\u201d. From hair coloring to makeup application, we want students to understand the science and principles behind each technique so they can fully unlock their potential.<\\/p>\\n<p>Working with <a href=\\\"\\/about-us\\/brands\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">professional brands<\\/a> during school can help our students succeed in the real world. Summit Salon Academy is proud to be a Redken Premier School, Dermalogica Partnership School, PCA Associate School, and Muse Beauty Pro partner. We also understand the importance of technology and digital presence in the modern beauty industry. Each student kit includes an iPad so students can not only complete assignments online, but create their digital portfolio and begin marketing their work on social media.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-3285 aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-1024x890.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"500\\\" height=\\\"435\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-1024x890.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-300x261.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-768x668.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-460x400.jpg 460w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-690x600.jpg 690w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2-550x478.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/85252043_1793569007441382_3746311333042192384_o-2.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<h2>Community Involvement<\\/h2>\\n<p>Community-involvement is something we\\u2019ve always been passionate about. For the last few years, Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma has hosted our <a href=\\\"\\/category\\/hair-bra-zaar\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar event<\\/a>, which raises money for Wings of Karen, a community based non-profit foundation supporting breast cancer research with a sense of urgency.<\\/p>\\n<p>Students who participate in the event can show off their creativity through fun, over-the-top makeup\\/hair looks, and beautifully decorated bras. We love this event, as it gives our students the opportunity to practice their skills and connect with other people, all while contributing to a great cause. Though we will not be able to host the event in 2020 due to current circumstances, as a future student, you could be a part of activities like this!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Supportive Educators and Staff<\\/h2>\\n<p>Our staff and educators make student support a top priority, no matter what the circumstances. When the COVID-19 pandemic hit Washington in March 2020, we were able to adapt quickly and transition to online learning within a week. Our curriculum was already delivered digitally through Pivot Point\\/Summit Fuse, so our students had iPads at home with them already. Instructors logged into Zoom calls with each class so they could connect with their students and guide them through online learning.<\\/p>\\n<p>Our school is also lucky enough to receive excellent support from industry partners year-round. Supplemental videos and guest speakers from companies like Sam Villa, Redken, Dermalogica, and Summit Salon Business Center were all available to our students during the stay-at-home orders. This type of professional education is something students can always expect at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma.<\\/p>\\n<p>Throughout this challenging time, our entire team has served as a source of emotional support, as well as education. Educators make it a point to check in with students one-on-one to connect on a personal level. We see ourselves as one big family at Summit, regardless of what\\u2019s happening in the world. We\\u2019re here to look out for each other during good and bad times.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3284\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-1024x716.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"419\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-1024x716.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-300x210.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-768x537.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-572x400.jpg 572w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-858x600.jpg 858w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n-550x384.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/87696052_2675982175955316_4814311954476322927_n.jpg 1080w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>Get Started Today<\\/h2>\\n<p>Making an investment in yourself is always worth it. We\\u2019d love to welcome you into the Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma family! <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Contact us today<\\/a> to set up an admissions appointment. If you have additional questions, feel free to text, call, or email us! We\\u2019re looking forward to hearing from you.<\\/p>\\n<p>See what we\\u2019re all about and get a feel for our culture by connecting with us on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/ssatacoma\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Instagram <\\/a>and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/SummitSalonAcademyTacoma\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Facebook!<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Ready to start your journey in beauty? Let us help you along the way! Here are a few reasons why you should choose Summit Salon Academy Tacoma!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3289,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[1],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3281\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-uncategorized\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Are you ready to start your beauty school journey? Summit Salon Academy Tacoma could be the perfect place for you. Learn more about joining the Summit family today!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/begin-your-beautiful-future-at-summit-salon-academy-tacoma\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/begin-your-beautiful-future-at-summit-salon-academy-tacoma\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Begin Your Beautiful Future at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Begin Your Beautiful Future at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2020\\\\\\/06\\\\\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2020_06June_BeginFutureAtSSATacoma_Headershare-4.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":1260,\\\"height\\\":789},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2020-06-17T08:50:19-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2021-03-31T08:28:37-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":