(423, 3, 'post', '3579', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school/', 'How to Succeed in Cosmetology School', 50, 'done', 1, 1094, '', '{\"id\":3579,\"date\":\"2021-03-31T10:56:11\",\"date_gmt\":\"2021-03-31T17:56:11\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=3579\"},\"modified\":\"2021-06-08T15:19:47\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2021-06-08T22:19:47\",\"slug\":\"how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-scaled.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3580\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-300x225.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman smiling with beautiful makeup\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"450\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-533x400.jpg 533w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-800x600.jpg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/terricks-noah-QhyzMkkbjZU-unsplash1-550x413.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Is your dream career in beauty? We know sometimes working towards new goals can be overwhelming, but don\\u2019t worry. We are here to help! At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, our goal is to help you thrive in school so you can graduate and make your dream job your reality.<\\/p>\\n<p>That\\u2019s why we\\u2019ve put together our best tips and tricks to help you know what to expect in cosmetology school and how to excel. Whether you\\u2019ve already started school or are thinking about enrolling, here is what you need to know to succeed in cosmetology school!<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#1\\\">What to Expect: An Emotional Journey<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#2\\\">Remember Why You Started<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#3\\\">Celebrate Your Wins<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#4\\\">Find a Mentor<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#5\\\">Progress Over Perfection<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#6\\\">Boost Your Motivation<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#7\\\">Don\\u2019t Compare Yourself to Others<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#8\\\">Reach Out for Help<\\/a><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"1\\\">What to Expect: An Emotional Journey<\\/h2>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-scaled.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3584\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"two girls taking a road trip\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/raphael-rychetsky-F6_8XQPIlAU-unsplash-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>You can expect to feel an array of emotions throughout your time in cosmetology school. Excitement, fear, optimism, connection, anxiety, hope, and confidence are just a few. Try to keep yourself from labeling any of these emotions as good or bad. Know that they are just a part of your journey!<\\/p>\\n<p>Along with these emotions, you may feel like your motivation is being taken on a rollercoaster ride as well! It\\u2019s okay, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/jamesclear.com\\/motivation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">motivation<\\/a> isn\\u2019t constant. You will probably go through a few of these stages at least once, or maybe several times, during your time in school:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>The Honeymoon Stage:<\\/b> You\\u2019re just starting cosmetology school or are in the process of applying. Everything feels new and exciting, and you are ready to face this new challenge! Future in beauty, here you come!<\\/li>\\n<li><b>The Challenge:<\\/b> Maybe you are struggling with a certain technique, or maybe the thought of rolling even one more perm makes you want to scream. Don\\u2019t worry. You\\u2019re not alone! Challenges are a part of every worthwhile goal. <a href=\\\"#lisa\\\">Every successful cosmetologist, esthetician, you name it, has faced challenges too.<\\/a> Just remember, without the challenge, there wouldn\\u2019t be room for the comeback!<\\/li>\\n<li><b>The Comeback:<\\/b> You grab your mannequin head and get to practicing! Cue the movie montage. This is the part where you grow into the stylist you have always dreamed of becoming, one step at a time. You got this!<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We all love the feeling of being in the honeymoon stage or celebrating during the comeback, but these aren\\u2019t the only parts of your journey into beauty. If you find yourself facing a new challenge, we\\u2019ve got you covered. Keep reading for some of our best advice to help you rise! After all, we\\u2019ve been doing this for a long time so we know a thing or two.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"2\\\">Remember Why You Started<\\/h2>\\n<p>One way you can rise is to remember why you started. Motivation is tied to purpose. Once the shiny newness of the honeymoon stage wears off and you are several hundred hours into your schooling, it can be easy to forget <a href=\\\"\\/why-now-is-the-time-to-pursue-a-future-in-beauty\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">what your purpose in starting cosmetology school was<\\/a>, or wonder if it will be worth the effort. Try and remember what you are working towards!<\\/p>\\n<p>Did you want <a href=\\\"\\/craving-creativity-enroll-in-beauty-school\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">a career where you could use your creativity?<\\/a> Were you inspired by the chance to help those around you feel beautiful and confident? Maybe you just wanted a career where you could be your own boss or have flexible hours. Whatever your reason was, remember what led you to start cosmetology school in the first place, and reconnect with that purpose.<\\/p>\\n<p>Here are a few ideas to help you connect with your big picture:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Write down and reread your goals.<\\/li>\\n<li>Make a vision board of what your life could look like once you\\u2019ve graduated.<\\/li>\\n<li>Tell your friends the story of why you started cosmetology school.<\\/li>\\n<li>Create a list of daily affirmations about who you are and who you want to become.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We asked our friend and local salon owner of <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.uniontacoma.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">Union Salon<\\/a>, Shea Lovrovich, why she chose to pursue beauty and here is what she had to say:<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>\\u201cIt truly is an amazing career, being able to touch someone\\u2019s life in such a personal way and create the perfect style for them&#8230; [it\\u2019s] what keeps me motivated. I have been doing hair now for almost 14 years and my career has also been able to mold and change with my life giving me freedom with my schedule as well which I think is hard to find in a lot of careers.\\u201d<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<p>Working towards a goal takes time, but the feeling of accomplishing something worthwhile is worth it in the end! You got this!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"3\\\">Celebrate Your Wins<\\/h2>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3582\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-300x240.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman celebrating\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-300x240.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-1024x819.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-768x614.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-2048x1639.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-500x400.jpg 500w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-750x600.jpg 750w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/woman-celebrating-550x440.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Your journey isn\\u2019t all about the challenges, though. It\\u2019s about your wins as well! Whether your win is big or small, don\\u2019t forget to celebrate it!<\\/p>\\n<p>Take a look back at your time in school. What have you learned since you started? This could be something as big as mastering a new haircutting technique or something as small as remembering to take an after picture of your work. Did you clock in on time today, or better yet, early? Celebrate it! No win is too small.<\\/p>\\n<p>Resist the temptation to believe you have no wins, or that your wins aren\\u2019t good enough. Remember, <a href=\\\"#5\\\">perfection is the enemy of progress.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"4\\\">Find a Mentor<\\/h2>\\n<p>Finding a mentor knocks out two birds with one stone: it can help you visualize what your future could be like and gives you a support system. We recommend having both an online mentor and a local mentor with whom you can meet in person. That way you get both the inspiration and support you need!<\\/p>\\n<p>There are plenty of online mentors you can look to. Here are just a few of our favorites:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=cwydMW1BTnU\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\"><b>Michael Cole:<\\/b><\\/a> watch L\\u2019oreal Global Business Educator and co-founder of Summit Salon Business Center (SSBC) Michael Cole interview and coach successful beauty pros who were once starting just like you!<\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/viviennemackinder\\/?hl=en\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\"><b>Vivienne Mackinder:<\\/b><\\/a> learn foundational cosmetology and business techniques from the seven-time winner of the North American Hairdresser Awards (NAHA), Vivienne Mackinder.<\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/shinestruck\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\"><b>Priscilla Flete:<\\/b><\\/a> hair stylist, natural hair educator, and editorial artist, Priscilla Flete is an inspiration to us all!<\\/li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.samvilla.com\\/education-calendar\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\"><b>Sam Villa:<\\/b><\\/a> As the global artistic director for Redken, Sam Villa challenges the status quo and inspires change! Check out his online educational tools and learn from a master.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We also recommend finding a mentor in your local area that you can connect with. Try looking at local salons or spas\\u2014plenty of owners would be happy to pass on their wisdom and mentor an aspiring beauty school student! Your mentor could also be an instructor at your school or your go-to esthetician!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"5\\\">Progress Over Perfection<\\/h2>\\n<p>Our next tip is to remember that progress is more important than perfection. If you have ever messed up on a haircut (we\\u2019d be surprised if you haven\\u2019t!) or fallen short of a big goal, try to see it as a learning opportunity.<\\/p>\\n<p>Every successful beauty professional has experienced failure at some point in their career. Even industry icon, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hairdesignertv.com\\/about-vivienne-mackinder\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">Vivienne Mackinder<\\/a>, said that <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.esteticamagazine.com\\/eventsnews\\/item\\/6251-top-ten-things-you-should-know-about-industry-icon-vivienne-mackinder\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">\\u201cI have failed so much in my career, but [it has] taught me a lot on how to do things differently or better.\\u201d<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<div id=\\\"lisa\\\">When master colorist, Lisa Walker, made a mistake as not only a professional but as a beauty influencer, she didn\\u2019t give up on her career dreams or shy away from her mistake. She took it as an opportunity to grow:<\\/div>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" style=\\\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\\\" data-instgrm-captioned=\\\"\\\" data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B0zZ1jMhZqQ\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"13\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 16px;\\\">\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 19% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\\\">View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\\\"><a style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/B0zZ1jMhZqQ\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">A post shared by Lisa Walker (@lisalovesbalayage)<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p><script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<p>What came from her determination? She now has nearly 100k followers on Instagram and a thriving business.<\\/p>\\n<p>We have all had days where we are at the top of our game, and we\\u2019ve all had days where we are not. Learn from your mistakes, and remember that perfection doesn\\u2019t exist. If you are progressing, growing, and learning, there is no way you can fail!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"6\\\">Boost Your Motivation<\\/h2>\\n<p>Need a few tips on boosting your motivation? We have a few that may do the trick for you! These motivational boosters can help you build your confidence and get back on track when you need it.<\\/p>\\n<h3>1. Find Some Quick Wins<\\/h3>\\n<p>Have you ever heard that if you wake up and make your bed in the morning, you will be more productive? Sometimes all you need to boost your motivation is a quick win. Making your bed in the morning gives you an immediate sense of accomplishment. Here are a few ideas to translate this principle to beauty and find some quick wins of your own!<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Post your work on social media.<\\/li>\\n<li>Clock in on time. Remember, on time is 15 minutes early!<\\/li>\\n<li>Plan out a cute and professional outfit to wear to school. When you feel good, your confidence will shine.<\\/li>\\n<li>Research and find some inspiring salons\\/ spas in your area you may want to work at<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>These quick wins should be something you can accomplish in just a few minutes or so! The idea is to get a quick sense of accomplishment to boost your motivation.<\\/p>\\n<h3>2. Practice Makes Perfect<\\/h3>\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone wp-image-3583\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"student practicing on a mannequin\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11-550x367.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/pexels-david-geib-3268732-11.jpg 1812w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>One of the best ways to boost your motivation is to mix quick wins with long-term wins. Practicing a difficult technique may take time, but practice makes perfect, and mastering foundational techniques will give you confidence.<\\/p>\\n<p>Working on mannequin heads may seem boring at times, but drilling the basics into your muscle memory is one of the best things you can do for your skills and your confidence. Even after winning seven NAHA competitions, Vivienne Mackinder still practices her techniques on mannequins today:<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>\\u201cI think when you do it really well it looks super easy but it\\u2019s not: that\\u2019s the biggest deception of all. People go &#8216;Wow, she made that look so easy,&#8217; \\u2013 yeah, but I practiced it and practiced it. I still pull out my mannequin head.\\u201d \\u2014<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.esteticamagazine.com\\/eventsnews\\/item\\/6251-top-ten-things-you-should-know-about-industry-icon-vivienne-mackinder\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">Vivienne Mackinder<\\/a><\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<h3>3. Have an Addition Mindset<\\/h3>\\n<p>Our last tip to boost your motivation is to have an addition mindset. Sometimes when our motivation lags, our mind begins to think of ways to take away the pain. Maybe you wish you had fewer hours, less work, or fewer tests ahead of you. We recommend focusing not on what you want to take away, but instead on fun things you can add to your routine that inspire you.<\\/p>\\n<p>Watch a video on a new technique that inspires you, and then practice it on your mannequin doll. Add a new social media class that looks fun to your day. You can even go out and buy a new outfit for school if you want! Whatever you add to your routine, just make sure it is something you find fun or exciting. The point here isn\\u2019t to make your to-do list even longer, it\\u2019s to make your want-to-do list longer!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"7\\\">Don\\u2019t Compare Yourself to Others<\\/h2>\\n<p>Comparing yourself to others is a nasty trap! It can be easy to look around at your classmates, or others already in the industry, and feel inadequate in comparison. However, we all have different strengths and weaknesses. Comparing your weaknesses to others\\u2019 strengths is never a good idea.<\\/p>\\n<blockquote><p>&#8220;Stay in your lane. Comparison kills creativity and joy.&#8221; \\u2014Brene Brown<\\/p><\\/blockquote>\\n<p>Instead of comparing yourself to others, compare yourself to your past. Look one year, two years, or five years back. Are you a much different person? How much have you changed? What new things have you learned and grown from? We encourage you to write these things down or share them with a friend! Now consider yourself one, two, five years in the future. Will you be different? Will you have learned and grown from a dozen other things? Yes! Of course. Today\\u2019s challenges will become stepping stones to tomorrow\\u2019s successes!<\\/p>\\n<p>Your future is as bright as your belief in yourself. We believe in you!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"8\\\">Reach Out for Help<\\/h2>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-scaled.jpg\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3581\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"friends hugging\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/vonecia-carswell-0aMMMUjiiEQ-unsplash-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Our last tip to help you rise above any challenges you may face in beauty school is to reach out for help. Whether you need a shoulder to cry on, or someone to celebrate your wins with you, the <a href=\\\"\\/about-us\\/staff\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">staff at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma<\\/a> is here for you! You can always reach out to instructors, the owners, or the rest of our team. We can help you make a plan to overcome your challenges and move towards your big-picture goals. Just don\\u2019t forget to reach out to us to share your accomplishments and brag about your wins as well!<\\/p>\\n<p>Remember you can reach out for help from those outside our school as well. Friends, family, or even your favorite hairdresser can be great sources to look to. If you ever feel like you are alone, know that you have a whole team behind you! We are all rooting for you!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Study at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma<\\/h2>\\n<p>Are you ready to take on this exciting roller coaster of a journey? We can\\u2019t wait to help you get started! <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">Contact us<\\/a>\\u00a0to schedule your tour of our school and see if we may be the right fit for you. We hope you feel how much we genuinely care for <a href=\\\"\\/all-about-our-students\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\">our students<\\/a> when you meet us. Let us be the team behind you on your way into this amazing and rewarding industry!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Is your dream career in beauty? We know working towards new goals can be both exciting and challenging sometimes! That\\u2019s why we are giving you all our best tips and tricks to be successful in cosmetology school. You got this! <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3589,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[1],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3579\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-uncategorized\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Taking on new goals can be both exciting and challenging! Whether you are considering cosmetology school or have already enrolled, read our blog to learn tips for success.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\