logy School\\\"},\\\"previousItem\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu#listItem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#listItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\\\",\\\"previousItem\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/category\\\\\\/uncategorized\\\\\\/#listItem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Uncategorized\\\"}}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Beauty school in Tacoma\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#authorImage\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\\\\/avatar\\\\\\/78f3f0a0c1926ffac18f1d6e677dfe53866a9829e29e28b0c901eb48bc9dbad9?s=96&d=mm&r=g\\\",\\\"width\\\":96,\\\"height\\\":96,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"webdev\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#webpage\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Taking on new goals can be both exciting and challenging! Whether you are considering cosmetology school or have already enrolled, read our blog to learn tips for success.\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#website\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#breadcrumblist\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"creator\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2021\\\\\\/03\\\\\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_03Mar_Blog_SucceedinginCosmetologySchool_Headershare-1.jpg\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#mainImage\\\",\\\"width\\\":1260,\\\"height\\\":789},\\\"primaryImageOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\\\\\/#mainImage\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2021-03-31T10:56:11-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2021-06-08T15:19:47-07:00\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#website\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Beauty school in Tacoma\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School | Summit Salon Academy\",\"description\":\"Taking on new goals can be both exciting and challenging! Whether you are considering cosmetology school or have already enrolled, read our blog to learn tips for success.\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/\",\"robots\":\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#article\",\"name\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School | Summit Salon Academy\",\"headline\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/author\\/webdev\\/#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/03\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_03Mar_Blog_SucceedinginCosmetologySchool_Headershare-1.jpg\",\"width\":1260,\"height\":789},\"datePublished\":\"2021-03-31T10:56:11-07:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2021-06-08T15:19:47-07:00\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#webpage\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#webpage\"},\"articleSection\":\"Uncategorized\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#breadcrumblist\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu#listItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\",\"nextItem\":{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/#listItem\",\"name\":\"Uncategorized\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/#listItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Uncategorized\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/\",\"nextItem\":{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#listItem\",\"name\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\"},\"previousItem\":{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu#listItem\",\"name\":\"Home\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#listItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School\",\"previousItem\":{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/#listItem\",\"name\":\"Uncategorized\"}}]},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Summit Salon Academy\",\"description\":\"Beauty school in Tacoma\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/author\\/webdev\\/#author\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/author\\/webdev\\/\",\"name\":\"webdev\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#authorImage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/78f3f0a0c1926ffac18f1d6e677dfe53866a9829e29e28b0c901eb48bc9dbad9?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"width\":96,\"height\":96,\"caption\":\"webdev\"}},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/#webpage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-succeed-in-cosmetology-school\\/\",\"name\":\"How to Succeed in Cosmetology School | Summit Salon Academy\",\"description\":\"Taking on new goals can be both exciting and challenging! Whether you are considering cosmetology school or have already enrolled, read our blog to learn tips for success.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/