(426, 3, 'post', '4345', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/how-to-become-a-cosmetologist-in-tacoma/', 'How to Become a Cosmetologist in Tacoma', 50, 'done', 1, 1097, '', '{\"id\":4345,\"date\":\"2022-07-21T13:09:33\",\"date_gmt\":\"2022-07-21T20:09:33\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4345\"},\"modified\":\"2024-05-20T14:16:47\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2024-05-20T21:16:47\",\"slug\":\"how-to-become-a-cosmetologist-in-tacoma\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/how-to-become-a-cosmetologist-in-tacoma\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"How to Become a Cosmetologist in Tacoma\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Cosmetology is the art of beautifying the hair, skin, and nails. A licensed cosmetologist can have many jobs, including hairstylist, color specialist,\\u00a0 esthetician, nail technician, lash and brow artist, or even become an instructor.\\u00a0 If you\\u2019re interested in becoming a cosmetologist in Tacoma, WA, you will be joining a lucrative, fast-growing enterprise with many opportunities for growth and advancement.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">In order to become a licensed cosmetologist in Tacoma, WA, you need to complete the required number of hours of education and training, and then sit for the Practical and Written exams <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.dol.wa.gov\\/business\\/cosmetology\\/get_cosmetologist.html\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Washington Cosmetology Examination<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">. One way to gain the training, education, and experience you need is by enrolling in an accredited cosmetology program.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><b>Research Cosmetology Programs Near You<\\/b><\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-4347 size-full aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_2025516188-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"cosmetology student practicing\\\" width=\\\"649\\\" height=\\\"433\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_2025516188-1.jpg 649w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_2025516188-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_2025516188-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_2025516188-1-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 649px) 100vw, 649px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">When choosing your <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology program in Tacoma, WA<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, you want to ensure you\\u2019re choosing a professional, Washington-State licensed school. In order to sit for the Washington Cosmetology Examination, you must either complete at least 1,600 hours of instruction and education, or complete at least 2,000 hours of a Washington-approved cosmetology apprentice program. Summit Salon Academy\\u00a0 in Tacoma is accredited by the National Accrediting Commission of Career Arts and Sciences (NACCAS). We offer comprehensive, career focused programs in <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/courses\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology and esthetics<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, as well as a <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/instructor-program\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">training program<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to prepare students to become licensed instructors. Our campus is conveniently located near public transportation, the Tacoma mall, and shopping and restaurants.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2>Requirements for a Washington Cosmetology License<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">In order to obtain a <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.dol.wa.gov\\/business\\/cosmetology\\/get_cosmetologist.html\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology license in Washington State<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, you must meet these requirements:\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">be at least 17 years of age<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">graduate from a school that is licensed and approved by the Washington State Department of Licensing<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">complete the minimum required state hours of education and training, or complete a state-approved apprenticeship training program with the minimum state-required hours<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">pass the state-approved practical and written examinations administered by DL Roope Administrations LLC<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-73bd6d15a85e22b2e4ffc30c56abf2a7 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:809.802px; max-height:809.802px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"809.802px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"809\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/C7ChcgrPUhZ\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div>\\n<h2>Familiarize Yourself With Potential Careers in Cosmetology<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Before enrolling in a cosmetology program in Tacoma, WA, it is useful to be aware of the jobs that could be available to licensed cosmetologists in Tacoma and throughout Washington. At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, our staff and instructors have extensive experience and training in a variety of fields in the beauty industry, and are passionate about passing along their wisdom and experience to our students. These are just some of the fields in which you can work as a licensed cosmetologist in Washington:\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4346 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1243977706-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"hairstylist\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"434\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1243977706-1.jpg 650w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1243977706-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1243977706-1-599x400.jpg 599w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1243977706-1-550x367.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hair Stylist and\\/or Colorist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Salon Manager\\/Owner<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Esthetician<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Wedding and Event Stylist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Instructor<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Front Desk Coordinator<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Brand Representative<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Lash and Brow Artist<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Distributor Sales Consultant<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Marketing Coordinator<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Most states require cosmetologists to be licensed in order to work in their field. If you\\u2019re interested in moving to another state to practice Cosmetology you\\u2019ll want to check the criteria for reciprocity in that state and have maintained your Washington license in good standing.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2>About Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Our staff and instructors at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma are passionate, dedicated, and talented. Their primary goal is to help our students succeed, both in the classroom and out. We have carefully designed a comprehensive curriculum for our cosmetology, esthetics, and instructor programs, so our students gain the technical skills needed to succeed, but also acquire practical skills in business management and customer service. We are committed to preparing each student to sit for the Washington State Board Licensing Exams, and are happy to use our own personal education, training, and experience to answer any questions our students have about how to succeed and thrive in the beauty industry.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-a65380cc023bd7ac24b87b4c3e83b83d ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:992.802px; max-height:992.802px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"992.802px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"992\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/C6eUN0Oi6mz\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div>\\n<h3>Admissions, Enrollment, and Our Course<b>s<\\/b><\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4348 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1031005201-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"woman sitting on floor with beauty laptop\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"433\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1031005201-1.jpg 650w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1031005201-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1031005201-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/shutterstock_1031005201-1-550x366.jpg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If you\\u2019re interested in learning more about <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">admissions, <a href=\\\"\\/enrollment\\\">enrollment<\\/a><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, or the <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/courses\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">courses we offer<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, please call or text us, <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">contact us online<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, or take a look at our website. Before enrolling, new students must schedule an admissions meeting and a campus tour. If you are interested in learning more about financial aid options, you can meet with our <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/financial-aid\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">financial aid representative<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">. The final step is to schedule an enrollment appointment. You will need to bring your <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/apply-now\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">completed application<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, your registration fee, your high school transcript or GED, and a valid photo ID.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3>Why Study at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma?<\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma has been providing cosmetology and beauty school education to the community since 2006. We are proud to be a part of the Summit Salon Business Center. Our instructors and staff have years of experience in the beauty industry as stylists, estheticians,\\u00a0 salon owners\\/managers, and more. We believe that this experience can provide students with crucial networking opportunities and valuable information about the beauty industry.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Part of our curriculum focuses on preparing our students for employment.\\u00a0 We are a Canvas Me school, an online professional beauty networking platform. During school students create their digital portfolio and can network with salons from across the country and apply for a variety of\\u00a0 job opportunities.\\u00a0 Our graduates continue to have access to Canvas Me.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-a976c46501683f02e8db4f144adc22f8 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:920.802px; max-height:920.802px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"920.802px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"920\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/C54MSPlSNkf\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div>\\n<h2>Learn More and Schedule a Tour of Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma Today!<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We invite you to <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/learnmore\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">learn more about Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> today! We would love to give you the information you need to begin your journey in the beauty industry. We can talk to you about our courses, class schedules, admission, enrollment, financial aid, scholarship opportunities and more! <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to set up an admissions meeting and campus tour.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"ep-embed-content-wraper insta-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"ose-instagram-feed ose-uid-f022467365e52cb0dfbd6c14ccc9ac58 ose-embedpress-responsive\\\" style=\\\"width:600px; height:998.802px; max-height:998.802px; max-width:100%; display:inline-block;\\\" data-embed-type=\\\"InstagramFeed\\\"><iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" allowFullScreen=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"600px\\\" width=\\\"998.802px\\\" allowtransparency=\\\"true\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"true\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"998\\\" data-instgrm-payload-id=\\\"instagram-media-payload-0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" style=\\\"background-color: white; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); box-shadow: none; display: block; margin: 0px 0px 12px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0px;\\\" class=\\\"instagram-media instagram-media-rendered\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/C51HhZvsD2m\\/embed\\\">Fetching content<\\/iframe><\\/div><\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Are you ready to pursue your dreams of beauty? We know it can be hard to know how to make those dreams a reality, which is why we&#8217;ve put together an ultimate guide to becoming a cosmetologist in Tacoma. Read our blog for more information!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4349,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,149],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4345\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-cosmetology\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Are you interested in becoming a cosmetologist in Tacoma? Read all you need to know about how you can you can pursue your dreams of 