(427, 3, 'post', '4363', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Bernadeth Rosario', 50, 'done', 1, 1098, '', '{\"id\":4363,\"date\":\"2022-07-28T13:14:37\",\"date_gmt\":\"2022-07-28T20:14:37\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4363\"},\"modified\":\"2022-08-09T15:32:28\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2022-08-09T22:32:28\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Bernadeth Rosario\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Meet this month\\u2019s Social Promoter of the Month: Bernadeth \\u201cBernie\\u201d Rosario! Bernie began the Esthetics program at Summit Salon Academy in February and has been performing services for the past 3 months. Before entering the beauty industry, Bernie was a floating medical assistant for two years, working in several different clinics and departments. She decided it was time for a change in her career path which led her to explore Esthetics.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Get to Know Bernadeth<\\/h2>\\n<p>When she isn\\u2019t involved in the world of beauty, Bernie spends her time camping, enjoying the outdoors, and making food for her loved ones. Her favorite part of the beauty industry is the mentorship; she loves how everyone is willing to share tips and tricks and can trust they\\u2019ll guide her down the right path.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4364\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-576x1024.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"bernadeth\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"533\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-576x1024.jpeg 576w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-169x300.jpeg 169w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-768x1365.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-225x400.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-338x600.jpeg 338w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD-550x978.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/0121F205-7BB6-48D6-B972-7FDAD3C892CD.jpeg 828w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>Bernie loves working in the world of beauty because it allows her to help people feel good about themselves! \\u201cI want to help people feel good and give them a safe place to be selfish for once,\\u201d she says, \\u201cYou never know what kind of world they\\u2019re walking back into when they leave your treatment room.\\u201d We couldn\\u2019t agree with you more, Bernie!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Bernadeth on Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>Social media is a huge platform that brings out our creative side and can serve as a helpful tool for the beauty community. Bernie believes that through social media, beauty professionals can learn from each other, clients can find those professionals faster, and those in the industry can use it as a portfolio. Social media can give followers a sense of what a business\\/creator is like by what kind of content they post: things like witty captions or even what colors they chose for their theme. Bernie thinks it can also serve as a little time capsule for students to watch how much they\\u2019ve grown. Great point, Bernie!<\\/p>\\n<p>Usually preferring to stay more private on social media, Bernie knew that would change when she started school. \\u201cI found so much I wanted to share with everyone, so I try to post at least twice a week,\\u201d Bernie says. She loves creating reels, especially with her fellow Summit classmates. Since using her Instagram for beauty school, Bernie has noticed an increase in engagement and followers and thinks it\\u2019s fun to encourage everyone and their work.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Check Out Her Work!<\\/h3>\\n<p>Bernie loves using her social media as a portfolio for her own reference and to showcase her work. You can find her on Instagram: @bodyd.beautybar<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-4369\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-300x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-1024x1024.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-1536x1536.jpeg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-400x400.jpeg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-600x600.jpeg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A-550x550.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/179EF73B-9676-4152-A221-FA5B7C480E1A.jpeg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-4365\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-300x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-1024x1024.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-1536x1536.jpeg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-400x400.jpeg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-600x600.jpeg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9-550x550.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/62D3B188-5FD4-49C4-9C44-B61EEEA0FEE9.jpeg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Choose Summit Salon Academy?<\\/h2>\\n<p>In the words of Bernie, \\u201cI wanted to join a school that would inspire me. I did my research and loved the esthetics program because it had everything I wanted to learn and also had the schedule that worked for me.\\u201d Her favorite thing about Summit is the sense of community she feels between the students, staff, and educators. We second that statement and are so happy she\\u2019s enjoying her time here!<\\/p>\\n<h3>Advice for Future Students<\\/h3>\\n<p>Bernie wants future students to let go of the idea of being \\u201cperfect\\u201d. She knows that while students are new and learning, that everyone will get their groove in time and as they continue to practice. She recommends being open to new things because this industry is full of different ways to get to the same outcomes. So, be prepared to learn just about anything and everything. She says to be yourself and be creative! Don\\u2019t think too hard about it, just have fun. Great advice, Bernie!<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4367 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/E33B8A6B-E0AD-4070-9B68-17AB277181CB-e1659039105280.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"421\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/E33B8A6B-E0AD-4070-9B68-17AB277181CB-e1659039105280.jpeg 650w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/E33B8A6B-E0AD-4070-9B68-17AB277181CB-e1659039105280-300x194.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/E33B8A6B-E0AD-4070-9B68-17AB277181CB-e1659039105280-618x400.jpeg 618w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/07\\/E33B8A6B-E0AD-4070-9B68-17AB277181CB-e1659039105280-550x356.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2>Interested in Learning More?<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If Bernie\\u2019s experience sounds like something you want for yourself, consider pursuing a future in the beauty industry. With programs in <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> and <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">esthetics<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, Summit Salon Academy may be a great start to your beauty journey.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> for more information about this opportunity. We\\u2019d love to answer any questions you may have, and even schedule a tour of our school! We can\\u2019t wait to hear from you!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The Social Promoter of the month is a way to recognize our incredible students and their great social media efforts. Bernie has been awarded this achievement this month for her impressive use of social media to build and showcase her portfolio. Learn more about Bernie on our blog!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4363\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Bernadeth \\u201cBernie\\u201d is a terrific student at Summit Salon Academy, and is being recognized as our Social Promoter of the month for using social media effectively.\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script t