-for-summit-salon-academy\\/\",\"dest_id\":1099,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2022\\/08\\/09\\/canvas-me-what-does-this-mean-for-summit-salon-academy\\/\",\"title\":\"Canvas Me: What Does this Mean for Summit Salon Academy?\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":12,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:02:21');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(429, 3, 'post', '4391', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/celebrating-16-years-of-summit-salon-academy/', 'Celebrating 16 Years of Summit Salon Academy!', 50, 'done', 1, 1100, '', '{\"id\":4391,\"date\":\"2022-08-25T12:33:10\",\"date_gmt\":\"2022-08-25T19:33:10\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4391\"},\"modified\":\"2025-09-11T13:12:55\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-09-11T20:12:55\",\"slug\":\"celebrating-16-years-of-summit-salon-academy\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/celebrating-16-years-of-summit-salon-academy\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Celebrating 16 Years of Summit Salon Academy!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Since our beginning, Summit Salon Academy has been where career-focused cosmetology, esthetics, and instructor training students learn, grow, and connect with industry leaders through our extensive programs in hair and skin. For 16 years, our beauty school has strived to help its students reach their fullest potential and excel in the beauty industry. Read more about what sets the Academy apart and celebrate our 16th birthday with us!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A Brief History<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma started its first class of Cosmetology students in September 2006, then expanded its beauty school with Esthetics in 2007. Since that time, we have helped over 1700 students graduate from one of our programs. We focused on bettering our best every day, celebrating wins, learning from mistakes, and having fun!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The mission of the Academy is to provide students with an education that prepares them for a full and productive career in the professional beauty industry. Our goal is to provide the best technical education as well as to teach our students the business basics necessary to grow a clientele so that they can prosper both personally and financially. With this in mind, we partnered with brands that have education as a primary focus:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">\\u00a0Redken<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Sam Villa<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Dermalogica<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">PCA<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Business Center<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">All have added so much to enrich our curriculum!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Becoming Accreditated<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3731\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_07July_Update_Subheaders_Final_students-300x150.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Students smiling at the camera\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"325\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_07July_Update_Subheaders_Final_students-300x150.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_07July_Update_Subheaders_Final_students-768x384.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_07July_Update_Subheaders_Final_students-550x275.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2021_07July_Update_Subheaders_Final_students.jpg 800w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">After opening the Academy, our next step was to seek accreditation. We chose the National Accrediting Commission of Career Arts and Sciences (NACCAS).\\u00a0 We became accredited in 2010.\\u00a0 The purpose of accreditation is to focus on academic quality and continuous improvement. Once accredited we were able to apply to the US Department of Education to be approved to offer our students federal financial aid.\\u00a0 We received that approval in May 2010. We are also approved to offer VA funding and participate in a variety of scholarship programs.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">As we grew our student body, we expanded by taking on adjacent space. This has allowed us to acquire more classroom space.\\u00a0 The Academy currently occupies 12,000 square feet. We have continued to keep our classes small to offer a quality education and smaller instructor to student ratios.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Giving Back to Our Community<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Through the years we have sought out opportunities to give back and become involved in our local community. We have offered complimentary services for Veterans and Military spouses as well as supporting programs for unemployed workers to get back on their feet. Our first hair show allowed students to show off their skills in hair and makeup through an experience similar to a fashion show. It began by supporting RAGS Wearable Art Show. The success of this show led us to explore more options which eventually evolved into our annual hair show \\u2013 <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/hair-bra-zaar-under-the-big-top-event\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hair BRA-Zaar<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">. All proceeds go to benefit breast cancer research at the local level. At our last event we raised $11,300 to support Dr Nora Disis\\u2019 research at the University of Washington\\u2019s Cancer Research Institute! We are very eager to bring back Hair our BRA-Zaar event in 2023 and allow our students to showcase their amazing talents.\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A Bright Future<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Along the way we have weathered life\\u2019s up and downs including the economic downturn in 2008 and the biggest challenge yet\\u2013COVID 19. We have learned to evolve, adapt and change and most of all to be resilient. All are great lessons to pass on to our students as life is ever changing and unpredictable.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-3503\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-300x200.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Valley Girls and Guys Blankets\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"434\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-900x600.jpg 900w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1-550x367.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/10\\/190605_129_candid-randoms-1024x683-1.jpg 1024w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">As we look ahead to the future, we are excited to continue to expand our curriculum and explore how to utilize technology and social media to help our students learn better\\u2026 Summit Fuse, VISH and CanvasMe are examples of platforms we\\u2019ve incorporated that are designed exclusively for the beauty industry. We are also eager to expand our curriculum around Financial Literacy \\u2013 helping our students better understand money basics. We are very eager to bring back Hair our BRA-Zaar event in 2023 and allow our students to showcase their amazing talents.\\u00a0 <\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We thank all our fabulous educators, staff members and students over the years who helped us\\u00a0achieve this wonderful Sweet 16 Celebration! We have loved having you as a part of our journey and\\u00a0 look forward to many great years ahead. Cheers to 16 years!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4392\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-300x215.png\\\" alt=\\\"summit salon tacoma team\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" height=\\\"467\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-300x215.png 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-1024x735.png 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-768x551.png 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-557x400.png 557w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-836x600.png 836w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image-550x395.png 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/image.png 1376w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Pursue Your Passions at Summit Salon Academy<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Are you ready to be a part of a school invested in your future? Join us at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma and pursue your dreams! We have programs in cosmetology, esthetics, and instructor training. <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to learn more about us or to get started on your journey. We can\\u2019t wait for you to join us in 16 more years of education!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Summit Salon Academy has been in business since 2006, striving to provide extensive programs for our students to excel in the beauty industry. This year we celebrate our 16th birthday! Learn more about our history and what sets us apart on our blog! <\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":3596,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[19],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4391\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-news-events\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Since our start in 2006, Summit Salon Academy has strived to help our students reach excellence. Learn more about us on our blog and celebrate our sweet 16 with us!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/celebrating-16-years-of-summit-salon-academy\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\