INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(430, 3, 'post', '4398', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/social-promoter-of-the-month-miranda-roybal/', 'Social Promoter of the Month: Miranda Roybal', 50, 'done', 1, 1101, '', '{\"id\":4398,\"date\":\"2022-09-17T20:47:22\",\"date_gmt\":\"2022-09-18T03:47:22\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4398\"},\"modified\":\"2022-09-17T20:47:22\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2022-09-18T03:47:22\",\"slug\":\"social-promoter-of-the-month-miranda-roybal\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-miranda-roybal\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Social Promoter of the Month: Miranda Roybal\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Meet this month\\u2019s Social Promoter of the Month: Miranda Roybal! Miranda has been at Summit Salon Academy for about 8 months, and we have loved having her as a student! Before enrolling in beauty school, Miranda was pursuing nursing. Now, we are excited to have her with us for her journey into the world of beauty.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Get to Know Miranda<\\/h2>\\n<p>Miranda chose cosmetology because she has always liked to make people feel good, and there is absolutely no better feeling than leaving the salon after a good service. She strives to create this experience for her guests in school, while also preparing for when she\\u2019s out in the real world. She enjoys learning new techniques from her peers and other stylists. She says, \\u201cIt always amazes me how you can level up your service with simple tips and tricks.\\u201d We couldn\\u2019t agree more, Miranda!\\u00a0\\u00a0<img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4401\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-279x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"miranda roybal client\\\" width=\\\"500\\\" height=\\\"537\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-279x300.jpg 279w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-954x1024.jpg 954w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-768x825.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-1431x1536.jpg 1431w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-373x400.jpg 373w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-559x600.jpg 559w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002-550x590.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image002.jpg 1440w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>When Miranda isn\\u2019t practicing her beauty skills at Summit Salon, she loves cooking and taking care of her beautiful plants. We think those are both incredible skills to have!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Miranda on Social Media<\\/h2>\\n<p>Social media is a great way for beauty students and professionals to build their brand. Miranda knows she can use it to showcase her work and skills in front of a larger audience. Social media has allowed Miranda to display the work she is proud of and present a portfolio to her clients and future employees!<\\/p>\\n<p>Miranda frequently used social media before starting at Summit Salon Academy, But she had to learn how to approach people and be more open so future clients can create a personable image of her. This is a great opportunity to find more people to work with and build her beauty brand!<\\/p>\\n<h3>Check Her Out on Instagram!<\\/h3>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4403\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-240x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"miranda roybal client\\\" width=\\\"500\\\" height=\\\"625\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-320x400.jpg 320w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-480x600.jpg 480w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004-550x688.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image004.jpg 1440w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Since building her beauty-focused social media accounts, Miranda has seen her followers change from just family and friends to strangers and salons. Miranda is a great example of how social media can help a small beauty professional grow their brand!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Miranda posts her work on her Instagram account: <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/rootsbyrandi\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">@rootsbyrandi<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">. Here you can see her styling, DM her your questions, and make an appointment.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2>Why Summit Salon?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Choosing the right beauty school is a big decision and can leave you feeling overwhelmed. That\\u2019s why we asked Miranda why she chose Summit Salon. She said, \\u201cSummit\\u2019s reputation in the beauty industry is held to a high standard. I wanted to get the best education I could possibly get!\\u201d Miranda believes that the most valuable thing she\\u2019s learned at Summit Salon is to accept that you will make mistakes and choose to learn from them.<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-4400\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-200x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"miranda roybal\\\" width=\\\"500\\\" height=\\\"750\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-1365x2048.jpg 1365w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-267x400.jpg 267w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-400x600.jpg 400w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-550x825.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/image001-scaled.jpg 1707w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>We strive to give our students the best education and opportunities, so we\\u2019re happy to know Miranda has found that with us! Now that she\\u2019s here, Miranda\\u2019s favorite thing about Summit Salon Academy is our instructor, Mrs.Cromartie. She always has the biggest smile in the room and makes each student feel heard and important. Mrs. Cromartie is the best!<\\/p>\\n<p>The one thing she wants to let future students know is that good shoes aren\\u2019t always cute shoes! You will be on your feet most of the time, so invest in comfortable shoes. Great advice, Miranda!<\\/p>\\n<h2>Ready to Learn More?<\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If you have a passion for all things hair, skin, and makeup, beauty school is a great place to expand your knowledge and skill set to grow in the ever-changing beauty industry. With courses in <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">cosmetology<\\/span><\\/a> <span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">and esthetics, Summit Salon Academy is a great choice to prepare you for a successful future in beauty!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If you\\u2019re still wondering if this field is right for you, <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">contact us<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">! We\\u2019d love to answer any questions and schedule a tour of our school. You can also <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">check out our website<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, or read some of our past Promoters of the Month stories:\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-meghan-lowe\\/<\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-bernadeth-rosario\\/<\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We can\\u2019t wait to hear from you!<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The Social Promoter of the month is someone who has devoted time and energy to documenting their work on social media. This month&#8217;s focus is Miranda! She utilizes social media to her advantage to help grow her network and showcase her portfolio. Learn more about her here!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4399,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[163],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4398\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-social-promoter\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Miranda is an amazing student at Summit Salon Academy who effectively uses social media to strengthen her portfolio. She\\u2019s being recognized as our Social Promoter this Month!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-miranda-roybal\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/social-promoter-of-the-month-miranda-roybal\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Miranda Roybal | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Social Promoter of the Month: Miranda Roybal\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2022\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/image002-2.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":800,\\\"height\\\":800,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"miranda roybal social promoter header\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2022-09-17T20:47:22-07:0