INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(433, 3, 'post', '4455', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-between-cosmetology-school-vs-traditonal-school/', 'Difference Between Cosmetology School vs Traditional School', 50, 'done', 1, 1104, '', '{\"id\":4455,\"date\":\"2022-10-28T14:53:39\",\"date_gmt\":\"2022-10-28T21:53:39\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4455\"},\"modified\":\"2022-10-28T14:56:57\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2022-10-28T21:56:57\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-between-cosmetology-school-vs-traditonal-school\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-between-cosmetology-school-vs-traditonal-school\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Difference Between Cosmetology School vs Traditional School\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<figure style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><\\/figure>\\n<p>Whether you just graduated or are looking for a career change, a question you might have is if cosmetology school or traditional school is the best fit for you. They are very different, so it\\u2019s a lot to consider between the two. Although many people assume that traditional school is the obvious choice, it\\u2019s not the right path for everyone.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you have a passion for beauty and are having a hard time deciding between cosmetology school and traditional school, we\\u2019re here to help! We\\u2019re going to talk about the differences between the two types of schools and get an idea of the right path for you.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.y7b3ieaepxs1\\\">What makes them different<\\/h2>\\n<p>There are a lot of things that make cosmetology and traditional school different so let\\u2019s dive into them!<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.2lbzema62ke\\\">Time to Graduation<\\/h3>\\n<p>Graduation time from a traditional school completely depends on your major, if you took college classes in high school, and how many credits you take each term. The typical time for graduation however is 4 years. This can be a long time for someone wanting to get into the work field faster.<\\/p>\\n<p>Cosmetology school can have a much faster turnaround time for graduation. Depending on the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/courses\\/\\\">program<\\/a>\\u00a0you choose to pursue, you can graduate in as little as\\u00a06-12 months. At Summit Salon Academy, we offer a full-time class schedule, which makes it possible to complete your education sooner.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.p06oxmstt275\\\">Classes required<\\/h3>\\n<p>Most traditional schools require you to take general education classes that aren\\u2019t related directly to your degree. This ends up taking more time and money to complete your education.<\\/p>\\n<p>At Summit Salon Academy, our classes are 100% geared towards\\u00a0the beauty industry\\u00a0and real-life skills you can apply in the work place. Our goal is to take your love for beauty and build a solid foundation of technical skills and knowledge. Here are some skills you can expect to learn in our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">cosmetology program<\\/a>:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Shampooing<\\/li>\\n<li>Hairstyling including Natural Hairstyling<\\/li>\\n<li>Hair Color, including permanent, semi-permanent, fashion colors and blonding<\\/li>\\n<li>Haircutting \\u2013 design principles and varied techniques<\\/li>\\n<li>Perms, Chemical Relaxers, and smoothing services<\\/li>\\n<li>Hair removal and lash\\/brow tinting<\\/li>\\n<li>Skin theory and basic facials<\\/li>\\n<li>Manicures<\\/li>\\n<li>Building client relationships<\\/li>\\n<li>State Board Prep<\\/li>\\n<li>Salon rules and regulations<\\/li>\\n<li>Social media marketing<\\/li>\\n<li>Proper salon sanitization<\\/li>\\n<li>Safety protocols<\\/li>\\n<li>Consultation skills<\\/li>\\n<li>Retailing<\\/li>\\n<li>How to build your personal brand<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.6vm3p3w098kk\\\">Learning Styles<\\/h3>\\n<p>Our programs take classroom instruction and apply it in the real world setting in our student salon\\/spa training center. Students perform services on guests under the instruction of our licensed educators. This type of learning is critical to building strong technical skill and understanding guest relationships.<\\/p>\\n<p>How you learn in a traditional school vs a cosmetology school will differ. Most of the time in a traditional school, your lessons will be taught through lectures and homework. Our cosmetology program takes in-depth classroom instruction, hands-on training in our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services\\/\\\">student salon training center<\\/a>, and guidance from our instructors to provide you with a well-rounded education. With small class sizes and one-on-one time with instructors, you\\u2019ll have a team of people cheering you on!<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.qsoybbw1nvnt\\\">Different opportunities<\\/h3>\\n<p>There&#8217;s never been so many choices for a variety of career paths and ways to make a living. Technical education offers a great alternative to the more traditional degree granting education. The beauty field is booming and projected to continue growing. Here&#8217;s a look at potential positions after graduating from Summit Salon Academy:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Salon stylist<\\/li>\\n<li>Salon owner or manager<\\/li>\\n<li>Color specialist<\\/li>\\n<li>Brand representative<\\/li>\\n<li>Distributor sales consultant<\\/li>\\n<li>Distributor store manager<\\/li>\\n<li>Platform artist<\\/li>\\n<li>Cosmetology instructor<\\/li>\\n<li>School owner<\\/li>\\n<li>Skin Specialist<\\/li>\\n<li>Lash\\/Brow Artist<\\/li>\\n<li>And more!<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.8sj40g186794\\\">Why Summit Salon Academy?<\\/h2>\\n<p>At Summit Salon Academy, we share your same passion. We&#8217;re dedicated to helping those who love all things beauty turn that love into a rewarding career. We\\u2019re focused on celebrating the wins, learning from mistakes, and having fun! We\\u2019re always adapting our curriculum to reflect changes in the beauty industry to ensure you\\u2019ll have an up-to-date education.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.aqn15g3qd2al\\\">Get started now<\\/h2>\\n<p>We&#8217;re excited to share what Summit Salon Academy is all about with you. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a>\\u00a0and let\\u2019s set up a time to talk about your goals and what you want to achieve after graduation. \\u00a0We&#8217;d like to invite you in to tour and experience our culture and environment for yourself. You&#8217;ll get to meet our instructors, see our students in action and learn how to start the enrollment process.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>If you just graduated or are looking for a career change and have a passion for beauty, you might be deciding between cosmetology school and traditional school. Read more to learn the difference between the two and hopefully see if Summit Salon Academy is the right fit for you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4457,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[149,1],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4455\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-cosmetology\",\"category-uncategorized\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Whether you just graduated or are looking for a career change, a question you might have is if cosmetology school or traditional school is the best fit for you. They are very different, so it\\u2019s a lot to consider between the two. Although many people assume that traditional school is the obvious choice, it\\u2019s not Trying to decide between cosmetology and traditional school? If you have a passion for beauty, read more and see if Summit Salon Academy is right for you!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-between-cosmetology-school-vs-traditonal-school\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-between-cosmetology-school-vs-traditonal-school\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Difference Between Cosmetology School vs Traditional School | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Difference Between Cosmetology School vs Traditional School\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2022\\\\\\/10\\\\\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2022_10Oct_Blog_Difference-between-Cosmetology-School-vs-Traditional-School_Instagram.png\\\",\\\"width\\\":800,\\\"height\\\":800,\\\"caption\\\":\\\"Woman Doing Hair\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2022-10-28T14:53:39-07:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2022-10-28T14:56:57-07:00\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-difference-betwee