(437, 3, 'post', '4940', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/what-to-expect-on-your-tour/', 'What To Expect On Your Beauty School Tour', 50, 'done', 1, 1108, '', '{\"id\":4940,\"date\":\"2023-06-02T11:46:35\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-06-02T18:46:35\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4940\"},\"modified\":\"2023-06-02T11:46:35\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-06-02T18:46:35\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-what-to-expect-on-your-beauty-school-tour\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/what-to-expect-on-your-tour\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"What To Expect On Your Beauty School Tour\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Choosing the right beauty school is a significant decision\\u00a0that can shape your career in the beauty industry. A crucial step in making an informed choice is visiting potential schools to see if they align with your goals.<\\/p>\\n<p>In this blog post, we will provide you with a comprehensive guide to help you make the most of your visit!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.fhax4xz68u5v\\\">What To Expect<\\/h2>\\n<p>Stepping into the unknown can be scary, so that\\u2019s why we\\u2019ve created this guide! A beauty school tour is the perfect opportunity for you to get to know a school, and a school to get to know you. During your tour, you can expect:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>An introduction to the school: <\\/strong><\\/em>We will introduce you to our school and provide insights into our history and programs and what makes us different. This is a great opportunity to ask questions you have regarding the school and the beauty industry!<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Meet instructors and staff:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0During your tour, you will have the chance to meet some of our staff and learn about their industry experience, qualifications, and teaching approaches.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Learn about expectations for success: <\\/strong><\\/em>We\\u2019ll review the course schedules and policies around attendance, grades, and commitment.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Tour of the campus: \\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/em>This is your chance to observe the classrooms and student salon, as well as explore the equipment and tools utilized by our students during their time here.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.keg6iklbm0g9\\\">What Should I Bring?<\\/h2>\\n<p>It&#8217;s essential to come prepared with a few key items to make the most out of your experience. While we don\\u2019t require you to bring anything, here\\u2019s a list of what you can bring:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>Something to jot down notes<\\/strong><\\/em><em><strong>: <\\/strong><\\/em>This can be a phone, a notepad, or whatever suits you! This is for\\u00a0jotting down any important information or questions that arise during the tour. This can help you stay organized and remember key details later on when evaluating different schools.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>A pen or pencil: <\\/strong><\\/em>This will allow you to take notes and make any necessary annotations.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Dress for your future career<\\/strong><\\/em><em><strong>: <\\/strong><\\/em>The beauty industry is a first impressions business. We\\u2019d love to see your style. We\\u2019ll also be discussing our dress code and other school policies with you.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>A parent, significant other, or friend: <\\/strong><\\/em>Whoever is important in your life that supports your education goals or who you want to help understand what a career in the beauty industry can offer you.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>An open mind:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0This can enable you to gain valuable insights into the beauty school experience and determine if a school is the right fit for you.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>By bringing these items and the right attitude, you&#8217;ll be well-prepared to make the most out of your beauty school tour!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.yg6pxfca8wdj\\\">What Questions Should I Ask?<\\/h2>\\n<p>During your tour, it&#8217;s crucial to ask insightful questions that will help you gain a comprehensive understanding and make an informed decision about your education. Here are some questions you can ask:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>What is the student-to-instructor ratio?<\\/li>\\n<li>Can you provide an overview of the curriculum and the specific subjects covered?<\\/li>\\n<li>What is the duration of the program, and are there any flexible scheduling options available?<\\/li>\\n<li>Can you tell me about the qualifications and industry experience of the faculty members?<\\/li>\\n<li>How does the school stay up-to-date with the latest trends and advancements in the beauty industry?<\\/li>\\n<li>How does the school support students in preparing for state board exams?<\\/li>\\n<li>How can I <a href=\\\"\\/financial-aid\\/\\\">pay for school<\\/a>?<\\/li>\\n<li>How often do students have the opportunity to work with real clients and gain practical experience?<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.gp2zh07p9mrt\\\">Tips For A Successful Tour<\\/h2>\\n<p>When getting ready for your tour, there are several tips to ensure a positive and productive experience. Consider the following tips for a successful beauty school tour:<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.pqacczdpkysz\\\">Do Your Research<\\/h3>\\n<p>Prior to the tour, familiarize yourself with the beauty school&#8217;s website, programs, and offerings. This can help you come prepared with specific questions and show your genuine interest during the tour. And the more you know about a school, the easier it can be to make a decision!<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.5zkx6eqz788w\\\">Arrive Early and Be Punctual<\\/h3>\\n<p>Arriving a few minutes early demonstrates your professionalism and enthusiasm. Plan ahead for traffic and give yourself extra time for anything that can come up! Being punctual also allows you to maximize your time, complete any introductory paperwork and fully engage in the tour without feeling rushed.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.qdkkvx7hdgvw\\\">Interact with Students and Faculty<\\/h3>\\n<p>Observe current students and faculty members working together. As you meet students\\/and or teachers ask\\u00a0about their experiences, the quality of education, and any advice they may have for prospective students. Their perspectives can provide valuable insights into the school&#8217;s environment and support systems.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.126oft7ds94v\\\">Observe the Atmosphere<\\/h3>\\n<p>Pay attention to the overall atmosphere and culture of the beauty school. Assess whether it feels welcoming, supportive, and conducive to learning. Consider how the students and faculty interact with one another, as this can indicate a sense of community and help you know if it\\u2019s a right fit.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.lhnqqh5qhaor\\\">Showcase Your Strengths And Share Your Goals<\\/h3>\\n<p>Let the school know what your hopes and dreams are for your future. Show that you are willing to put in the work and have the determination to complete the course. While beauty school is fun and creative it does take effort and willingness to learn new things and a commitment to showing up each day ready to do the work.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.2r1tbxzgljwg\\\">Schedule Your Tour With Us!<\\/h2>\\n<p>As you get ready for your beauty school tour, remember that this is your opportunity to envision yourself as a student, get to know the school, and explore the curriculum. Don&#8217;t hesitate to ask questions and gather all the information you need to make an informed decision. Take the first step towards your beauty career by scheduling your tour today!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact us<\\/a>\\u00a0for any other questions you may have. We look forward to hearing from you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Choosing the right beauty school is a significant decision that can shape your career in the beauty industry. In this blog post, we will provide you with a comprehensive guide to help you make the most of your beauty school tour!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4939,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,9],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4940\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-tips\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"In this blog post, we will provide you with a comprehensive guide to help you make the most of your beauty school tour!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/what-to-expect-on-your-tour\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/what-to-expect-on-your-tour\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What To Expect On Your Beauty School Tour | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"What To Expect On Your Beauty School Tour\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2023\\\\\\/06\\\\\\/SummitSalonAcademy_2023_May_Blog.png\\\",\\\