f\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/4940\\/revisions\"}],\"predecessor-version\":[{\"id\":4942,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/4940\\/revisions\\/4942\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/4939\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=4940\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=4940\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=4940\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"4940\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/what-to-expect-on-your-tour\\/\",\"dest_id\":1108,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2023\\/06\\/02\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-what-to-expect-on-your-beauty-school-tour\\/\",\"title\":\"What To Expect On Your Beauty School Tour\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:02:35');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(438, 3, 'post', '4990', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/your-ultimate-guide-to-beauty-school/', 'Your Ultimate Guide to Beauty School', 50, 'done', 1, 1109, '', '{\"id\":4990,\"date\":\"2023-09-11T08:37:49\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-09-11T15:37:49\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=4990\"},\"modified\":\"2023-09-11T08:37:49\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-09-11T15:37:49\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-blog-your-ultimate-guide-to-beauty-school\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/your-ultimate-guide-to-beauty-school\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Your Ultimate Guide to Beauty School\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>If you have a passion for beauty, you may be considering beauty school! While this decision can seem overwhelming, we\\u2019re here to make it a little easier. In this blog, we\\u2019re giving you the ultimate guide to beauty school! We\\u2019ll explore the benefits, the educational experience, and how to get started on your journey!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.uc7s0x7s7t2k\\\">Benefits Of Going To Beauty School<\\/h2>\\n<p>There are many benefits of going to a beauty school:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>Specialized Education: <\\/strong><\\/em>Beauty school offers a specialized education tailored to various areas of the beauty industry, such as cosmetology, esthetics, and more. This focused curriculum ensures that you receive the right knowledge and training in your chosen field.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Graduate Faster Than Traditional College: <\\/strong><\\/em>When going to a traditional college, graduation time is typically 4 years or more. With beauty school, depending on the program you enroll in, graduation time is around 1 year or less!<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Creative Expression: <\\/strong><\\/em>The beauty industry is a creative field and beauty school encourages artistic expression. With the opportunity to experiment with different styles, techniques, and trends, beauty school empowers aspiring beauty professionals to discover their unique artistic styles.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Business And Marketing Skills: <\\/strong><\\/em>Knowing how to effectively market yourself in the beauty industry is essential to success. Beauty schools often include courses on business, marketing, and entrepreneurship.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Practical Skills Development:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Beauty school offers a real-world experience that allows you to gain practical skills. Through supervised practice, you&#8217;ll gain proficiency in techniques, tools, and industry-standard practices. With the beauty industry being very hands-on, gaining these skills is crucial for your success and ability to thrive.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.mr0eo84wzqk5\\\">Which Field Of Study Is Right For You?<\\/h2>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.uyra1u7b6qej\\\">Cosmetology<\\/h3>\\n<p>If you have a passion for hair, skin, and nails, then our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\">Cosmetology Program<\\/a>\\u00a0might be perfect for you! Our goal is to take your love of hair and build a solid foundation of technical skills and knowledge. In this program, you can expect to learn:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Shampooing &amp; Blowdrying<\\/li>\\n<li>Hairstyling including Natural Hairstyling<\\/li>\\n<li>Hair Color<\\/li>\\n<li>Haircutting<\\/li>\\n<li>Perms, Chemical Relaxers, Brazilian Blowout<\\/li>\\n<li>Introduction to Wigs and Hair Additions<\\/li>\\n<li>Hair removal and lash\\/brow tinting<\\/li>\\n<li>Skin Theory and basic Facials<\\/li>\\n<li>Manicures<\\/li>\\n<li>And more!<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.wjoknko2zjxj\\\">Esthetics<\\/h3>\\n<p>If you find yourself passionate about skincare and want to help people feel and look their best, then consider joining our <a href=\\\"\\/class\\/esthetics\\\">Esthetics Program<\\/a>. At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we\\u2019re passionate about the skin business. We believe in the power of touch to transform someone and know that some aspects of beauty really are skin deep! In this program, you can expect to learn:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Product Knowledge<\\/li>\\n<li>Skin Theory<\\/li>\\n<li>Facial Services<\\/li>\\n<li>Basic and Advanced Skincare Techniques<\\/li>\\n<li>Machine Knowledge-Microdermabrasion, Handheld Devices<\\/li>\\n<li>Chemical Peels<\\/li>\\n<li>Tweezing<\\/li>\\n<li>Hair Removal \\u2013 Hard and Soft Wax, Sugaring<\\/li>\\n<li>Dermaplaning<\\/li>\\n<li>And more!<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.2vw5k7rlwn5y\\\">Instructor Training<\\/h3>\\n<p>If you want to inspire future cosmetology students and train the next generation, then the <a href=\\\"\\/instructor-program\\/\\\">Instructor Training Program<\\/a>\\u00a0could be for you. It\\u2019s crucial to have instructors who are passionate and willing to support each student as they work toward pursuing their dream career in cosmetology. In this program, you can learn:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Teaching methods<\\/li>\\n<li>Classroom setup<\\/li>\\n<li>Subject matter Overview<\\/li>\\n<li>Lesson plan building<\\/li>\\n<li>Assignment building<\\/li>\\n<li>Recordkeeping<\\/li>\\n<li>And more!<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.tmv02fwtpenj\\\">Factors To Consider<\\/h3>\\n<p>Deciding which field of study is right for you depends on what you want for your future! Here are some factors to consider when choosing a program:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>Interest And Passion: <\\/strong><\\/em>Consider which aspect of beauty you\\u2019re most interested in. If you\\u2019re drawn to hair, skin, and nails, cosmetology may be a great fit. If you\\u2019re more interested in skincare, then a career in esthetics may be perfect for you.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Professional Goals: <\\/strong><\\/em>Reflect on your long-term career goals. Research potential career paths in each field and choose the one that resonates with you.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Program Duration:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Another key point to consider is program length. Cosmetology programs tend to be longer while esthetics programs have a shorter duration.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.h5p77mfix8ev\\\">How To Get Started<\\/h2>\\n<p>If you want to enroll in either of these programs, here are the steps to take!<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Step 1: <\\/strong>For our cosmetology and instructor programs, the first step is to schedule an admissions meeting and campus tour. This will allow you to gain insight into our programs and our school. If you are interested in our esthetics program, we ask that you sign up for our quarterly information sessions first.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Step 2: <\\/strong>Explore your *financial aid options. Our financial aid representative can help you learn more about it!<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Step 3: <\\/strong>Schedule an enrollment appointment. You\\u2019ll receive new student orientation materials and pre-enrollment disclosures before finalizing your enrollment in your selected program.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*financial aid only available to those who qualify<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.5q95a0eaz8mi\\\">Admission Requirements<\\/h3>\\n<p>Prospective students must be:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>17 years of age or older and have valid identification to submit as proof of age, such as a driver\\u2019s license or passport<\\/li>\\n<li>Able to provide a high school or GED transcript<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.n499yrnnbsh\\\">Pursue Your Passions With Us!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Embarking on a journey in the beauty industry can be an exciting and rewarding path. Let us help you turn your passion into a career. Fill out the form <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">here<\\/a>\\u00a0and we\\u2019ll reach out to you as soon as we can to chat, answer your questions, and schedule your tour! We can\\u2019t wait to meet you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>If you have a passion for beauty, you may be considering beauty school! In this blog, we\\u2019re giving you the ultimate guide to beauty school! We\\u2019ll explore the benefits, the educational experience, and how to get started on your journey!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":4989,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[23],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-4990\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-tips-and-tricks\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"We\\u2019re giving you the ultimate guide to beauty school! We\\u2019ll explore the benefits, the educational experience, and how to get started on your journey!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/your-ultimate-guide-to-beauty-school\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/your-ultimate-guide-to-beauty-school\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Your Ultimate Guide to Beauty School | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Your Ultimate Guide to Beauty School\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/wp-co