INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(439, 3, 'post', '5052', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/guest-services-at-a-beauty-school/', 'What Is It Like To Get Guest Services At A Beauty School?', 50, 'done', 1, 1110, '', '{\"id\":5052,\"date\":\"2023-09-25T11:46:56\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-09-25T18:46:56\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=5052\"},\"modified\":\"2023-10-10T11:47:22\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-10-10T18:47:22\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-blog-post-what-is-it-like-to-get-guest-services-at-a-beauty-school\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services-at-a-beauty-school\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"What Is It Like To Get Guest Services At A Beauty School?\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>When it comes to receiving beauty services, we often think of luxurious salons and experienced professionals. However, there&#8217;s a hidden gem that offers an equally remarkable experience: beauty schools. Summit Salon Academy, not only trains future beauty professionals but also provides a guest services program. In this blog post, we delve into the unique experience of getting guest services at a beauty school!<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.tnhznyw0vyuh\\\">The Role of Hands-On Training in Education<\\/h2>\\n<p>When you opt for guest services at a beauty school, you&#8217;re not just receiving a service; you&#8217;re helping aspiring beauty professionals on their educational journey. Our student salon training center provides students with a unique opportunity to refine their techniques, gain confidence, and interact with clients\\u2014a crucial aspect of their education.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.7djkrbhuuelr\\\">The Process Of Educator Supervision<\\/h2>\\n<p>What sets <a href=\\\"\\/guest-services\\/\\\">guest services<\\/a>\\u00a0apart is how closely the educators are involved. These experienced and licensed pros are right there, guiding students through each step of the service. They&#8217;re like personal coaches, supporting and assisting students when needed. Students are also graded on each service and receive important feedback on their growth as future stylists and estheticians.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.315fle26287n\\\">Cost Savings<\\/h2>\\n<p>One of the most appealing aspects of getting guest services at a beauty school is the significant cost savings. Guests have the opportunity to receive high-quality services at a fraction of the price they would pay at a traditional salon. This affordability opens up doors for trying new treatments, experimenting with different looks, and pampering oneself more frequently. Additionally, it aligns with the philosophy of &#8220;progress, not perfection.&#8221; While students are learning and perfecting their skills, guests can enjoy the journey, knowing that they are contributing to the growth of future beauty professionals.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.dxu8bc9w3xfe\\\">Exploring the Full Menu of Services<\\/h2>\\n<p>We offer a wide range of services, ranging from hair and skin treatments to nail services. This offering ensures that guests can find a service that suits their preferences and needs. Whether you&#8217;re looking to refresh your hair color, indulge in a nourishing conditioning treatment, or rejuvenate your skin, we\\u2019ve got you covered.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.fqgwrpqgihhz\\\">Hair Services<\\/h3>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy\\u2019s student salon is the perfect place to explore new hair colors, whether you&#8217;re opting for deeper hues or vibrant glosses. Additionally, if your hair has been exposed to sun, water, or chlorine during the summer months, a conditioning treatment can restore its vitality.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.9jf7m4n3d97k\\\">Skin Services<\\/h3>\\n<p>Among the services we offer, there are skin services like Nano Infusion and Dermaplane. Nano Infusion, a non-invasive treatment, promotes collagen production and enhances skin texture. On the other hand, Dermaplane exfoliates the skin, revealing a smoother and brighter complexion. These innovative services highlight Summit Salon Academy&#8217;s commitment to staying on the cutting edge of beauty trends.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.6xnkp791426g\\\">Specialized Treatments<\\/h3>\\n<p>The academy also offers specialized treatments such as the Redken Acidic Bonding Concentrate, Olaplex treatments, and the Brazilian Blowout Split End Treatment. These treatments address specific hair concerns, such as damage and frizz, ensuring that guests leave the academy feeling confident and satisfied.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.4o06dq7w9zd4\\\">Waxing<\\/h3>\\n<p>Whether it&#8217;s a brow wax to frame your face or a leg wax for that extra touch of glamour, our esthetics students are trained to handle your waxing needs with care and precision. Under the watchful eye of educators, you can trust that you&#8217;ll walk away hair-free.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.gddicvz251rd\\\">Sugaring<\\/h3>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.healthline.com\\/health\\/beauty-skin-care\\/sugaring-vs-waxing#:~:text=With%20sugaring%2C%20the%20paste%20doesn,top%20layer%20of%20the%20skin.\\\">Similar to waxing<\\/a>, this hair removal method offers a natural and gentle approach to achieving smooth, hair-free skin. Sugaring involves using a natural sugar-based paste that adheres to the hair, allowing for a smoother removal process that&#8217;s often less painful than traditional waxing. If you&#8217;re seeking a more natural way to reveal beautifully smooth skin, sugaring might just be your new go-to.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.lh03e1d9j29w\\\">Nails<\\/h3>\\n<p>When it comes to nails, we\\u2019ve got you covered too. From classic manicures to gel, our students are ready to transform your nails, without the salon price.\\u00a0Whether it&#8217;s a special occasion or simply a treat for yourself, you can trust our students to provide you with a professional and enjoyable nail experience.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.oe2szjk4lo3u\\\">Schedule An Appointment Today!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Getting guest services at Summit Salon Academy can be a unique and rewarding experience that blends education, affordability, and top-notch services. Through the hands-on training approach, the watchful eye of educators, and the concept of progress over perfection, guests contribute to the growth of future beauty professionals while enjoying a wide array of services.<\\/p>\\n<p>Consider treating yourself to a fresh hair color, indulgent skin treatments, or specialized hair care to embrace the changes ahead.<\\/p>\\n<p>To get an appointment scheduled, <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><u>contact us<\\/u><\\/a>\\u00a0today! We look forward to seeing you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>When it comes to receiving beauty services, we often think of luxurious salons and experienced professionals. However, there&#8217;s a hidden gem that offers an equally remarkable experience: beauty schools. In this blog post, we delve into the unique experience of getting guest services at a beauty school!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":5051,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15,8],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-5052\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\",\"category-from-the-salon\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"In this blog post, we delve into the unique experience of getting guest services at a beauty school!\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services-at-a-beauty-school\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<