?post=5052\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=5052\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"5052\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/guest-services-at-a-beauty-school\\/\",\"dest_id\":1110,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2023\\/09\\/25\\/summit-salon-academy-tacoma-blog-post-what-is-it-like-to-get-guest-services-at-a-beauty-school\\/\",\"title\":\"What Is It Like To Get Guest Services At A Beauty School?\",\"author\":\"admin\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-08-27 11:02:37'),
(440, 3, 'post', '5060', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/help-us-raise-awareness-for-breast-cancer/', 'Help Us Raise Awareness For Breast Cancer!', 50, 'done', 1, 1111, '', '{\"id\":5060,\"date\":\"2023-10-27T10:20:03\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-10-27T17:20:03\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=5060\"},\"modified\":\"2025-09-11T13:12:30\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-09-11T20:12:30\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-blog-help-us-raise-awareness-for-breast-cancer\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/help-us-raise-awareness-for-breast-cancer\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Help Us Raise Awareness For Breast Cancer!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Breast Cancer Awareness Month is a time of reflection, solidarity, and action. It&#8217;s a month where individuals and organizations unite to raise awareness about breast cancer and support those affected by it. At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we are deeply committed to this cause, and we believe in making a difference in the lives of those battling breast cancer.<\\/p>\\n<p>In this blog post, we will delve into breast cancer awareness and highlight what we\\u2019re doing to support this cause. We&#8217;ll specifically focus on our partnership with HairToStay\\u00a0and how cooling caps are utilized to make a tangible impact. Together, we can make Breast Cancer Awareness Month more meaningful than ever.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.r8kq1vaev80u\\\">Summit Salon Academy&#8217;s Commitment to Breast Cancer Awareness<\\/h2>\\n<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we understand the significance of Breast Cancer Awareness Month, and we&#8217;re committed to making a difference. Our students learn the importance of giving back to the community, and breast cancer awareness is a cause that&#8217;s close to our hearts.<\\/p>\\n<p>Here are some of the ways Summit Salon Academy is contributing to breast cancer awareness:<\\/p>\\n<ol start=\\\"1\\\">\\n<li><em><strong>Partner to Help Raise Funds: <\\/strong><\\/em>HairToStay\\u00a0is a nonprofit organization dedicated to helping cancer patients prevent hair loss during chemotherapy. Summit Salon Academy is proud to partner with HairToStay\\u00a0to provide cooling caps to those undergoing cancer treatment.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Fundraising Initiatives:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Summit Salon Academy actively participates in fundraising initiatives to support breast cancer research, treatment, and patient support organizations. Every dollar counts in the fight against breast cancer, and we&#8217;re doing our part to make a positive impact.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.tia2vrucfucd\\\">HairToStay<\\/h2>\\n<p>One of the most visible and emotionally challenging side effects of cancer treatment is hair loss. For many individuals, losing their hair can be a devastating experience. This is where HairToStay comes in.<\\/p>\\n<h3 id=\\\"h.ytkuv7re9yr5\\\">Cooling Caps<\\/h3>\\n<p>HairToStay focuses on providing cooling caps to cancer patients. These caps are designed to reduce blood flow to the scalp during chemotherapy, thereby minimizing hair loss. By preserving their hair, patients can maintain a sense of normalcy and self-confidence during a difficult time in their lives.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you\\u2019d like to donate, you can do so <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/hairtostay.org\\/\\\">here<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.mmsw74d3cuu7\\\">How Summit Salon Academy Supports HairToStay<\\/h2>\\n<p>At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, our students and staff actively participate in supporting HairToStay&#8217;s mission. Here&#8217;s how we contribute:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>Donations: <\\/strong><\\/em>We regularly organize fundraising drives and encourage our community to donate to HairToStay. Your generous contributions can make a significant impact on the lives of cancer patients.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Awareness Campaigns: <\\/strong><\\/em>We use our platform to raise awareness about HairToStay and the services they provide. We aim to inform more people about this invaluable resource through our blog, social media, and events.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Fundraising Event Hair BRA-Zaar<\\/strong><\\/em><em><strong>: <\\/strong><\\/em>This is an event where our gifted students and alumni showcase hair and makeup looks based around a theme. In 2023 our theme was Vintage Vibes. We raised 11K for HairToStay.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.a3tt8sey15r7\\\">Supporting HairToStay During Breast Cancer Awareness Month<\\/h2>\\n<p>Breast Cancer Awareness Month is the perfect time to take action and show your support for Summit Salon Academy&#8217;s partnership with HairToStay. Here&#8217;s how you can get involved:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em><strong>Donate:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Consider making a donation to HairToStay\\u00a0through their <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/hairtostay.org\\/\\\">website<\\/a>. Every contribution, no matter how small, helps provide cooling caps to cancer patients.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Spread the Word:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Share this blog post and information about HairToStay with your friends and family. The more people know about this resource, the more individuals we can help.<\\/li>\\n<li><em><strong>Attend Events:<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0Keep an eye out for Breast Cancer Awareness Month events and our annual hair show Hair BRA-Zaar hosted by Summit Salon Academy\\u00a0Tacoma. Your participation can make a difference.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.64haaqxvns73\\\">Breast Cancer Awareness Month<\\/h2>\\n<p>Breast Cancer Awareness Month is a time for us to unite, educate, and support those affected by breast cancer. We\\u2019re committed to playing our part in this vital cause, and we hope you are too!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>In this blog post, we will delve into breast cancer awareness and highlight what we\\u2019re doing to support this cause.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featu