-space: nowrap;\\\"><a style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/CxdpA4xJw7z\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">A post shared by Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma (@ssatacoma)<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p><script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.w02zkebo3tug\\\">Book An Appointment With Us!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Now, it&#8217;s your turn to experience the magic firsthand. We invite you to book an appointment at our <a href=\\\"\\/guest-services\\/\\\">student salon<\\/a>\\u00a0and let our talented students transform your vision into a stunning reality. Whether you&#8217;re seeking a glamorous blowout, vibrant hues, or a timeless updo, our students are ready to tailor their expertise to your unique style. Step into our salon, and let the next masterpiece be crafted by the hands of our budding artists. Embrace the beauty within you, and let Summit Salon Academy Tacoma redefine your hairstyling experience. <u>Book your appointment today<\\/u>\\u00a0and discover the allure of artistry in every strand.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>From timeless classics to cutting-edge trends, our students have embraced a diverse range of styles. Join us as we unveil the top 11 looks of 2023 that have left our clients in awe.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":5235,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[8],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-5236\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-from-the-salon\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aio