INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(442, 3, 'post', '5240', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/why-you-should-start-beauty-school-in-2024/', 'Why You Should Start Beauty School in 2024', 50, 'done', 1, 1113, '', '{\"id\":5240,\"date\":\"2023-12-30T09:19:39\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-12-30T17:19:39\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=5240\"},\"modified\":\"2024-01-10T09:21:54\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2024-01-10T17:21:54\",\"slug\":\"summit-salon-academy-tacoma-blog-post-why-you-should-start-beauty-school-in-2024\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/why-you-should-start-beauty-school-in-2024\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Why You Should Start Beauty School in 2024\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Have you been considering a career in beauty? We\\u2019d like to help you explore the reasons why 2024 may be the best time to move forward and make things happen. Embarking on a journey into the world of beauty can be an exciting and rewarding decision, and choosing the right beauty school is a crucial step toward a successful career. We think 2024 could be the best time to kickstart your passion for beauty! In this blog post, we will explore compelling reasons why you should consider starting beauty school this year.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.3xp98xuudztm\\\">Fulfill Your Creative Side<\\/h2>\\n<p>Lean into your creativity and learn how to use that passion to build an exciting career. At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, the emphasis is not just on learning the technical aspects of cosmetology but also on nurturing your creative instincts. Beauty is an art form, and we recognize the importance of tapping into your artistic potential. The curriculum is designed to inspire and encourage your creative side, providing a comprehensive understanding of the latest trends, techniques, and innovations in the beauty industry. The instructors at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma are experienced professionals who are passionate about their craft. They not only impart technical knowledge but also share their insights into the creative aspects of the beauty world. As a student in our salon training center you&#8217;ll have the opportunity to experiment with different styles, colors, and trends, allowing your artistic flair to shine.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.42p0fgr3jn15\\\">Start Now and Have A New Career in 2025!<\\/h2>\\n<p>Choosing a cosmetology education means that you can focus on what you love and be done with school in about a year! Unlike traditional academic calendars, Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma offers the flexibility of starting classes throughout the year so you can start when the time is right for you! This means you don&#8217;t have to wait for a specific semester to begin your journey into the beauty industry.<\\/p>\\n<p>The academy understands that everyone&#8217;s schedule is unique, and by offering rolling admissions, it ensures that you can start your beauty school adventure at a time that suits you best. This flexibility is particularly beneficial for individuals who are considering a career change or those who want to pursue their passion for beauty without waiting for the next academic year. It puts you in control of your education, allowing you to take the first step toward your dream career when the timing is perfect for you.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.rvfuln8jyjax\\\">A Variety of Skills Means A Variety of Career Options<\\/h2>\\n<p>A career in Cosmetology means that you can explore a variety of career options from stylist to color specialist, brand ambassador, salon owner, freelancer, distributor consultant and more. To prepare you, Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma goes beyond the conventional beauty school offerings. You\\u2019ll learn to understand the world of color theory and apply that to creating the latest looks. You\\u2019ll study texture and the varieties of ways to style and craft a variety of hair textures hair as well as exploring how to use wigs and hair additions later in the curriculum.<\\/p>\\n<p>Another distinctive aspect of Summit Salon Academy is our focus on business education and money management through the Summit Salon Business Systems program and Money.Edu by Qnity. Understanding the business side of the beauty industry is critical for building a successful career, whether you aspire to work in a salon or run your own business. Our programs equip students with the knowledge and skills needed to thrive in the competitive beauty market, covering aspects such as client retention, retailing, and effective communication.<\\/p>\\n<p>The academy&#8217;s commitment to a diverse skill set means that you graduate with a comprehensive understanding of the beauty industry, making you a well-rounded and sought-after professional. Wherever your passion lies Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma has you covered.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.a67ir32zqo8z\\\">There\\u2019s More Financing Options Than You Might Think<\\/h2>\\n<p>Understanding the financial aspect of pursuing your education is crucial, and Summit Salon Academy is committed to helping prospective students explore the various options to help make beauty school accessible. We encourage prospective students to connect with our dedicated financial aid representative who is here to answer your questions and guide you through the process to exploring available options.<\\/p>\\n<p>There are so many options out there from financial aid (*available to those who qualify), to a variety of scholarships and payment plans. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.beautyschools.org\\/\\\">Beautyschools.org<\\/a>\\u00a0is a valuable resource for those seeking scholarships. This website offers a vast array of scholarships specifically tailored for beauty school students. We encourage you to take the time to apply, as they say \\u2026\\u201dyou can\\u2019t win if you don\\u2019t play\\u201d.<\\/p>\\n<p>Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma recognizes the importance of supporting aspiring beauty professionals on their educational journey and seeks to help prospective students to explore the many opportunities available to ease the financial burden.<\\/p>\\n<p><em>*Financial aid is only available to those who qualify<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.joiux2y2797p\\\">There\\u2019s No Better Time Than The Present!<\\/h2>\\n<p>If you\\u2019ve been putting your dreams on hold, there\\u2019s no better time than the present. Starting now means you\\u2019re one step closer to your dream career. Let us help you gain a competitive edge, be in the know of industry trends and emerge as a well-rounded beauty professional ready to make your mark in the professional beauty industry! Whether your passion lies in artistic creativity, diverse skill development, or the entrepreneurial aspects of beauty, taking the first step now sets the foundation for a successful and fulfilling career.<\\/p>\\n<h2 id=\\\"h.zhlih3xbs3kb\\\">Ready To Get Started?<\\/h2>\\n<p>Starting beauty school in 2024 at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma can be a decision that transforms your passion for beauty into a rewarding career.<\\/p>\\n<p>If you&#8217;re ready to unleash your creativity and pursue a beauty education, Summit Salon Academy can be the perfect starting point. Take the first step towards your dream career\\u2014<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\">reach out to our friendly admissions representative<\\/a>\\u00a0for more information and get started on your transformative journey in the beauty industry today. Your future in beauty awaits! We\\u2019re excited to meet you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>In 2024, there&#8217;s no better time to kickstart your passion for beauty! In this blog post, we will explore compelling reasons why you should consider starting beauty school this year.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":5239,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\