2019s Summit Salon Academy raises $32,000 for HairToStay, the only nonprofit that helps cancer patients keep their hair during chemotherapy. 100 cosmetology students styled 34 models to capture the hearts of their communities with their 2024 \\u2018Barbie-themed Hair Bra-Zaar Hair & Fashion Runway Show! https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/HXZXYiWtm9o Tacoma, Wash\\u2014Giving back to their local community has been an\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/tacomas-summit-salon-academy-raises-32000-for-hairtostay\\/\",\"robots\":\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/tacomas-summit-salon-academy-raises-32000-for-hairtostay\\/#article\",\"name\":\"Tacoma\\u2019s Summit Salon Academy raises $32,000 for HairToStay | Summit Salon Academy\",\"headline\":\"Tacoma\\u2019s Summit Salon Academy raises $32,000 for HairToStay\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/author\\/webdev\\/#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/Screen-Shot-2024-10-10-at-3.18.54-PM.png\",\"width\":2540,\"height\":1448},\"datePublished\":\"2024-10-01T14:14:34-07:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-09-11T13:12:18-07:00\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/tacomas-summit-salon-academy-raises-32000-for-hairtostay\\/#webpage\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/tacomas-summit-salon-academy-raises-32000-for-hairtostay\\/#webpage\"},\"articleSection\":\"Blog, Breast Cancer Awareness Month, Events, Hair BRA-Zaar, News &amp; Events, News and Events\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.