(446, 3, 'post', '5464', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/from-cuts-to-cold-rinses-how-summit-salon-academy-tacoma-supports-hairtostay/', 'From Cuts to Cold Rinses: How Summit Salon Academy Tacoma Supports HairToStay', 50, 'done', 1, 1117, '', '{\"id\":5464,\"date\":\"2024-11-27T16:03:43\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-11-28T00:03:43\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=5464\"},\"modified\":\"2025-09-11T13:12:01\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-09-11T20:12:01\",\"slug\":\"from-cuts-to-cold-rinses-how-summit-salon-academy-tacoma-supports-hairtostay\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/from-cuts-to-cold-rinses-how-summit-salon-academy-tacoma-supports-hairtostay\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"From Cuts to Cold Rinses: How Summit Salon Academy Tacoma Supports HairToStay\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe in using our platform to teach more than just beauty skills. We aim to make a difference in the lives of our clients and community. We\\u2019re thrilled to partner with HairToStay, a nonprofit that helps cancer patients keep their hair during chemotherapy. Through scalp-cooling technology and fundraising campaigns like the Cold Rinse Challenge, we\\u2019re joining the fight to help patients maintain their sense of self during a challenging time.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">What Is Scalp Cooling?<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Scalp cooling is an FDA-cleared treatment designed to minimize hair loss during chemotherapy. For many cancer patients, hair loss can be an emotionally devastating side effect. By reducing hair loss, scalp cooling helps patients retain their sense of identity, privacy, and normalcy during a challenging time.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">How Does Scalp Cooling Work?<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The process involves wearing a cold cap during chemotherapy treatments. These caps cool the scalp by about 30 degrees, reducing hair loss in two critical ways:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ol>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Reduced Blood Flow<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Cooling causes blood vessels in the scalp to constrict, limiting the amount of chemotherapy drugs reaching hair follicles.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Slowed Cell Activity<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Cooler temperatures slow the metabolism of hair follicle cells, making them less vulnerable to the effects of chemotherapy, which targets rapidly dividing cells.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The Role of HairToStay<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">While scalp cooling is a game-changer for many, its cost\\u2014ranging from $1,000 to $2,500 per chemotherapy cycle\\u2014makes it inaccessible to some. That\\u2019s where HairToStay steps in.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">What HairToStay Does<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay is the only national nonprofit dedicated to providing financial assistance for scalp cooling. Since its inception in 2016, the organization has awarded subsidies to over <\\/span><b>6,100 patients across all 50 states<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, ensuring that low-income individuals can access this life-changing treatment.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Patients who qualify can apply directly through the<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hairtostay.org\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay website<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, with approvals often processed within 24 hours of receiving a completed application.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">How HairToStay and Beauty Professionals Work Together<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay collaborates with salons, stylists, and beauty brands to raise funds and awareness. These partnerships highlight the deep connection between the beauty industry and supporting cancer patients through this journey.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Notable Contributions:<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>We raised $32,000 <\\/b>for HTS through our Hair BRA-Zaar event this past June.<\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beauty professionals fundraise through events, raffles, and sales campaigns as part of the <\\/span><b>HairToStay 1000 Club<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> initiative.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we\\u2019re honored to join this mission, educating our students on the role they can play in advocating for their clients well being.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Introducing the Cold Rinse Challenge<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">This year, HairToStay launched the Cold Rinse Challenge, a national social media campaign raising awareness and funds for scalp cooling. Symbolizing the cooling sensation of the treatment, the challenge invites participants to take a cold rinse\\u2014whether in a sink, shower, pool, or lake\\u2014and then challenge three friends to do the same.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">How to Participate:<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Take the Plunge<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Record yourself rinsing your hair with cold water in a fun and creative way.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Challenge Others<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: In your video, say:<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"><br \\/>\\n<\\/span><i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">\\u201cI\\u2019m [Your Name], and I\\u2019m taking HairToStay\\u2019s Cold Rinse Challenge to help cancer patients keep their hair during chemo. I challenge [Name Three Friends] to take the challenge and donate at HairToStay.org!\\u201d<\\/span><\\/i><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Post and Tag<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Share your video on social media, tagging HairToStay and using #HairToStay.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Donate<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Visit<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hairtostay.org\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay.org<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to contribute.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-5465 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-scaled.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"2560\\\" height=\\\"1153\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-scaled.jpeg 2560w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-300x135.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-1024x461.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-768x346.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-1536x692.jpeg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-2048x923.jpeg 2048w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-800x360.jpeg 800w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-1332x600.jpeg 1332w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image0-3-1-550x248.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">How Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma Is Supporting HairToStay<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">During Breast Cancer Awareness Month, we brought the Cold Rinse Challenge into the salon!\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">In-Salon Cold Rinse<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We invited our guests to end their hair service with a cold rinse. This symbolic act raises awareness while supporting HairToStay\\u2019s mission.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>How It Works<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Guests can participate by filming their cold rinse experience and making a donation.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Spread the Word<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Tag your social media posts with #HairToStay and encourage others to get involved.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Fundraising Efforts<\\/span><\\/h3>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beyond the Cold Rinse Challenge, we\\u2019re hosting fundraising events, raffles, and other initiatives throughout the year to contribute to HairToStay\\u2019s impactful work.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Why This Partnership Matters<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">As stylists, we\\u2019re often among the first to hear about a client\\u2019s cancer diagnosis. For many, the decision to shave their head before starting chemotherapy is deeply emotional. With scalp cooling, there\\u2019s another option\\u2014one that allows patients to retain their hair and a sense of normalcy.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">By partnering with HairToStay, we\\u2019re not just styling hair; we\\u2019re helping clients maintain their confidence and identity during a difficult time.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"aligncenter wp-image-5466 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-scaled.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-scaled.jpeg 1920w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-1152x1536.jpeg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-1536x2048.jpeg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-450x600.jpeg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/image1-1-550x733.jpeg 550w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" \\/><\\/h2>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Join Us in Making a Difference<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Whether you\\u2019re a stylist, a salon guest, or simply someone who cares, there are many ways to support HairToStay\\u2019s mission:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Participate in the Cold Rinse Challenge<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Take the plunge and spread the word.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Make a Donation<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Visit<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hairtostay.org\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay.org<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to contribute directly.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Share the Cause<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">: Tell your friends and family about scalp cooling and HairToStay\\u2019s work.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe in the power of community to create meaningful change. Together, we can help more patients keep their hair and their dignity during chemotherapy.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Ready to make a splash for a great cause? Visit us this October to take the Cold Rinse Challenge and show your support for HairToStay. Let\\u2019s make a difference\\u2014one cold rinse at a time.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">For more information about HairToStay and the Cold Rinse Challenge, visit<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hairtostay.org\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">HairToStay.org<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe in using our platform to teach more than just beauty skills. We aim to make a difference in the lives of our clients and community. We\\u2019re thrilled to partner with HairToStay, a nonprofit that helps cancer patients keep their hair during chemotherapy. Through scalp-cooling technology and fundraising&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":5468,\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[187,162,19,14],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-5464\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-breast-cancer-awareness-month\",\"category-hair-bra-zaar\",\"category-news-events\",\"category-news-and-events\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe in using our platform to teach more than just beauty skills. We aim to make a difference in the lives of our clients and community. We\\u2019re thrilled to partner with HairToStay, a nonprofit that helps cancer patients keep their hair during chemotherapy. Through scalp-cooling technology and fundraising\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/from-cuts-to-cold-rinses-how-summit-salon-academy-tacoma-supports-hairtostay\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/from-cuts-to-cold-rinses-how-summit-salon-academy-tacoma-supports-hairtostay\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"From Cuts to Cold Rinses: How Summit Salon Academy Tacoma Supports HairToStay | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"From Cuts to Cold Rinses: How Summit Salon Academy Tacoma Supports HairToStay\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\