y\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Beauty school in Tacoma\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"Royal Looks, Runway Ready: Our Students Shine at Reign of Style | Summit Salon Academy\",\"description\":\"At Summit Salon Academy Tacoma, we believe that beauty education extends far beyond the classroom, and nothing showcases that better than Reign of Style 2025. Held earlier this year, this high-energy, high-creativity event brought together top talent from across the region\\u2014including licensed professionals and beauty students\\u2014to compete in a runway show unlike any other. With\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/royal-looks-runway-ready-our-students-shine-at-reign-of-style\\/\",\"robots\":\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/royal-looks-runway-ready-our-students-shine-at-reign-of-style\\/#article\",\"name\":\"Royal Looks, Runway Ready: Our Students Shine at Reign of Style | Summit Salon Academy\",\"headline\":\"Royal Looks, Runway Ready: Our Students Shine at Reign of Style\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/author\\/webdev\\/#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/06\\/SSA_Tacoma_Royal_Looks_Blog_Share_May_2025-1.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":1200,\"caption\":\"runway ready\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-27T15:19:03-07:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-09-11T13:11:42-07:00\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\