(454, 3, 'post', '5916', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/beyond-the-classroom-summit-salon-academy-students-shine-at-the-professional-beauty-associations-pba-beacon-program/', 'Beyond the Classroom: Summit Salon Academy Students Shine at the Professional Beauty Association’s (PBA) Beacon program', 50, 'done', 1, 1125, '', '{\"id\":5916,\"date\":\"2025-09-18T10:03:46\",\"date_gmt\":\"2025-09-18T17:03:46\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=5916\"},\"modified\":\"2025-09-18T10:04:58\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-09-18T17:04:58\",\"slug\":\"beyond-the-classroom-summit-salon-academy-students-shine-at-the-professional-beauty-associations-pba-beacon-program\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beyond-the-classroom-summit-salon-academy-students-shine-at-the-professional-beauty-associations-pba-beacon-program\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Beyond the Classroom: Summit Salon Academy Students Shine at the Professional Beauty Association\\u2019s (PBA) Beacon program\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe beauty school is more than just learning technical skills\\u2014it\\u2019s about creating opportunities that take your career to the next level. This summer, several of our talented students, who are now graduates, have proven just how far dedication, passion, and education can take you.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-5919 \\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-215x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"221\\\" height=\\\"308\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-215x300.jpg 215w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-732x1024.jpg 732w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-768x1074.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-1099x1536.jpg 1099w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-286x400.jpg 286w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-429x600.jpg 429w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257-550x769.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_4551-1-scaled-e1758214774257.jpg 1135w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 221px) 100vw, 221px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-5918\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-242x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"249\\\" height=\\\"309\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-242x300.jpg 242w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-827x1024.jpg 827w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-768x951.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-1241x1536.jpg 1241w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-323x400.jpg 323w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-485x600.jpg 485w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1-550x681.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image003-1.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 249px) 100vw, 249px\\\" \\/><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Grads at PBA Beacon 2025<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We\\u2019re thrilled to celebrate Keliana Fermahin and Lesley Rodriguez-Lopez, two Summit Salon Academy graduates who were selected to attend the Professional Beauty Association\\u2019s (PBA) Beacon program this year.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.probeauty.org\\/beacon-student-program\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beacon<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> is a prestigious program designed to connect the nation\\u2019s most promising beauty school students with top industry professionals. It\\u2019s a rare opportunity to network, learn, and grow alongside the best in beauty.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Both Keliana and Lesley shared their experiences at our most recent monthly celebration, inspiring current students with stories about what they learned, who they met, and how this experience is shaping their careers.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Keliana also achieved another incredible milestone while at Summit\\u2014she won a Redken contest that gave her the chance to shadow celebrity stylist Sam Villa behind the scenes at the Nashville Redken Symposium. She even got to meet him in person, an unforgettable moment that shows what\\u2019s possible when you take advantage of every opportunity as a student.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-5921\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-225x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-1152x1536.jpeg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-1536x2048.jpeg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-450x600.jpeg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-550x733.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_0178-1-scaled.jpeg 1920w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Competing at the Highest Level<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Our celebration didn\\u2019t stop there. We are beyond proud of Christi Keaveny, who received top scores across all categories in the AACS &amp; L\\u2019Oreal Student Stylist of the Year contest. Out of countless entries from across the country, Christi is one of just three finalists for the Best Overall Grand Prize Award.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The winner will be announced on August 4th at the CEA Convention in Orlando, and we\\u2019re cheering Christi on every step of the way! This recognition speaks volumes about her creativity, skill, and drive\\u2014and reminds us that Summit students truly stand out on a national level.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Supporting the Industry, Supporting the Community<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Another highlight this season came from our partnership with HairToStay, a nonprofit that provides scalp cooling treatments to help cancer patients keep their hair during chemotherapy. At a recent event, HairToStay gave us a special shoutout, recognizing our academy\\u2019s fundraising efforts to support their mission. It\\u2019s a reminder that the beauty industry isn\\u2019t just about style\\u2014it\\u2019s also about compassion, community, and making a difference.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-5922\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-225x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-300x400.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-450x600.jpg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-550x733.jpg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/image006-1-scaled.jpg 1920w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Maximizing Your Experience at Summit<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Stories like these from Keliana, Lesley, and Christi highlight the incredible opportunities available to beauty school students\\u2014if you\\u2019re willing to take advantage of them. At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we encourage every student to:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Get involved in competitions and programs<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> like PBA Beacon or AACS Student Stylist of the Year. They\\u2019re career-changing experiences that put you on the map.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Say yes to opportunities<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">\\u2014whether it\\u2019s shadowing an industry icon, volunteering, or networking at events. Every experience builds your future.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><b>Connect with your community<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> through outreach programs and partnerships like HairToStay. Beauty is about more than technique\\u2014it\\u2019s about impact.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-5923\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-225x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-1152x1536.jpeg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-450x600.jpeg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1-550x733.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9731-1.jpeg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The Summit Difference<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, our mission is to prepare students not only for a career but for a life in beauty that is exciting, fulfilling, and limitless. Watching our students step onto national stages and give back to their communities reminds us why we do what we do.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We couldn\\u2019t be prouder of Keliana, Lesley, Christi, and all of our students who continue to push the boundaries of what\\u2019s possible in beauty school and beyond.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><b>Are you ready to take your beauty education to the next level?<\\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, you can get the training, mentorship, and opportunities you need to shine. <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us today<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to learn more about our programs and how you can begin your journey.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-5924\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-225x300.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-225x300.jpeg 225w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-1152x1536.jpeg 1152w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-300x400.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-450x600.jpeg 450w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1-550x733.jpeg 550w, https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/IMG_9967-1.jpeg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, we believe beauty school is more than just learning technical skills\\u2014it\\u2019s about creating opportunities that take your career to the next level. This summer, several of our talented students, who are now graduates, have proven just how far dedication, passion, and education can take you. Summit Grads at PBA&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":5917,\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[5,1],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-5916\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-events\",\"category-uncategorized\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/beyond-the-classroom-summit-salon-academy-students-shine-at-the-professional-beauty-associations-pba-beacon-program\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/beyond-the-classroom-summit-salon-academy-students-shine-at-the-professional-beauty-associations-pba-beacon-program\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Beyond the Classroom: Summit Salon Academy Students Shine at the Professional Beauty Association\\\\u2019s (PBA) Beacon program | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Beyond the Classroom: Summit Salon Academy Students Shine at the Professional Beauty Association\\\\u2019s (PBA) Beacon program\\\",\\\