atacoma)<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p><script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">6. The Bob: Classic Cut, Modern Energy<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">If there\\u2019s one haircut that never goes out of style, it\\u2019s the bob. But in 2025, our students are reinventing it with modern twists\\u2014think soft layers, textured ends, and asymmetric angles.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The beauty of the bob lies in its versatility. Whether it\\u2019s a chin-length French bob, a blunt-cut power bob, or a shaggy layered version, this timeless style continues to dominate the salon floor at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><b>Why it\\u2019s trending:<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Universally flattering across face shapes and hair textures<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Easy to style for both professional and casual settings<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Can be customized with bangs, color accents, or curls<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Looking for a 2025 upgrade? Try pairing your bob with dimensional highlights or a wet-look finish for that editorial, runway-ready feel.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" style=\\\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\\\" data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/DPxDGYmkmV-\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"14\\\">\\n<di