color pops. Students at Summit Salon Academy Tacoma are leading the way, bringing artistry and precision to men\\u2019s coloring techniques.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">This trend is all about enhancing natural texture and giving hair movement without looking overdone. Whether it\\u2019s soft caramel tones through dark brown hair or platinum pieces for a more fashion-forward look, highlights are helping men express their style with confidence.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><b>Why it\\u2019s trending:<\\/b><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Adds depth and contrast to natural hair color<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Complements short fades, long layers, and everything in between<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Reflects the growing popularity of gender-inclusive beauty trends<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><b><i>Stylist tip:<\\/i><\\/b><i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> For a subtle finish, students recommend balayage highlights that grow out naturally. For a bolder take, pair highlights with a tapered fade or textured crop to emphasize contrast.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<blockquote class=\\\"instagram-media\\\" style=\\\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\\\" data-instgrm-permalink=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/DO7A5awEs_f\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" data-instgrm-version=\\\"14\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 16px;\\\">\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 19% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding-top: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\\\">View this post on Instagram<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"padding: 12.5% 0;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: 8px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left: auto;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<div style=\\\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\\\"><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\\\"><a style=\\\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/p\\/DO7A5awEs_f\\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">A post shared by Yesenia (@hair_stylesbyyyesi)<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/blockquote>\\n<p><script async src=\\\"\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/embed.js\\\"><\\/script><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Where Trend Meets Training: Inside Summit Salon Academy Tacoma<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Every one of these trends is more than just a style\\u2014it\\u2019s a reflection of the creativity, technical skill, and passion our students develop every day at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Our <\\/span><a href=\\\"\\/class\\/cosmetology\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Cosmetology Program<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> provides hands-on education in hair design, coloring, cutting, and styling techniques, all guided by experienced instructors who\\u2019ve built successful careers in the beauty industry. Students don\\u2019t just learn how to replicate trends\\u2014they learn how to create them.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, every haircut, color, and creative project helps prepare students for success\\u2014so when they graduate, they can be ready to bring the next generation of trends to life.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Be Part of the Next Big Hair Moment<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">From cherry cola hues to short red layered cuts, sunkissed brondes, mushroom browns, and dimensional blondes, our students are shaping the hair trends of 2025 with artistry and flair. Whether you\\u2019re a client looking for a fresh look or a future stylist ready to make your mark, Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma is where creativity, education, and opportunity come together.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><b>Ready to start your beauty journey? <\\/b><a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Contact us today<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> to learn more about our programs and book your tour.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The world of beauty is always evolving, and at Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma, our students are right at the heart of what\\u2019s next. Each year, we see creative minds experiment with color, texture, and shape\\u2014setting the stage for what becomes the next big trend. This year is no exception. From bold reds to sunlit&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":6038,\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"