(457, 3, 'post', '6159', 'https://summitsalonacademy.edu/why-choose-summit-salon-academy/', 'Why Choose Summit Salon Academy', 50, 'done', 1, 1128, '', '{\"id\":6159,\"date\":\"2026-03-19T12:58:56\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-03-19T19:58:56\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/?p=6159\"},\"modified\":\"2026-03-19T12:58:56\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-03-19T19:58:56\",\"slug\":\"why-choose-summit-salon-academy\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/why-choose-summit-salon-academy\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Why Choose Summit Salon Academy\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Choosing a beauty school is about more than learning how to cut hair, apply color, or perform facials. It\\u2019s about finding a place that believes in you, invests in your growth, and prepares you for a long-term, sustainable career. If you\\u2019re exploring your options in the South Sound area, here\\u2019s why Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma stands out.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">From business-focused education and strong community involvement to award-winning recognition and an inclusive culture, Summit Salon Academy is designed to help you build not just skills\\u2014but a future.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">1. Award-Winning Excellence<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Recognition reflects consistent effort, leadership, and impact. Summit Salon Academy Tacoma was named <\\/span><i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Best of Pierce County<\\/span><\\/i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> in 2024 and 2025, demonstrating trust and credibility within the local community. On a national level, the academy received the <\\/span><i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">American Association of Cosmetology Schools 2022 Community Involvement Award<\\/span><\\/i><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">, highlighting its commitment to giving back.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">These honors are built on:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Consistent student performance<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Strong leadership<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Community engagement<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A culture of professionalism<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">By enrolling, you join a school celebrated not only for education but for its impact.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">2. A Business-Focused Education with the Summit Salon Business Center Curriculum<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Many beauty schools teach technical skills. Summit Salon Academy goes further, preparing students for real-world salon success. Through the nationally recognized Summit Salon Business Center curriculum, students learn how top salons grow and thrive.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Key skills include:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Building and retaining a loyal client base<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Goal setting and performance tracking<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Retail strategies and increasing service value<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Professional communication and consultation<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Financial literacy for beauty professionals<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">This approach bridges the gap between school and employment, giving you a head start in income generation, client growth, and potentially even salon ownership. Employers value graduates who combine artistry with business savvy.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">3. Real Community Involvement: The Impact of Hair BRA-Zaar<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Community engagement comes alive at Hair BRA-Zaar, Summit Salon Academy\\u2019s signature all-school event. Students showcase creativity with runway-ready styles, braiding, and avant-garde designs while learning event planning, collaboration, and stage performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beyond skill-building, Hair BRA-Zaar supports HairToStay, a nonprofit providing scalp cooling treatments to people undergoing chemotherapy, helping maintain confidence and identity during treatment. Students see firsthand that their craft can empower, heal, and connect communities.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">4. Involved Owners Who Truly Care<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">At Summit Salon Academy, owners are actively involved in daily operations, ensuring students receive guidance, mentorship, and support. Educators share the same mission: helping students grow into confident, career-ready professionals.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">This unified culture provides:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Encouragement when learning new skills<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Support during challenges<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Guidance for career planning<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Mentorship rooted in real industry experience<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Having invested leadership and educators makes a tangible difference in student success.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><b>5. An Inclusive, Welcoming Environment<\\/b><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Beauty is about self-expression, and Summit Salon Academy reflects that in its culture and education. The school is LGBTQ+ friendly and creates a space where all students feel respected and celebrated.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Students are trained to work confidently with:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Diverse hair textures and curl patterns<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">All skin tones and types<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Customized techniques that honor individuality<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Inclusivity is practiced daily through respectful communication, diverse representation, and educators who meet students where they are. This environment fosters faster growth, better collaboration, and prepares graduates to serve real clients with confidence and care.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">6. A Culture Focused on Your Success<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy emphasizes professionalism, goal setting, and accountability from day one. Students learn to think like professionals, seeing themselves as future salon owners, creative entrepreneurs, and business builders.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">The structured approach includes:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Tracking performance metrics<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Client-building strategies<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Confidence-building experiences<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Graduates leave prepared for long-term career growth, not just state board exams.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">7. A Hands-On, Real-World Learning Experience<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Real experience builds confidence. Students practice hands-on training in a supervised, real-world salon environment, practicing consultations, technical services, time management, and retail conversations. This practical experience ensures graduates transition smoothly into professional roles.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">8. More Than a School\\u2014A Launchpad<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy isn\\u2019t just a place to take classes\\u2014it\\u2019s a starting point for your future. Students gain:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Business-focused education<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hands-on technical skills<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">A supportive, inclusive community<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Leadership that genuinely cares<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Opportunities for community engagement<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Whether your goal is working in a high-end salon, specializing in color or cutting, building a loyal clientele, opening your own salon, or becoming an industry educator, Summit Salon Academy provides the foundation you need.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Your Future Starts Here<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Success in beauty isn\\u2019t accidental. It\\u2019s built through:<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Skill<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Strategy<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Support<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Community<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Confidence<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Summit Salon Academy Tacoma combines all of these under one roof. If you\\u2019re looking for a beauty school that blends business education, award-winning community involvement, inclusive culture, and leadership that cares, Summit Salon Academy may be exactly what you\\u2019ve been searching for.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Ready to take the next step? <\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/contact\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Reach out to Summit Salon Academy in Tacoma<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> and discover how you can turn your passion into a profession.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Choosing a beauty school is about more than learning how to cut hair, apply color, or perform facials. It\\u2019s about finding a place that believes in you, invests in your growth, and prepares you for a long-term, sustainable career. If you\\u2019re exploring your options in the South Sound area, here\\u2019s why Summit Salon Academy in&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":4491,\"featured_media\":6162,\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[15],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-6159\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\",\"category-blog\"],\"acf\":[],\"aioseo_notices\":[],\"aioseo_head\":\"\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<link rel=\\\"canonical\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\/why-choose-summit-salon-academy\\/\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"generator\\\" content=\\\"All in One SEO (AIOSEO) 5.0.0.1\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\t<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"aioseo-schema\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/why-choose-summit-salon-academy\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Why Choose Summit Salon Academy | Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Why Choose Summit Salon Academy\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/summitsalonacademy.edu\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/webdev\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\"