",\\\"name\\\":\\\"ALVA Beauty Collective\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"What to Expect on Your Beauty School Tour | ALVA Beauty Collective\",\"description\":\"On your beauty school tour, you can expect to meet the admissions team, explore classrooms and student salon spaces, learn about program options, ask questions, and get a better feel for whether the school fits your goals. A tour can help you understand the student experience before choosing a beauty school. At ALVA Beauty Collective,\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/what-to-expect-on-your-beauty-school-tour\\/\",\"robots\":\"max-image-preview:large\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/what-to-expect-on-your-beauty-school-tour\\/#blogposting\",\"name\":\"What to Expect on Your Beauty School Tour | ALVA Beauty Collective\",\"headline\":\"What to Expect on Your Beauty School Tour\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/author\\/oozle-media\\/#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/ChatGPT-Image-Jun-30-2026-11_25_23-AM.png\",\"width\":1254,\"height\":1254},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-30T22:59:04+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-30T23:04:07+00:00\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/what-to-expect-on-your-beauty-school-tour\\/#webpage\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\