to Become a Barber in California | ALVA Beauty Collective\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"To become a barber in California, you generally need to complete a California-approved barbering program, apply for the licensing exam, pass the required exam, and receive your barber license through the California Board of Barbering and Cosmetology. California currently requires barbering programs to include at least 1,000 hours of practical and technical instruction. At ALVA\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#website\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\\\\\/#breadcrumblist\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/oozle-media\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"creator\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/oozle-media\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-07-31T20:59:27+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-07-31T21:13:18+00:00\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#website\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"ALVA Beauty Collective\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"How to Become a Barber in California | ALVA Beauty Collective\",\"description\":\"To become a barber in California, you generally need to complete a California-approved barbering program, apply for the licensing exam, pass the required exam, and receive your barber license through the California Board of Barbering and Cosmetology. California currently requires barbering programs to include at least 1,000 hours of practical and technical instruction. At ALVA\",\"canonical_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\/\",\"robots\":\"max-image-preview:large\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"webmasterTools\":{\"miscellaneous\":\"\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\/#blogposting\",\"name\":\"How to Become a Barber in California | ALVA Beauty Collective\",\"headline\":\"How to Become a Barber in California\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/author\\/oozle-media\\/#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/#organization\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-31T20:59:27+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-31T21:13:18+00:00\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\/#webpage\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\/#webpage\"},\"articleSection\":\"Uncategorized\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/how-to-become-a-barber-in-california\\/#breadcrumblist\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/#listItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/\",\"nextItem\":{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/#listItem\",\"name\":\"Uncategorized\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/category\\/uncategorized\\/#listItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Uncategorized\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\/blog\\/c