019s why classes in our Barber Program are available in Spanish and English, depending on the start date. Offering\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#website\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/why-we-offer-our-barber-program-spanish-and-english\\\\\\/#breadcrumblist\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/oozle-media\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"creator\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/author\\\\\\/oozle-media\\\\\\/#author\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/10\\\\\\/ALVA-Why-we-offer-our-barber-program-in-spanish-english.png\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/why-we-offer-our-barber-program-spanish-and-english\\\\\\/#mainImage\\\",\\\"width\\\":1254,\\\"height\\\":1254},\\\"primaryImageOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/blog\\\\\\/why-we-offer-our-barber-program-spanish-and-english\\\\\\/#mainImage\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-10-14T19:36:38+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-14T19:36:38+00:00\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#website\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"ALVA Beauty Collective\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.alvabeautycollective.com\\\\\\/#organization\\\"}}]}\\n\\t\\t<\\/script>\\n\\t\\t<!-- All in One SEO -->\\n\\n\",\"aioseo_head_json\":{\"title\":\"Why We Offer Our Barber Program Spanish and English | ALVA Beauty Collective\",