(3698, 6, 'post', '678', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C', 'Las Vegas Fire &#038; Rescue Earns “Center of Excellence” Honor from the IAED', 50, 'done', 1, 1183, '', '{\"id\":678,\"date\":\"2026-04-23T01:43:27\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-04-23T01:43:27\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T06:10:24\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T06:10:24\",\"slug\":\"9e84b643-bc95-445b-80f8-45786a11c52c\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Las Vegas Fire &#038; Rescue Earns \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honor from the IAED\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Media contact: Matthew Miko (801) 245-0579; <a href=\\\"mailto:matthew.miko@emergencydispatch.org\\\">matthew.miko@emergencydispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>April 22, 2026 (Las Vegas, NV)<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u2014 The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAEDTM), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch services worldwide, today announced that Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue\\u2019s Combined Communications Center has earned the IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation for emergency fire dispatch.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED\\u2019s ACE credential is the highest distinction awarded to emergency communication centers, certifying that an agency is performing at or above internationally recognized standards for best practices in emergency response. To achieve accreditation, agencies must successfully complete a rigorous review of 20 Points of Accreditation, including strong local governance, comprehensive quality improvement processes, and a demonstrated commitment to continuous, data-driven improvement.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cThe Combined Communications Center staff demonstrated dedication and teamwork in achieving accreditation. Their commitment ensured all standards were met and opportunities for improvement were addressed,\\u201d said Melanie L. Straeter, Communications Quality Improvement Coordinator with Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue. \\u201cThe professional and technical growth of Fire Communications members has resulted in high-quality service on every call. We are proud of our team and the enhanced service this brings to Las Vegas residents and visitors.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Alongside Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue, 73 other emergency dispatch centers representing medical, fire, police and emergency nurse triage responders worldwide have earned or re-earned the IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation. They will all be honored in the opening session of the NAVIGATOR conference in Las Vegas, NV this week.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Receiving this honor while NAVIGATOR is being held in their backyard, makes this year extra special for Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cACE Accreditation reflects our Combined Communications Center\\u2019s commitment to continuous growth,\\u201d said Fernando Gray, Fire Chief. \\u201cWhile many practices were already in place, this process reinforced service quality standards, the importance of fidelity in service delivery, and led to improved outcomes. This designation proves what I have always felt: our LVFR Fire Communications Team is one of the best in the world. Congratulations, Team.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Less than 10% of all emergency communication centers worldwide are ACE accredited, a distinction that is valid for a three-year period, during which all standards must be continually upheld. Emergency communication centers may earn multiple accreditations, one for each discipline they serve, including fire, medical, police, and emergency nurse triage. The Priority Dispatch System\\u2122 is recognized and used in more than 60 countries worldwide as the highest standard of care for emergency dispatch.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Accreditation is truly a pinnacle achievement,\\u201d said Christof Chwojka, Chair of the IAED Accreditation Board. \\u201cWe commend the calltakers, dispatchers, and leadership at Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue for their dedication to excellence and adherence to the highest standards. The ACE credential assures their community that their first responders are supported by world-class emergency communication.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch.widen.net\\/s\\/dnwrz8vtdb\\/ace-nav-recognition-2026\\\">&gt;&gt; To view the entire list of recipients by state, click here.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">For more information about IAED accreditation, visit <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/what-we-do\\/accreditation\\\">https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/what-we-do\\/accreditation<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">About the IAED<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED is the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch and response services worldwide and is the leading body of emergency dispatch experts. Our various boards and councils work on behalf of over 80,000 members in 60 countries\\u2014and in coordination with other influential public safety organizations\\u2014to ensure that the comprehensive system of emergency dispatching is safe, fast, effective and cutting-edge. IAED protocols are used in more than 4,216 communications centers across the world and have been time-tested across hundreds of millions of calls for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage dispatching. Learn more at <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.emergencydispatch.org\\/\\\">EmergencyDispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">###<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAEDTM), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch services worldwide, today announced that Las Vegas Fire &#038; Rescue\\u2019s Combined Communications Center has earned the IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation for emergency fire dispatch.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-678\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue Earns \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honor from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue Earns \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honor from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAEDTM), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch services worldwide, today announced that Las Vegas Fire &amp; Rescue\\u2019s Combined Communications Center has earned the IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation for emergency fire dispatch.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-04-23T01:43:27+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T06:10:24+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"3 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Las Vegas Fire &#038; Rescue Earns \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honor from the IAED\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-04-23T01:43:27+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T06:10:24+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":592,\\\"commentCount\\\":0,\\\"articleSection\\\":[\\\"Press Releases\\\"],\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CommentAction\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Comment\\\",\\\"target\\\":[\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/#respond\\\"]}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Las Vegas Fire & Rescue Earns \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honor from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#website\\\"},\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-04-23T01:43:27+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T06:10:24+00:00\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B643-BC95-445B-80F8-45786A11C52C\\\\\\/#breadcrumb\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ReadAction\\\",\\\"target\\\":[\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/9E84B