gencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=680\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=680\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=680\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"680\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/8E8F948B-CFE4-440F-A805-BDB78A35F524\",\"dest_id\":1185,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2026\\/04\\/23\\/8e8f948b-cfe4-440f-a805-bdb78a35f524\\/\",\"title\":\"Nathan Estes and Chris Clark Receive Top Honors as North America\\u2019s 911 Dispatcher and Instructor of the Year\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:54:41'),
(3701, 6, 'post', '681', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809', 'IAED Applauds 21% Improvement in Response Times for Life-Threatening Calls for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre', 50, 'done', 1, 1186, '', '{\"id\":681,\"date\":\"2026-03-09T20:07:39\",\"date_gmt\":\"2026-03-09T20:07:39\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T06:12:46\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T06:12:46\",\"slug\":\"8b2b55ef-c348-4580-bdf7-0571d564d809\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"IAED Applauds 21% Improvement in Response Times for Life-Threatening Calls for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>Salt Lake City, UT \\u2014 March 10, 2026<\\/strong>\\u2014One\\u2011year analysis shows a 21% improvement in response times for the most critical calls and a signification reduction in overtime for the Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre after implementing the Medical Priority Dispatch System.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">&#8220;The intent by the province with this more sophisticated dispatch system is to get paramedics to calls \\u2014 urgent, life-threatening calls \\u2014 more quickly. We are seeing exactly that,&#8221; said Jane Sinclair, the county\\u2019s general manager of health and emergency services.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch (IAED) congratulates CACC on these significant improvements achieved in their first full year using the <strong>Medical Priority Dispatch System (MPDS)<\\/strong>. According to a one\\u2011year analysis presented to Simcoe County Council, MPDS has <i>\\u201cfundamentally changed\\u201d<\\/i> how call priorities are distributed and has contributed to major operational enhancements across the service.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">During the review period, overall call volume remained stable; however, CACC reported markedly better call\\u2011volume management and a healthier work environment. Officials attribute these improvements to MPDS\\u2019s precision in triage, noting:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\\"wp-block-list\\\">\\n<li><strong>More accurate prioritization<\\/strong>,<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>More appropriate resource allocation<\\/strong>, and a<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Significant reduction in overtime<\\/strong>, allowing for more consistent rest periods and more effective scheduling.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Jane Sinclair further stated that staff were <i>very pleased to see the result of this new system,\\u201d<\\/i> noting that MPDS&#8217;s structured question\\u2011and\\u2011answer process has also increased accuracy in determining call severity, reducing the chances of mis\\u2011triage. As Sinclair emphasized, <i>\\u201cMPDS\\u2026 ask[s] more questions, so the level of accuracy is much better.\\u201d<\\/i><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Frontline performance data further reflects the system\\u2019s impact:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\\"wp-block-list\\\">\\n<li>Paramedics arrived first on scene for urgent\\/emergency calls <strong>41% of the time<\\/strong>, up from 34%.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Fire services were dispatched to <strong>76% of sudden cardiac arrests<\\/strong>, up from 72%.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Combined fire\\u2013paramedic arrival within six minutes for sudden cardiac arrest improved to <strong>59%<\\/strong>, up from 55%.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">&#8220;Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre&#8217;s results are exactly what the MPDS is designed to deliver: faster care for the sickest patients, improved responder readiness, and clearer decision\\u2011making at every stage of the call,\\u201d said Dr. Jeff Clawson, Medical Director and Founder of the IAED. \\u201cTheir first\\u2011year outcomes affirm the global standard that structured, protocol\\u2011based dispatching saves time, reduces risk, and ultimately saves lives.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Local leaders have responded positively. Wasaga Beach Mayor Brian Smith stated he initially had concerns but now recognizes the change as a <i>\\u201cmassive improvement.\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/i>\\u201cThis is essential to life saving in our communities,\\u201d Smith added.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>One year analysis shows a 21% improvement in response times for the most critical calls and a signification reduction in overtime for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre in Ontario, Canada, after implementing the Medical Priority Dispatch System.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-681\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>IAED Applauds 21% Improvement in Response Times for Life-Threatening Calls for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"IAED Applauds 21% Improvement in Response Times for Life-Threatening Calls for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"One year analysis shows a 21% improvement in response times for the most critical calls and a signification reduction in overtime for Georgian Central Ambulance Communications Centre in Ontario, Canada, after implementing the Medical Priority Dispatch System.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-03-09T20:07:39+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T06:12:46+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"2 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/8B2B55EF-C348-4580-BDF7-0571D564D809\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author