/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=689\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=689\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"689\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/C6B127F8-500D-453C-8448-0B6140844F53\",\"dest_id\":1194,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2025\\/03\\/13\\/c6b127f8-500d-453c-8448-0b6140844f53\\/\",\"title\":\"IAED Launches New Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:54:44');
INSERT INTO `wp_ucm_queue` (`id`, `run_id`, `item_type`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `title`, `priority`, `status`, `attempts`, `dest_id`, `message`, `payload`, `result`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3710, 6, 'post', '690', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC', 'IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action', 50, 'done', 1, 1195, '', '{\"id\":690,\"date\":\"2025-02-04T17:45:04\",\"date_gmt\":\"2025-02-04T17:45:04\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T07:43:55\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T07:43:55\",\"slug\":\"65ba45b7-5c50-4d01-ba00-c8f55864befc\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Ty Wooten, Director of Governmental Affairs<br>801-363-9127<br><a href=\\\"mailto:ty.wooten@emergencydispatch.org\\\">ty.wooten@emergencydispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>Salt Lake City, UT, USA<\\/strong> \\u2500 The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) is proud to announce its partnership with the U.S. Department of Transportation (USDOT) as an Ally in Action, supporting the National Roadway Safety Strategy (NRSS). This collaboration underscores the IAED\\u2019s commitment to reducing roadway fatalities and improving safety for all American drivers.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Following 10 consecutive quarters of declining roadway fatalities, the USDOT unveiled its 2025 NRSS Progress Report and introduced 15 new commitments from organizations like the IAED to further the mission of reversing the crisis on America\\u2019s roads. As a global leader in setting standards and accreditation for public safety emergency dispatch, the IAED brings its expertise to this vital initiative through innovative protocols, data analysis, and advocacy efforts.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED has worked to develop additional Post-Dispatch Instructions in its police, fire, and medical protocols relating to moving vehicles to a safe location after an initial crash. These instructions aim to reduce secondary crashes and improve the safety of responders and the public.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cThe International Academies of Emergency Dispatch is proud to join the U.S. Department of Transportation\\u2019s Allies in Action,\\u201d said Ty Wooten, IAED\\u2019s Director of Governmental Affairs. \\u201cEvery 911 call impacts our nation\\u2019s transportation system, and 911 professionals play a critical role in ensuring the right response and providing life-saving Pre-Arrival Instructions.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In collaboration with the National 911 Program, housed in NHTSA\\u2019s Office of EMS, the IAED is also evaluating data from over 50 million emergency calls to gain insights into roadway-related incidents. This study will identify the proportion of 911 calls tied to roadway emergencies and inform the USDOT\\u2019s Safe Systems Approach to roadway safety.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED also continues to champion reducing the use of lights-and-siren by first responders, promoting safer and more effective response practices. There is a statistically significant relationship between lights-and-siren responses and increased crashes on the road. One study found that an ambulance involved in a fatal crash was twice as likely to be running in emergency mode than not. By decreasing lights-and-siren responses, we can create safer roads for Americans.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\\\"># # #<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">About the IAED:<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch is the standard-setting organization for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage emergency dispatch and response services worldwide and is the leading body of emergency services dispatch experts. Our various Boards and Councils work on behalf of over 69,000 members in 59 countries\\u2014and in coordination with other influential public safety organizations\\u2014to ensure that the comprehensive system covering all aspects of emergency dispatching is safe, fast, effective, and cutting-edge. IAED protocols are used in more than 4,142 communication centers across the world and have been time-tested across hundreds of millions of calls for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage dispatching. Learn more at &nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/home\\\">emergencydispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">About the National Roadway Safety Strategy (NRSS):<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The National Roadway Safety Strategy (NRSS) is a comprehensive plan initiated by the U.S. Department of Transportation (USDOT) to address the critical issue of roadway fatalities and injuries across America. Focused on the Safe Systems Approach, the NRSS emphasizes shared responsibility among policymakers, industry leaders, and the public to create safer roadways. By implementing evidence-based strategies, fostering innovation, and promoting collaboration, the NRSS aims to reverse the crisis on America\\u2019s roads and achieve significant reductions in traffic-related deaths.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) is proud to announce its partnership with the U.S. Department of Transportation (USDOT) as an Ally in Action, supporting the National Roadway Safety Strategy (NRSS).<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-690\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) is proud to announce its partnership with the U.S. Department of Transportation (USDOT) as an Ally in Action, supporting the National Roadway Safety Strategy (NRSS).\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2025-02-04T17:45:04+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T07:43:55+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"3 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2025-02-04T17:45:04+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T07:43:55+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":572,\\\"commentCount\\\":0,\\\"articleSection\\\":[\\\"Press Releases\\\"],\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CommentAction\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Comment\\\",\\\"target\\\":[\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\\\\\/#respond\\\"]}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/65BA45B7-5C50-4D01-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\\\