1-BA00-C8F55864BEFC\",\"dest_id\":1195,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2025\\/02\\/04\\/65ba45b7-5c50-4d01-ba00-c8f55864befc\\/\",\"title\":\"IAED Partners with USDOT to Enhance Roadway Safety as an Ally in Action\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:54:44'),
(3711, 6, 'post', '691', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF', 'OnStar Recognized for Fifth Medical Accreditation, Celebrating 15 Years of Excellence', 50, 'done', 1, 1196, '', '{\"id\":691,\"date\":\"2025-01-09T16:48:15\",\"date_gmt\":\"2025-01-09T16:48:15\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T07:44:37\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T07:44:37\",\"slug\":\"35e1c01e-6a42-4417-9281-b16d4d7749ef\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"OnStar Recognized for Fifth Medical Accreditation, Celebrating 15 Years of Excellence\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Contact for IAED<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Pam Stewart, Senior Director of Operations<br>(<span data-teams=\\\"true\\\">385) 429-9391<\\/span><br><a href=\\\"mailto:pam.stewart@emergencydispatch.org\\\">pam.stewart@emergencydispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Contact for Priority Dispatch<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Chris Murdock, President<br>(385) 429-8097<br><a href=\\\"mailto:chris.murdock@prioritydispatch.net\\\">chris.murdock@prioritydispatch.net<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>Charlotte, NC, USA<\\/strong> \\u2013 Last month, OnStar was recognized by the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) for achieving its fifth consecutive Medical Accreditation as an Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE). This landmark accomplishment marks their fifteenth anniversary of becoming ACE, an achievement that takes a significant amount of hard work.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The ACE recertification process involves meeting a rigorous set of 20 Points of Accreditation, including strong local oversight, rigorous quality processes, and a commitment to data-driven continuous improvement. Accreditation lasts for a period of three years, during which time all standards must be upheld.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Becoming an ACE-certified agency in a single discipline\\u2014whether police, fire, or medical dispatch\\u2014is a significant accomplishment. However, achieving triple accreditation in all three disciplines, known as Tri-ACE, is truly a remarkable feat that reflects unparalleled dedication, expertise, and a commitment to excellence in emergency dispatch.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In April 2024, OnStar made history as the first and only private, non-911 entity to achieve Tri-ACE status.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Ruby Hilton, Assistant Manager of OnStar\\u2019s Emergency Quality and Analytics, highlights the work necessary to become a tri-ACE with the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cTri-ACE serves as a promise to OnStar callers that we will deliver the highest levels of care and professionalism, with a sense of urgency,\\u201d Hilton explains. \\u201cReaching ACE in one discipline requires significant time, effort and resources, and we worked hard and are proud to have accomplished this across all three disciplines.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">This latest Medical ACE accreditation not only reflects OnStar\\u2019s dedication to upholding IAED standards but also highlights the company\\u2019s long-standing role as a trusted partner in emergency response. Chris Murdock, the President of Priority Dispatch Corporation, affirms this point, noting:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cAchieving and maintaining accreditation is a testament to OnStar\\u2019s unwavering commitment to excellence and innovation in emergency response. This milestone underscores the dedication of OnStar\\u2019s team to uphold the highest standards in public safety.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">To celebrate its achievements, OnStar will be recognized at the U.S. NAVIGATOR Conference in April 2025 in Orlando, Florida, where leaders in emergency dispatch gather to honor excellence and innovation in the field.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">About the IAED<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch is the standard-setting organization for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage emergency dispatch and response services worldwide and is the leading body of emergency services dispatch experts. Our various Boards and Councils work on behalf of over 69,000 members in 59 countries\\u2014and in coordination with other influential public safety organizations\\u2014to ensure that the comprehensive system covering all aspects of emergency dispatching is safe, fast, effective, and cutting-edge. IAED protocols are used in more than 4,142 communication centers across the world and have been time-tested across hundreds of millions of calls for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage dispatching. Learn more at &nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydispatch.org\\\">emergencydispatch.org<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">About Priority Dispatch<\\/h4>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Priority Dispatch\\u2122 is the world leader in providing research-based protocol solutions to emergency call centers in medical, fire, police, and nurse triage disciplines. For over 44 years, EMS and 911 agencies have used the Medical Priority Dispatch System\\u2122 (MPDS\\u00ae), initially with cardsets and now only fully represented in ProQA software. Our solutions have been time-tested in 30 languages across hundreds of millions of calls and serve communities in thousands of agencies in 59 countries. Get to know us at &nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch.net\\\">prioritydispatch.net<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Last month, OnStar was recognized by the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) for achieving its fifth consecutive Medical Accreditation as an Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE).<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-691\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>OnStar Recognized for Fifth Medical Accreditation, Celebrating 15 Years of Excellence | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"OnStar Recognized for Fifth Medical Accreditation, Celebrating 15 Years of Excellence | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Last month, OnStar was recognized by the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED\\u2122) for achieving its fifth consecutive Medical Accreditation as an Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE).\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2025-01-09T16:48:15+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T07:44:37+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"3 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"OnStar Recognized for Fifth Medical Accreditation, Celebrating 15 Years of Excellence\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2025-01-09T16:48:15+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T07:44:37+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/35E1C01E-6A42-4417-9281-B16D4D7749EF\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":575,\\\"commentCount\\\":0,\\\"article