o make the difficult decision to disband their police departments.\",\"og_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/\",\"og_site_name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"article_published_time\":\"2024-09-19T19:26:13+00:00\",\"article_modified_time\":\"2026-10-19T07:52:34+00:00\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"twitter_card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter_misc\":{\"Written by\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"Est. reading time\":\"3 minutes\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\"},\"headline\":\"Disappearing Small Town Police Departments Threaten the Vibrancy of Main Street, USA: How PPDS v7 Can Help Amidst Staffing Crises\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-09-19T19:26:13+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19T07:52:34+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/\"},\"wordCount\":695,\"commentCount\":0,\"articleSection\":[\"Press Releases\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E03-80FD-0C05D12CB14C\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/A4D54282-CF22-4E0