(3716, 6, 'post', '696', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C', '103 U.S. Emergency Dispatch Centers Earn “Center of Excellence”  Honors from the IAED', 50, 'done', 1, 1201, '', '{\"id\":696,\"date\":\"2024-04-16T16:25:53\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-04-16T16:25:53\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T08:08:23\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T08:08:23\",\"slug\":\"45775273-da81-4697-b718-0c7ba29cfd9c\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"103 U.S. Emergency Dispatch Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d  Honors from the IAED\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">April 16, 2024 (NATIONAL HARBOR, MD) \\u2014 The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch<sup>\\u00ae<\\/sup> (IAED<sup>TM<\\/sup>), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch services worldwide, today announced that 103 emergency dispatch centers representing medical, fire, police and emergency nurse triage responders have earned or re-earned IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation.\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The honorees were recognized during IAED\\u2019s 2024 NAVIGATOR conference in National Harbor, Maryland, which is bringing together more than 1,300 emergency services leaders this week for continuing education and professional development.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">>>Click here to view the list of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch.widencollective.com\\/assets\\/share\\/asset\\/hbvnn37wzj\\\">recipients by state<\\/a>.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED\\u2019s ACE credential is the highest distinction given to emergency communication centers, certifying that they are performing at or above global standards for best practices in emergency response. ACE centers have completed a rigorous set of 20 Points of Accreditation, including strong local oversight, rigorous quality processes, and a commitment to data-driven continuous improvement.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cAccreditation is truly a pinnacle achievement,\\u201d said Christof Chwojka, Accreditation Board Chair at IAED. \\u201cWe applaud the dedicated calltakers, dispatchers, and leaders at each of these agencies for their commitment to the highest standards, which few achieve. The ACE credential means their communities can count on their first first responders to do an outstanding job.\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Accreditation is valid for a three-year period, during which all standards must be upheld. Emergency communication centers can earn multiple accreditations, one for each emergency discipline they service (medical, fire, police, and emergency nurse triage).\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Over 4,142 emergency communication centers worldwide use the medical, fire, police, and emergency nurse triage protocols developed and maintained by the IAED. The Priority Dispatch SystemTM\\u00a0 is recognized and used in 59 countries as the highest standard of care and practice for emergency dispatch.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">For more information about IAED accreditation, visit <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/what-we-do\\/accreditation\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/what-we-do\\/accreditation<\\/a>.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The IAED announced today that 103 emergency dispatch centers representing medical, fire, police and emergency nurse triage responders have earned or re-earned IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation in 2024. The honorees were recognized during NAVIGATOR conference in National Harbor, Maryland, which is bringing together more than 1,300 emergency services leaders this week.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-696\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>103 U.S. Emergency Dispatch Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honors from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"103 U.S. Emergency Dispatch Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honors from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"The IAED announced today that 103 emergency dispatch centers representing medical, fire, police and emergency nurse triage responders have earned or re-earned IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation in 2024. The honorees were recognized during NAVIGATOR conference in National Harbor, Maryland, which is bringing together more than 1,300 emergency services leaders this week.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2024-04-16T16:25:53+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T08:08:23+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"2 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"103 U.S. Emergency Dispatch Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honors from the IAED\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2024-04-16T16:25:53+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T08:08:23+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/45775273-DA81-4697-B718-0C7BA29CFD9C\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":301,\\\"com