(3718, 6, 'post', '698', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/4178AC70-D768-433B-8B4E-76FEF1319D4A', 'Mike Dolan of New Orleans  Honored as the Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year 2024', 50, 'done', 1, 1203, '', '{\"id\":698,\"date\":\"2024-04-16T13:29:58\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-04-16T13:29:58\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/4178AC70-D768-433B-8B4E-76FEF1319D4A\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T07:51:23\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T07:51:23\",\"slug\":\"4178ac70-d768-433b-8b4e-76fef1319d4a\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/4178AC70-D768-433B-8B4E-76FEF1319D4A\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Mike Dolan of New Orleans  Honored as the Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year 2024\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><i><strong>April 16, 2024 (NATIONAL HARBOR, MD) <\\/strong><\\/i>\\u2014 Mike \\u201cDoog\\u201d Dolan of New Orleans, LA, is being honored today as the 2024 Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year by the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch<sup>\\u00ae<\\/sup> (IAED<sup>TM<\\/sup>), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch and response services worldwide and the leading body of emergency dispatch experts.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The award, given annually to a North American emergency dispatch instructor who exemplifies excellence in his or her work throughout the year, is being announced at the IAED\\u2019s 2024 <a style=\\\"color:#0563c1;text-decoration:underline;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/navigator.emergencydispatch.org\\/home\\\">NAVIGATOR<\\/a> &nbsp;Conference in National Harbor. The annual conference brings together more than 1,650 emergency services leaders from across the country and the world to stay abreast of best practices in emergency dispatch protocols.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cMike Dolan has been instructing emergency medical dispatch [EMD] since 2005 and is one of only two IAED instructors who teaches emergency fire and police, as well,\\u201d said Eric Fayad, IAED Associate Director of Instructor Services. \\u201cHe\\u2019s animated and really engages students even remotely, he\\u2019s stellar at that. And his reach has been incredible \\u2013 over the 19 years he\\u2019s been an instructor, he has influenced the lives of almost 6,000 students. That means that in one year he touches around 78 million 911 calls. He was an EMT and paramedic for 36 years with the New York State Troopers, as well as a fire chief, and the breadth of experience and knowledge he brings to the classroom is invaluable.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">As a non-profit with worldwide reach, the IAED provides training, education, and certification for more than 70,000 emergency dispatchers in over 59 countries. The Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year Award is one of the most distinctive awards presented by the IAED, created to identify and celebrate individuals who have made the most significant contributions throughout the year to further the education and training of other professionals in the field.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cEmergency dispatchers are the <i>first<\\/i> first responders, the voices we hear in our worst moments when help is needed,\\u201d said Pam Stewart, IAED Senior Director of Operations and Board of Certification Chair. \\u201cThe Instructor of the Year Award recognizes instructors who go above and beyond to train emergency dispatchers, so that they are well equipped, prepared and confident.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">For more information about the IAED, visit <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.emergencydispatch.org\\\">www.emergencydispatch.org<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Mike \\u201cDoog\\u201d Dolan of New Orleans, LA, is being honored today as the 2024 Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year by the IAED. The award is given annually to a North American emergency dispatch instructor who exemplifies excellence in his or her work.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-698\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Mike Dolan of New Orleans Honored as the Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year 2024 | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Mike Dolan of New Orleans Honored as the Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year 2024 | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Mike \\u201cDoog\\u201d Dolan of New Orleans, LA, is being honored today as the 2024 Dave Massengale Memorial Instructor of the Year by the IAED. The award is given annually to a North American emergency dispatch instructor who exemplifies excellence in his or her work.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/4178AC70-D768-433B-8B4E-76FEF1319D4