(3721, 6, 'post', '701', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/B36C30C1-0608-44FD-8EFF-179B9CB2386B', 'IAED Will Eliminate Its Lapsed Certification Policy on July 1, 2024', 50, 'done', 1, 1206, '', '{\"id\":701,\"date\":\"2024-01-22T15:36:37\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-01-22T15:36:37\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/B36C30C1-0608-44FD-8EFF-179B9CB2386B\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T07:38:56\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T07:38:56\",\"slug\":\"b36c30c1-0608-44fd-8eff-179b9cb2386b\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/B36C30C1-0608-44FD-8EFF-179B9CB2386B\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"IAED Will Eliminate Its Lapsed Certification Policy on July 1, 2024\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>UPDATE ON LAPSED CERTIFICATION POLICY<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In the past, accumulating enough Continuing Dispatch Education (CDE) hours could be challenging. With literally hundreds of lessons and courses now available on the College of Emergency Dispatch, we\\u2019re proud to say that\\u2019s no longer the case.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>Effective July 1, 2024<\\/strong>, the IAED is eliminating its Lapsed Certification Policy. Formerly, this policy allowed for members to recertify after their membership had lapsed under certain circumstances, which included paying fees, taking new CDE courses, and taking recertification exams.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The removal of this policy simply means that every member who wishes to retain their certification must recertify before the expiration date. Failure to do so will result in the need for the member to retake the relevant certification course.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong>AS A REMINDER:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\\"wp-block-list\\\">\\n<li>Academy certification is valid for two years, unless revoked or suspended.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Recertification applications can be accepted as early as six months before expiration.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Auto-generated recertification reminder emails are sent out at regular intervals for the convenience of Academy Members.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Please make sure your email address is current in your Member Record.<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>While the Academy will make efforts to send out recertification reminders to all its members, it is ultimately the responsibility of the member to track their own expiration dates.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">We value the responsibility and accountability of our members. Thank you for your continued excellence and assuming the professionalism of maintaining one\\u2019s honored standing in such an important and life-sustaining role.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Effective July 1, 2024, the IAED is eliminating its Lapsed Certification Policy.<br \\/>\\nThe removal of this policy simply means that every member who wishes to retain their certification must recertify before the expiration date. Failure to do so will result in the need for the member to retake the relevant certification course.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-701\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>IAED Will Eliminate Its Lapsed Certification Policy on July 1, 2024 | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"IAED Will Eliminate Its Lapsed Certification Policy on July 1, 2024 | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Effective July 1, 2024, the IAED is eliminating its Lapsed Certification Policy. The removal of this policy simply means that every member who wishes to retain their certification must recertify before the expiration date. Failure to do so will result in the need for the member to retake the relevant certification course.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/B36C30C1-0608-44FD-8EFF-179B9CB2386B\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2024-01-22T15:36:37+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T07:38:56+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"2 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/B36C30C1-0608