, and Medical Disciplines\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/\",\"name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"description\":\"\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\",\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/78f3f0a0c1926ffac18f1d6e677dfe53866a9829e29e28b0c901eb48bc9dbad9?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/78f3f0a0c1926ffac18f1d6e677dfe53866a9829e29e28b0c901eb48bc9dbad9?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/78f3f0a0c1926ffac18f1d6e677dfe53866a9829e29e28b0c901eb48bc9dbad9?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"caption\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\"]}]}},\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/702\",\"targetHints\":{\"allow\":[\"GET\"]}}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/types\\/post\"}],\"author\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/users\\/1\"}],\"replies\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/comments?post=702\"}],\"version-history\":[{\"count\":2,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/702\\/revisions\"}],\"predecessor-version\":[{\"id\":2204,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/702\\/revisions\\/2204\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=702\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=702\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=702\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"702\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/E2D70224-3AFD-4CB7-B3CA-481B5F0EFF2B\",\"dest_id\":1207,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2023\\/11\\/16\\/e2d70224-3afd-4cb7-b3ca-481b5f0eff2b\\/\",\"title\":\"IAED Unveils Protocol 40 and Enhanced Protocols Across Police, Fire, and Medical Disciplines\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:54:45'),
(3723, 6, 'post', '703', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2', 'IAED Launches 911 Dispatcher Mentoring Program', 50, 'done', 1, 1208, '', '{\"id\":703,\"date\":\"2023-06-23T16:25:47\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-06-23T16:25:47\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T08:11:18\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T08:11:18\",\"slug\":\"15aa42c9-2d9f-43b2-9e6d-f8bbe7aaa2f2\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"IAED Launches 911 Dispatcher Mentoring Program\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong><em>To help address America\\u2019s growing 911 staffing crisis, IAED\\u2019s Mentor Program helps rookie dispatchers gain confidence and experience while being coached by a senior mentor<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><strong><em>June 22, 2023 (SALT LAKE CITY, Utah)\\u2014<\\/em><\\/strong>America\\u2019s 911 dispatchers are the \\u201cheroes on the headsets,\\u201d responding to millions of emergency calls across the United States every year. Yet there can be a steep learning curve for rookies on the job\\u2014one that results in newly hired 911 dispatchers leaving the job in significant numbers every year.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In response, and to help strengthen 911 dispatch centers across the country, the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch (IAED), which sets the best practices for emergency dispatch and response management around the world, today announced the U.S. launch of its highly regarded Emergency Medical Dispatcher (EMD) Mentor Certification Course. The course\\u2019s goal is to deepen experienced EMDs\\u2019 understanding of the IAEDs standards and protocols while giving them tools and teaching them to be excellent mentors and coaches. EMD Mentors then sit side-by-side with new EMDs and provide hands-on insights, feedback, and support during those critical first months at the console.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\u201cThe IAED is proud to set the standards for 911 protocols around the world, and the EMD Mentor Program is a natural extension of the best practices we are bringing into dispatch centers worldwide,\\u201d said IAED Board of Certification Chair Pam Stewart.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><u>According to a recent study<\\/u> jointly conducted by IAED and the National Association of State 911 Administrators (NASNA), one of the greatest challenges facing 911 centers today is adequate staffing. Many centers reported significant attrition as new hires faltered due to the stressful demands of the job. IAED\\u2019s Mentor course was specifically designed to address these issues and to support a one-on-one training approach for a faster and higher quality ramp-up for rookie dispatchers.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In one recent example, during the second call taken by a dispatcher who was new to the job, a man called 911, panicked and desperate for help. His wife was in active labor in their car on the side of the highway. With guidance and coaching from the experienced mentor, the new dispatcher was able to locate the caller using a mapping system to identify local landmarks.&nbsp;With the calm expertise of the senior mentor coaching the dispatcher through the call, the dispatcher gave directions to the man on how to deliver the baby safely while help was on the way. Within one minute of identifying the caller\\u2019s location, the baby was born in the car.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Said the rookie dispatcher after the fact: \\u201cMy mentor\\u2019s role in supporting and guiding me through this first-time experience allowed me, in turn, to support the caller, manage the patient condition and calm the caller\\u2019s anxiety.&nbsp;I would never have processed the call as smoothly or safely without the input from my mentor.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Another recent participant says she was quite daunted by the thought of putting everything she had learned into practice. \\u201cMy mentor was a dispatcher who had <em>years <\\/em>of experience. She was calm, quietly confident and reassuring when I needed her. She also knew when to push me to fly solo when I was ready.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Adds IAED\\u2019s Stewart: \\u201cWe are passionate about equipping our <em>first<\\/em>, first responders with the best practices, tools, and resources to deliver the highest standards in emergency dispatch services. We are proud to support the 911 profession by providing this vital mentoring course to help new EMDs gain experience, confidence, and ultimately contribute positively to the profession for years to come.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">To learn more about IAED\\u2019s 911 Emergency Medical Dispatcher Mentor Course email <a href=\\\"mailto:info@prioritydispatch.net\\\" style=\\\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\\\">info@prioritydispatch.net<\\/a>&nbsp;or download the&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch.widen.net\\/s\\/mk89w6tbbr\\/mentor-course-info-sheet\\\">info sheet<\\/a>.<br>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>As part of the growing 911 staffing problem, many 911 centers are experiencing significant attrition as new hires falter due to the stressful demands of the job. IAED\\u2019s Mentor course was specifically designed to address these issues and to support a one-on-one training approach for a faster and higher quality ramp-up for rookie dispatchers.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-703\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>IAED Launches 911 Dispatcher Mentoring Program | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"IAED Launches 911 Dispatcher Mentoring Program | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"As part of the growing 911 staffing problem, many 911 centers are experiencing significant attrition as new hires falter due to the stressful demands of the job. IAED\\u2019s Mentor course was specifically designed to address these issues and to support a one-on-one training approach for a faster and higher quality ramp-up for rookie dispatchers.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2023-06-23T16:25:47+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-19T08:11:18+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"3 minutes\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"IAED Launches 911 Dispatcher Mentoring Program\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2023-06-23T16:25:47+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-19T08:11:18+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":610,\\\"commentCount\\\":0,\\\"articleSection\\\":[\\\"Press Releases\\\"],\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CommentAction\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Comment\\\",\\\"target\\\":[\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\\\\\/#respond\\\"]}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/press-releases\\\\\\/15AA42C9-2D9F-43B2-9E6D-F8BBE7AAA2F2\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emer