y Response Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honors from the IAED | Emergency Dispatch\",\"og_description\":\"April 18, 2023 (DENVER, Col.) \\u2014 The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae (IAED), the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch services worldwide, today announced that seven emergency dispatch centers in Colorado, staffed by teams of medical, fire, police, and emergency nurse triage responders, have earned or re-earned IAED\\u2019s Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) designation.\",\"og_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/2B5E896F-D914-47DC-8D3B-304E6E2AD5A7\\/\",\"og_site_name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"article_published_time\":\"2023-04-18T15:43:39+00:00\",\"article_modified_time\":\"2026-10-19T07:47:10+00:00\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"twitter_card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter_misc\":{\"Written by\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"Est. reading time\":\"2 minutes\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/2B5E896F-D914-47DC-8D3B-304E6E2AD5A7\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/2B5E896F-D914-47DC-8D3B-304E6E2AD5A7\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\"},\"headline\":\"Seven Colorado Emergency Response Centers Earn \\u201cCenter of Excellence\\u201d Honors from the IAED\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-04-18T15:43:39+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19T07:47:10+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/2B5E896F-D914-47DC-8D3B-304E6E2AD5A7\\/\"},\"wordCount\":402,\"commentCount\":0,\"articleSection\":[\"Press Releases\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialA