(3730, 6, 'post', '710', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/press-releases/ACC055F6-BDE1-4769-B0FA-35528ADD0BF9', 'More than 1,500 U.S. Medical, Fire, and Police Emergency Response Leaders Are Gathered in Denver for IAED’s 2023 NAVIGATOR Convention', 50, 'done', 1, 1215, '', '{\"id\":710,\"date\":\"2023-04-18T15:11:42\",\"date_gmt\":\"2023-04-18T15:11:42\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/ACC055F6-BDE1-4769-B0FA-35528ADD0BF9\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T07:48:09\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T07:48:09\",\"slug\":\"acc055f6-bde1-4769-b0fa-35528add0bf9\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/ACC055F6-BDE1-4769-B0FA-35528ADD0BF9\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"More than 1,500 U.S. Medical, Fire, and Police Emergency Response Leaders Are Gathered in Denver for IAED\\u2019s 2023 NAVIGATOR Convention\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><i><strong>April 18, 2023 (DENVER, Colo.) <\\/strong><\\/i>\\u2014 More than 1,500 emergency response professionals are gathering in the Denver area from Tuesday through Thursday for the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u2019s annual <a style=\\\"color:#0563c1;text-decoration:underline;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/navigator.emergencydispatch.org\\/home\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#0070c0;\\\">NAVIGATOR<\\/span><\\/a> conference, the nation\\u2019s premier professional conference for medical, fire, and police dispatchers and secondary nurse triage providers.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Attendees will discuss a full range of hot topics including 911 workforce shortages, active shooters, electric car fires, callers experiencing mental health crises, and wellness for emergency responders.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">On Tuesday, the IAED is recognizing 87 call centers across the United States \\u2013 including seven in Colorado \\u2013 for earning the IAED Accredited Center of Excellence (ACE) credential. The ACE credential is based on completing a rigorous set of 20 Points of Accreditation in globally recognized best practices in emergency response.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The IAED also will bestow several prestigious awards, including North American 911 Dispatcher of the Year, North American 911 Instructor of the Year, and the Dr. Jeff J. Clawson Leadership Award.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The keynote presenter is U.S. Army veteran and <i>New York Times<\\/i> best-selling author J.R. Martinez, who was severely burned when his Humvee was struck by a roadside bomb while on patrol in Iraq. Martinez\\u2019s will focus on ways to remain resilient and optimistic amid life\\u2019s most difficult situations.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Attendees also have the opportunity to tour the Denver Health Paramedics Center.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">As a U.S.-based non-profit with worldwide reach, the IAED is the standard-setting organization for emergency dispatch and response services worldwide and is the leading body of emergency dispatch experts. Its boards and councils work on behalf of nearly 70,000 members in 59 countries \\u2014 and in coordination with other influential public safety organizations \\u2014 to ensure that the comprehensive system of emergency dispatching is safe, fast, effective, and cutting-edge. IAED protocols are used in more than 4,080 communications centers across the world and have been time-tested across hundreds of millions of calls for medical, fire, police, and nurse triage dispatching.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Learn more at <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.emergencydispatch.org\\\">www.emergencydispatch.org<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\\\">###<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Hot Topics Include Active Shooters, Mental Health, and 911 Staffing Strains<\\/p>\\n<p>April 18, 2023 (DENVER, Colo.) \\u2014 More than 1,500 emergency response professionals are gathering in the Denver area from Tuesday through Thursday for the IAED&#8217;s annual NAVIGATOR conference, the nation\\u2019s premier professional conference for medical, fire, and police dispatchers and secondary nurse triage providers.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[22],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-710\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-press-releases\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>More than 1,500 U.S. Medical, Fire, and Police Emergency Response Leaders Are Gathered in Denver for IAED\\u2019s 2023 NAVIGATOR Convention | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"More than 1,500 U.S. Medical, Fire, and Police Emergency Response Leaders Are Gathered in Denver for IAED\\u2019s 2023 NAVIGATOR Convention | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Hot Topics Include Active Shooters, Mental Health, and 911 Staffing Strains April 18, 2023 (DENVER, Colo.) \\u2