ered.com\\/news\\/press-releases\\/9B809273-8D16-4298-8350-6D424B780526\",\"dest_id\":1270,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2007\\/04\\/27\\/9b809273-8d16-4298-8350-6d424b780526\\/\",\"title\":\"2007 Dr. Jeff Clawson Leadership Award\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:02');
