(3792, 6, 'post', '773', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/official-statements/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11', 'New Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is Live!', 50, 'done', 1, 1277, '', '{\"id\":773,\"date\":\"2025-02-25T18:12:27\",\"date_gmt\":\"2025-02-25T18:12:27\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-16T10:51:19\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-16T10:51:19\",\"slug\":\"a52afdc4-05bc-4ccd-bb8f-32420965ec11\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/official-statements\\/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"New Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is Live!\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">We\\u2019re proud to announce that the new Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is live and ready to be used for all your course and certification needs.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/learn.emergencydispatch.org\\/\\\">EXPERIENCE THE NEW LEARNING PORTAL<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">IMPORTANT: CHANGES TO CDE REQUIREMENTS<\\/h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">We\\u2019re also announcing new CDE policies for recertification:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The Board of Certification has capped CDE requirements and collected them into full disciplines. For single disciplines, the cap is now 24 hours. This means that an EMD, EMD-Q, and EMD Mentor user would need 24 hours of CDE in a given two-year period. Recertification fees have not changed.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Each additional discipline is capped at 12 hours. This means that the most CDE a person with multi-discipline certification will need is 48 hours in a two-year period.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch.widen.net\\/s\\/rjrgms9wsp\\/recertification-cde-and-cost_revised_250221-2\\\">Click here for more information on this policy change.<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">A THANK YOU FROM THE ACADEMY AND PRIORITY DISPATCH<\\/h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">We appreciate your patience during this transition and policy change. We want to create the best possible experience for you and your teams. As you use the new Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal, we ask you to reach out to us with any questions, concerns, or suggestions for improvement.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Thank you,<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch and Priority Dispatch Corp.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/learn.emergencydispatch.org\\/\\\">EXPLORE THE NEW LEARNING PORTAL<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>We\\u2019re proud to announce that the new Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is live and ready to be used for all your course and certification needs.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[24,23],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-773\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-alerts\",\"category-official-statements\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>New Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is Live! | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"New Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is Live! | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"We\\u2019re proud to announce that the new Emergency Dispatch Learning Portal is live and ready to be used for all your course and certification needs.\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/official-statements\\/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2025-02-25T18:12:27+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-16T10:51:19+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"1 minute\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/official-statements\\\\\\/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/official-statements\\\\\\/A52AFDC4-05BC-4CCD-BB8F-32420965EC11\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"autho