urce_id\":\"779\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/official-statements\\/2013D491-5217-4F58-AFCB-38AA3DE90F4B\",\"dest_id\":1283,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2020\\/04\\/01\\/2013d491-5217-4f58-afcb-38aa3de90f4b\\/\",\"title\":\"Chest Compressions Protection in the COVID-19 Environment\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":2,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:04'),
(3799, 6, 'post', '780', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/official-statements/6B9645ED-1EBB-4E71-919C-A4493CA504C4', 'Novel Coronavirus from Wuhan City, China (2019-nCoV)', 50, 'done', 1, 1284, '', '{\"id\":780,\"date\":\"2020-02-11T00:00:00\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-02-11T00:00:00\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/6B9645ED-1EBB-4E71-919C-A4493CA504C4\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2020-02-11T00:00:00\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2020-02-11T00:00:00\",\"slug\":\"6b9645ed-1ebb-4e71-919c-a4493ca504c4\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/official-statements\\/6B9645ED-1EBB-4E71-919C-A4493CA504C4\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Novel Coronavirus from Wuhan City, China (2019-nCoV)\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>### Media Release IAED CBRN Fast Track Committee The novel coronavirus originating from Wuhan City, China has now spread to several dozen countries, including localities in North America, Europe, Asia, and the Australasian region. This virus has caused concern among global health authorities since it is believed to have recently jumped from animals to humans and there are now confirmed cases of human-to-human transmission &#8211; making it potentially very dangerous in human populations since there is currently no vaccine and little or no immunity. Coronavirus is a species of virus that has several potentially deadly strains, including past spread of SARS-CoV (Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome) and MERS-CoV (Middle East Respiratory Syndrome). Known symptoms of the illness include fever, difficulty breathing, cough, and other milder respiratory symptoms such as sneezing. ###&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>IAED Recommendations: Emergency dispatch agencies should immediately contact their EMS system&#8217;s medical control authority and local public health department for direction on implementing enhanced screening of emergency medical callers and providing responding crews with early notification of symptomatic patients so proper personal protective equipment (PPE) can be used by all providers with close patient contact, along with isolation and special transport procedures, when necessary. The IAED has specific instructions for dispatch agencies and screening tools for both ProQA (software) users of the MPDS, as well as non- users. Please use the link below to access the latest information:<br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.prioritydispatch.net\\/software-download-request?utm_source=emergencydispatch&amp;utm_medium=officialstatement&amp;utm_id=novelcoronavirus\\\">Request Latest Information<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>The IAED is continuously monitoring the progress of the novel coronavirus (2019-nCoV). Please check this site regularly for updates. **For more public health information and guidance for 911 and first responders, please check for updates on the following web links:**<br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.cdc.gov\\/coronavirus\\/2019-ncov\\/index.html\\\">www.cdc.gov\\/coronavirus\\/2019-ncov\\/index.html<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.who.int\\/emergencies\\/diseases\\/novel-coronavirus-2019\\\">www.who.int\\/emergencies\\/diseases\\/novel-coronavirus-2019<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.ems.gov\\/\\\">www.ems.gov<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.911.gov\\/\\\">www.911.gov<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch-media.s3.amazonaws.com\\/emergencydispatch.org\\/coronavirus\\/Novel_Coronavirus_from_Wuhan_City,_China_-2019-NCOV.pdf\\\">Download Original Statement<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>If you\\u2019re not currently an IAED member agency using MPDS or ProQA, the Emerging Infectious Disease Surveillance Tool for Coronavirus, SRI, MERS, and Ebola is available FREE OF CHARGE under a limited use agreement with the Academy. Click button for a downloadable PDF.<br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/prioritydispatch-media.s3.amazonaws.com\\/prioritydispatch.net\\/pdf\\/NAE-EIDS_Tool_v6-0-0.pdf\\\">Download EIDS Tool to Screen for Coronavirus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\\u062a\\u0635\\u0631\\u064a\\u062d \\u0628\\u0634\\u0623\\u0646 \\u0643\\u0648\\u0631\\u0648\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0641\\u0627\\u064a\\u0631\\u0648\\u0633<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Declaraci\\u00f3n sobre el coronavirus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Comunicado sobre coronav\\u00edrus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">D\\u00e9claration sur le coronavirust<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Prane\\u0161imas d\\u0117l koronaviruso<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Kenyataan mengenai coronavirus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Coronavirus verklaring<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\\u65b0\\u578b\\u51a0\\u72b6\\u75c5\\u6bd2\\u58f0\\u660e<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\\u65b0\\u578b\\u51a0\\u72c0\\u75c5\\u6bd2\\u8072\\u660e<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">B\\u1ea3ng Tuy\\u00ean B\\u1ed1 V\\u1ec1 Coronavirus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Stellungnahme zum Coronavirus<\\/a><br \\/><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Dichiarazione sul coronavirus<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>The novel coronavirus originating from Wuhan City, China has now spread to several dozen countries, including localities in North America, Europe, Asia, and the Australasian region. This virus has caused concern among global health authorities since&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[23],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-780\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-official-statements\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Novel Coronavirus from Wuhan City, China (2019-nCoV) | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Novel Coronavirus from Wuhan City, China (2019-nCoV) | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"The novel coronavirus originating from Wuhan City, China has now spread to several dozen countries, including localities in North America, Europe, Asia, and the Australasian region. This virus has caused concern among global health authorities since...\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/official-statements\\/6B9645ED-1EBB-4E71-919C-A4493CA504C4\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2020-02-11T00:00:00+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summa