8\\/ef7e8c2c-0c65-4fcb-9741-72703707224a\\/\",\"title\":\"Official Academy Position MPDS Stroke Diagnostic Tool Use and Rationale\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:06'),
