":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/posts\\/794\\/revisions\\/1982\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=794\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"category\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/categories?post=794\"},{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=794\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"794\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/alerts\\/3E5F2A84-DA19-450D-9418-EC76E14348D6\",\"dest_id\":1298,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2022\\/08\\/08\\/3e5f2a84-da19-450d-9418-ec76e14348d6\\/\",\"title\":\"OUTEC Course No Longer Mandatory for Recertification\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:08'),
(3814, 6, 'post', '795', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/alerts/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA', 'New from Dr. Clawson: How &#8220;Black Lives Matter&#8221; and Should Reinforce our Values in the Realm of Emergency Dispatch', 50, 'done', 1, 1299, '', '{\"id\":795,\"date\":\"2020-09-22T00:00:00\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-09-22T00:00:00\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-16T11:57:37\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-16T11:57:37\",\"slug\":\"ff170161-20f3-414e-87f8-f5e9fe4712ca\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/alerts\\/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"New from Dr. Clawson: How &#8220;Black Lives Matter&#8221; and Should Reinforce our Values in the Realm of Emergency Dispatch\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">As emergency dispatchers, we have been given a physical \\u201cleg up\\u201d in the long fight against racism\\u2014we can\\u2019t, while on-duty, currently see the caller, patient, or victim. In this regard, emergency dispatchers are \\u201ccolorblind.\\u201d However, simply because we can\\u2019t see the calltaker doesn\\u2019t completely eliminate the possibility of implicit biases influencing our actions. Any number of nonvisual cues, such as an ethnic-sounding name, the location of an incident, or accent or dialect, could be enough to trigger some preconceived notions about callers or the nature, severity, or veracity of their emergencies. As the first first responder, it is a must that we put on our professional, emotional \\u201cblinders\\u201d at the calltaking console. Race, color, socioeconomic status, disability, gender, sexual preferences, mental effects, and other related areas of \\u201cperceived\\u201d differences must never be allowed to play a part in the structured process we follow in service to all our clients\\u2014the calling public. In fact, research demonstrates that, with adequate compliance, a protocol-driven process in emergency dispatch can help dispatchers in providing equitable services to callers. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/iaedjournal.org\\/ask-doc\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Read the full article<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>As emergency dispatchers, we have been given a physical &#8220;leg up&#8221; in the long fight against racism\\u2014we can\\u2019t, while on-duty, currently see the caller, patient, or victim. In this regard, emergency dispatchers are \\u201ccolorblind.\\u201d However, simply because we can\\u2019t see&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[24],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-795\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-alerts\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>New from Dr. Clawson: How &quot;Black Lives Matter&quot; and Should Reinforce our Values in the Realm of Emergency Dispatch | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"New from Dr. Clawson: How &quot;Black Lives Matter&quot; and Should Reinforce our Values in the Realm of Emergency Dispatch | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"As emergency dispatchers, we have been given a physical &quot;leg up&quot; in the long fight against racism\\u2014we can\\u2019t, while on-duty, currently see the caller, patient, or victim. In this regard, emergency dispatchers are \\u201ccolorblind.\\u201d However, simply because we can\\u2019t see...\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/alerts\\/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2020-09-22T00:00:00+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-16T11:57:37+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"1 minute\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/alerts\\\\\\/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/alerts\\\\\\/FF170161-20F3-414E-87F8-F5E9FE4712CA\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"New from Dr. Clawson: How &#8220;Black Lives Matter&#8221; and Should Reinforce our Values in the Realm of Emergency Dispatch\\\",\\\"datePu