ch\",\"og_description\":\"The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch\\u00ae has released Medical v14.0.548 (11\\/14\\/2024) with many significant updates approaching a full version release. Included are extensive revisions to Protocol 24: Pregnancy\\/Childbirth\\/Miscarriage, that enable more specific neonatal patient care and fine-tuned responses based on gestation.\",\"og_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/77F0ACE0-55A2-45B1-9C44-498AA6B8773C\\/\",\"og_site_name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"article_published_time\":\"2024-12-04T19:24:14+00:00\",\"article_modified_time\":\"2026-10-19T10:05:27+00:00\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"twitter_card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter_misc\":{\"Written by\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"Est. reading time\":\"1 minute\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/77F0ACE0-55A2-45B1-9C44-498AA6B8773C\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/77F0ACE0-55A2-45B1-9C44-498AA6B8773C\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\"},\"headline\":\"The IAED is Pleased to Announce the Release of MPDS v14.0.358 in ProQA v5.1.1.51\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-12-04T19:24:14+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19T10:05:27+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/77F0ACE0-55A2-45B1-9C44-498AA6B8773C\\/\"},\"wordCount\":68,\"commentCount\":0,\"articleSection\":[\"Protocol Updates\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/77F0ACE0-55A2-45B1-9C44-498AA6B