(3850, 6, 'post', '833', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/protocol-updates/5BAC7A4A-E607-4E93-BE12-80C8B49041C7', 'IAED is pleased to Announce the release of ECNS v5.3', 50, 'done', 1, 1335, '', '{\"id\":833,\"date\":\"2024-06-13T20:42:14\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-06-13T20:42:14\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/5BAC7A4A-E607-4E93-BE12-80C8B49041C7\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T10:25:35\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T10:25:35\",\"slug\":\"5bac7a4a-e607-4e93-be12-80c8b49041c7\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/5BAC7A4A-E607-4E93-BE12-80C8B49041C7\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"IAED is pleased to Announce the release of ECNS v5.3\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Version 5.3 of the Emergency Communications Nurse System<sup>TM&nbsp;<\\/sup>(ECNS<sup>TM<\\/sup>) protocols have been released, including updates to:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ol class=\\\"wp-block-list\\\">\\n<li>Current protocol question text<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Protocol question clinical rationale<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Protocol question logic<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Existing recommended care levels<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Existing interim care instructions<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Updated dispositions<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">ECNS v5.3 also includes the addition of new:<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ol class=\\\"wp-block-list\\\">\\n<li>Protocol questions<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Interim care instructions<\\/li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Protocol question clinical rationale<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Version 5.3 of the Emergency Communications Nurse SystemTM (ECNSTM) protocols are ready for release with many updates as well as the addition of new protocol questions, interim care instructions, and protocol question clinical rationale.<\\/p>\\n\",\"pr