(3853, 6, 'post', '836', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/protocol-updates/31B24C81-3C41-42B6-88F1-B6849FDBAB34', 'The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch announces the release of Protocol 41: Caller in Crisis (1st Party Only) with MPDS v14.0.222 (6/7/2024)', 50, 'done', 1, 1338, '', '{\"id\":836,\"date\":\"2024-06-13T19:31:50\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-06-13T19:31:50\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/31B24C81-3C41-42B6-88F1-B6849FDBAB34\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-19T10:03:24\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-19T10:03:24\",\"slug\":\"31b24c81-3c41-42b6-88f1-b6849fdbab34\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/31B24C81-3C41-42B6-88F1-B6849FDBAB34\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"The International Academies of Emergency Dispatch announces the release of Protocol 41: Caller in Crisis (1st Party Only) with MPDS v14.0.222 (6\\/7\\/2024)\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">In response to the alarming rise in mental health distress calls to 911 \\u2013 specifically suicide calls \\u2013 the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch are pleased to announce the release of&nbsp;Protocol 41:&nbsp;Caller in Crisis (1st&nbsp;Party Only)&nbsp;with MPDS v14.0.222 (6\\/7\\/2024). This protocol and its accompanying specialized training are the first and only in the industry to address first-person callers with suicide risk and ideation. Currently only available in English. &nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>In response to the alarming rise in mental health distress calls to 911 \\u2013 specifically suicide calls \\u2013 the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch are pleased to announce the release of Protocol 41: Caller in Crisis (1st Party Only) with MPDS v14.0.222 (6\\/7\\/2024). Currently only available in English.<\\/p>\\n\",\"pr