\/01\\/30\\/e798bd83-606a-48ef-999b-f49539e29866\\/\",\"title\":\"IAED Releases Version 13.1 of Emergency Medical Protocol\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:22');
