| Emergency Dispatch\",\"og_description\":\"Practically as soon as the new Guidelines for CPR and Emergency Cardiovascular Care (ECC) were released by the American Heart Association (AHA) on October 18, 2010, the telephone and e-mail inquiries to the International Academies of Emergency...\",\"og_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/0AC642C1-0525-4853-AA6A-31BF9E43B32E\\/\",\"og_site_name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"article_published_time\":\"2010-10-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"article_modified_time\":\"2026-10-19T10:30:05+00:00\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"twitter_card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter_misc\":{\"Written by\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"Est. reading time\":\"10 minutes\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/0AC642C1-0525-4853-AA6A-31BF9E43B32E\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/0AC642C1-0525-4853-AA6A-31BF9E43B32E\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\"},\"headline\":\"Update! The New 2010 CPR Guidelines and the MPDS\",\"datePublished\":\"2010-10-28T00:00:00+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19T10:30:05+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/0AC642C1-0525-4853-AA6A-31BF9E43B32E\\/\"},\"wordCount\":2108,\"commentCount\":0,\"articleSection\":[\"Protocol Updates\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/protocol-updates\\/0AC642C1-0525-4853-AA6A-31BF9E43B32E\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/pr