 middle-aged man called 911 Sunday after wandering off of Berger Avenue...\",\"og_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/\",\"og_site_name\":\"Emergency Dispatch\",\"article_published_time\":\"2012-10-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"article_modified_time\":\"2026-10-16T10:29:29+00:00\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"twitter_card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter_misc\":{\"Written by\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"Est. reading time\":\"2 minutes\"},\"schema\":{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\"},\"headline\":\"Technology Aids in Rescuing Disoriented Man\",\"datePublished\":\"2012-10-08T00:00:00+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-16T10:29:29+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/\"},\"wordCount\":393,\"commentCount\":0,\"articleSection\":[\"Agency News\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/F39DF3E3-4D43-40C5-8B06-1C31219D075D\\/\",\"name\":\"Technology Aids in Rescuing Disoriented Man | Emergency Dispatch\"