(3907, 6, 'post', '891', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/agency-news/14363202-A204-42F2-940B-FE9D85CA4775', 'Aspirin Diagnostic Lauded', 50, 'done', 1, 1392, '', '{\"id\":891,\"date\":\"2010-10-01T00:00:00\",\"date_gmt\":\"2010-10-01T00:00:00\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/14363202-A204-42F2-940B-FE9D85CA4775\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-16T10:39:19\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-16T10:39:19\",\"slug\":\"14363202-a204-42f2-940b-fe9d85ca4775\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/14363202-A204-42F2-940B-FE9D85CA4775\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Aspirin Diagnostic Lauded\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Mo. dispatch to tell chest pain callers: take aspirin\\\\ By Susan Weich and Mark Schlinkmann\\\\ St. Louis Post-Dispatch\\\\ Nov. 21, 2007\\\\ Copyright 2007 St. Louis Post-Dispatch, Inc.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">ST. CHARLES COUNTY, Mo. &#8211; Take one aspirin and wait for the ambulance. That\\\\&#8217;s the advice 911 callers with chest pain may get in St. Charles County starting Dec. 1, and dispatching services in other parts of the area are considering following suit. While the aspirin direction isn\\\\&#8217;t surprising, it is new for St. Charles County dispatchers, who usually tell patients to refrain from taking over-the-counter medications or eating or drinking anything before paramedics arrive.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The new instruction was issued recently by the National Academies of Emergency Dispatch, a medically approved agency that provides guidelines for what dispatchers say. Aspirin helps improve blood flow to the heart in patients experiencing any acute coronary syndrome, said Dr. Jeff Clawson, co-founder of the national group. See the story posted&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.ems1.com\\/products\\/dispatchequipment\\/articles\\/319247\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">click here<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Mo. dispatch to tell chest pain callers: take aspirin<\\/p>\\n<p>ST. CHARLES COUNTY, Mo. &#8211; Take one aspirin and wait for the ambulance.<br \\/>\\nThat&#8217;s the advice 911 callers with chest pain may get in St. Charles<br \\/>\\nCounty starting Dec. 1, and dispatching services&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[27],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-891\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-agency-news\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Aspirin Diagnostic Lauded | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Aspirin Diagnostic Lauded | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Mo. dispatch to tell chest pain callers: take aspirin  ST. CHARLES COUNTY, Mo. - Take one aspirin and wait for the ambulance. That&#039;s the advice 911 callers with chest pain may get in St. Charles County starting Dec. 1, and dispatching services...\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/14363202-A204-42F2-940B-FE9D85CA4775\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<met