{\"taxonomy\":\"post_tag\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/tags?post=894\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}', '{\"source_id\":\"894\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/376C5B41-46AE-41AB-8EB3-4FA84BA864F0\",\"dest_id\":1395,\"dest_url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/rnd\\/2010\\/05\\/16\\/376c5b41-46ae-41ab-8eb3-4fa84ba864f0\\/\",\"title\":\"Dispatcher Stays On Line with Fire Victim\",\"author\":\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\",\"featured\":\"\",\"inline_images\":0,\"failed_images\":0,\"reused_images\":0,\"comments\":0,\"terms\":1,\"builders\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"fidelity\":\"rendered\",\"failed_urls\":[]}', '2026-10-21 06:55:26'),
(3911, 6, 'post', '895', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/agency-news/C2F92CDB-545C-44FF-BA68-9551EB5D15E0', 'Greenwood Honors E-911 Staff During National Appreciation Week', 50, 'done', 1, 1396, '', '{\"id\":895,\"date\":\"2010-04-13T00:00:00\",\"date_gmt\":\"2010-04-13T00:00:00\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/C2F92CDB-545C-44FF-BA68-9551EB5D15E0\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-16T10:34:54\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-16T10:34:54\",\"slug\":\"c2f92cdb-545c-44ff-ba68-9551eb5d15e0\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/C2F92CDB-545C-44FF-BA68-9551EB5D15E0\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Greenwood Honors E-911 Staff During National Appreciation Week\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Greenwood, S.C.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">When there is a crisis, local residents are often forced to pick up the phone and dial 911.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The voice on the other end of the phone could literally be a lifesaver.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">This week is one in which those voices are honored.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">April 11-17 is National Public Safety Telecommunications Week. Emergency telecommunications workers from across the nation will be honored for their work throughout the week.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">\\\\&#8221;This is a week set aside nationally to celebrate dispatchers and call takers with 911,\\\\&#8221; said Kim Douglas, assistant director of E-911 communications in Greenwood. \\\\&#8221;Here in Greenwood, we have a staff of 25, with four to five people on a shift at a time.\\\\&#8221;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.indexjournal.com\\/articles\\/2010\\/04\\/11\\/news\\/b041210%20911.txt\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Click here to read more<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Greenwood, S.C.<\\/p>\\n<p>When there is a crisis, local residents are often forced to pick up the<br \\/>\\nphone and dial 911.<\\/p>\\n<p>The voice on the other end of the phone could literally be a lifesaver.<\\/p>\\n<p>This week is one in which those voices are honored.<\\/p>\\n<p>April&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[27],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-895\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-agency-news\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Greenwood Honors E-911 Staff During National Appreciation Week | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Greenwood Honors E-911 Staff During National Appreciation Week | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Greenwood, S.C.  When there is a crisis, local residents are often forced to pick up the phone and dial 911.  The voice on the other end of the phone could literally be a lifesaver.  This week is one in which those voices are honored.  April...\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/C2F92CDB-545C-44FF-BA68-9551EB5D15E0\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" conte