(3915, 6, 'post', '899', 'https://emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com/news/agency-news/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217', 'Just Another Night at Elgin Dispatch Center', 50, 'done', 1, 1400, '', '{\"id\":899,\"date\":\"2010-04-10T00:00:00\",\"date_gmt\":\"2010-04-10T00:00:00\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/in-the-news\\/uncategorized\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\/\"},\"modified\":\"2026-10-16T10:35:41\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2026-10-16T10:35:41\",\"slug\":\"4276b59d-a15c-480a-8796-d08113c85217\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"post\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Just Another Night at Elgin Dispatch Center\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">Elgin, Ill.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">The most urgent call to the Elgin 911 dispatch center on a recent Friday night was an \\\\&#8221;attempt to locate\\\\&#8221; request from the Bartlett police.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">A car registered in Elgin was found burning in that village, and officers there needed to track down the owner. Between officers on the street and dispatch operators in Elgin, it took more than a half hour to find the owner at work and tell the young man that the car he thought was parked outside his work place actually was now gutted in Bartlett.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\">It was a typical Friday night in Elgin, said Jennifer Phillips, emergency dispatch coordinator at the Elgin Police Department.<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Elgin, Ill.<\\/p>\\n<p>The most urgent call to the Elgin 911 dispatch center on a recent Friday<br \\/>\\nnight was an &#8220;attempt to locate&#8221; request from the Bartlett police.<\\/p>\\n<p>A car registered in Elgin was found burning in that village, and<br \\/>\\nofficers there needed to&#8230;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":1,\"featured_media\":0,\"comment_status\":\"open\",\"ping_status\":\"open\",\"sticky\":false,\"template\":\"\",\"format\":\"standard\",\"meta\":{\"_acf_changed\":false,\"footnotes\":\"\"},\"categories\":[27],\"tags\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-899\",\"post\",\"type-post\",\"status-publish\",\"format-standard\",\"hentry\",\"category-agency-news\"],\"acf\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.7 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/product\\/yoast-seo-wordpress\\/ -->\\n<title>Just Another Night at Elgin Dispatch Center | Emergency Dispatch<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"noindex, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:locale\\\" content=\\\"en_US\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"article\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"Just Another Night at Elgin Dispatch Center | Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"Elgin, Ill.  The most urgent call to the Elgin 911 dispatch center on a recent Friday night was an &quot;attempt to locate&quot; request from the Bartlett police.  A car registered in Elgin was found burning in that village, and officers there needed to...\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:url\\\" content=\\\"https:\\/\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\/news\\/agency-news\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\/\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"og:site_name\\\" content=\\\"Emergency Dispatch\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:published_time\\\" content=\\\"2010-04-10T00:00:00+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta property=\\\"article:modified_time\\\" content=\\\"2026-10-16T10:35:41+00:00\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"author\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"twitter:label1\\\" content=\\\"Written by\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data1\\\" content=\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:label2\\\" content=\\\"Est. reading time\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<meta name=\\\"twitter:data2\\\" content=\\\"1 minute\\\" \\/>\\n<script type=\\\"application\\/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"yoast-schema-graph\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\\",\\\"@graph\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\\\\\/#article\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"webdev@oozlemedia.com\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/#\\\\\\/schema\\\\\\/person\\\\\\/338f35ee363eca7c9019764391474b5a\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Just Another Night at Elgin Dispatch Center\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2010-04-10T00:00:00+00:00\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-10-16T10:35:41+00:00\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\\\\\/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":117,\\\"commentCount\\\":0,\\\"articleSection\\\":[\\\"Agency News\\\"],\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CommentAction\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Comment\\\",\\\"target\\\":[\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\\\\\/#respond\\\"]}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-8796-D08113C85217\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/emergencydistg.wpenginepowered.com\\\\\\/news\\\\\\/agency-news\\\\\\/4276B59D-A15C-480A-879